window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4101,"title":"Chapter 4101: Birthday Party (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4101: Birthday Party (10)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You!” The empress dowager was so angry that she almost fainted. “This is outrageous! Nameless, take her down! If she resists, kill her!” The empress dowager said something very harsh.","But to kill her without hesitation... Everyone looked at one another in bewilderment.","Judging by the empress dowager’s attitude toward Feng Wu, she didn’t like Feng Wu at all. No, she hated Feng Wu to the core!","Would Feng Wu really become the crown prince’s wife?","Immediately, families like the Gudu family began to have different ideas. They gloated at Feng Wu’s predicament.","Nameless was the empress dowager’s guard and a junior Spiritual Saint.","A few months ago, Princess Yan Ling came to the Junwu Empire to make a scene, and Feng Wu was the one who fought her. Both of them were peak Spiritual Overlords, so the empress dowager knew that Nameless would have no problem catching Feng Wu.","The empress dowager wasn’t the only one who thought that way. Almost everyone else thought the same.","“Xiao Wii!”","“Watch out!”","“Let me!”","Chaoge, Feng Xun, and Xuan Yi stepped out, ready to fight the empress dowager with her.","However, Feng Wu only smiled. She glanced at the empress dowager and asked casually, “Your Majesty, is that junior Spiritual Saint all you’ve got?”","What was that supposed to mean?!","Was she looking down on him?","The empress dowager was so angry that she snorted at Feng Wu. “A junior","Spiritual Saint is more than enough to handle you!”","The others couldn’t understand why Feng Wu was still provoking the empress dowager at a time like this. Was it going to work? Someone tried to persuade","Feng Wu to apologize to the empress dowager.","However, Nameless was already behind Feng Wu.","Nameless, the junior Spiritual Saint, was moving so fast that other people couldn’t see him clearly, but Feng Wu could.","To Feng Wu, Nameless was moving in slow motion.","Not only was Feng Wu able to dodge him, but she had also used the momentum to lift Nameless up into the air!","“Argh!” Nameless screamed.","Feng Wu didn’t throw Nameless away. Instead, she raised him over her head while she stood there steadily. She then looked at the empress dowager with a half-smile on her face.","Her face went ghastly pale..","This shouldn’t have happened.","How could that happen?!","Wasn’t Nameless a junior Spiritual Saint?","In the Junwu Empire, junior Spiritual Saints were already very terrifying, and there were very few of them. That was why Spiritual Saints were said to be so superior.","Even the emperor treated them with respect.","“Your cultivation level...” The empress dowager stared at Feng Wu. ‘What level are you now?!”","Feng Wu then tossed Nameless in the empress dowager’s direction as if she was throwing a bag of rice. She clapped her hands and said casually, “Nameless isn’t enough. Do you have more?”","The empress dowager gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu.","Nameless was the only Spiritual Saint the empress dowager could find. To be honest, Spiritual Saints were very rare and arrogant. It was almost impossible to recruit them. Therefore, the empress dowager only had one Spiritual Saint.","“Is that it?” Feng Wu sounded sorry. “I’m so disappointed.. Your Majesty, don’t you think so?”"]},{"number":4102,"title":"Chapter 4102: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4102: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager stared at Feng Wu and gritted her teeth. “What level are you now? What level are you?!!","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m only an intermediate Spiritual Saint. What’s that look on your face, empress dowager? Do you think I’m too powerful?”","An intermediate Spiritual Saint?","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. An intermediate Spiritual Saint? Her? How was that even possible?","Mrs. Dugu couldn’t believe it and wouldn’t accept it either. She murmured, “An intermediate Spiritual Saint? Her? Is she really an intermediate Spiritual Saint?”","Lady Tao was equally surprised. “Gosh, she’s already an intermediate Spiritual Saint? Last time I saw her, she was only a Spiritual King... How did she become an intermediate Spiritual Saint in a year?”","The others all stared at Feng Wu in astonishment. They drew in their breaths and didn’t know what to say. Even the empress dowager was shocked.","No one made a sound.","But the empress dowager would be so humiliated.","Seeing the look on the empress dowager’s face, Lady Northern Feng couldn’t help but smile bitterly. What was the empress dowager thinking? Feng Wu would be such a wonderful granddaughter-in-law, but the empress dowager was still shouting at her.","The problem was that the empress dowager wasn’t capable enough to be so arrogant. Her best guard was only a junior Spiritual Saint. She made it sound like a junior Spiritual Saint was so common when they were very rare!","However, the empress dowager had brought Lady Northern Feng up. Although the empress dowager had become unreasonable recently, Lady Northern Feng still had feelings for her. She smiled bitterly and tried to make an excuse for the empress dowager.","“Xiao Wu, what are you talking about? Since the Junwu Empire has such a capable girl, of course, the empress dowager is happy. She’s the most respected woman in the empire, and she is so happy for you!”","Lady Northern Feng went up to the empress dowager and steadied her. She then said in a low voice, “It’s getting late, and His Majesty will be worried if you stay here for too long. Let me take you back to the palace.”","Lady Northern Feng was the empress dowager’s goddaughter and had always considered herself a daughter figure. However, the empress dowager threw off Lady Northern Feng’s hand this time and glared at her.","“I don’t need your help!","“Have you forgotten? I told you before that if you were close to Feng Wu, you shouldn’t have me as your godmother! Let me ask you now. Are you with them or on my side?!”","Lady Northern Feng was speechless.","She looked at the empress dowager in resignation and didn’t know what to say. Everyone here could see that Feng Wu was an intermediate Spiritual Saint.","“Mother...” Lady Northern Feng heaved a sigh.","The empress dowager glared at her. “I knew it! You’re with her now. If that’s the case, stay out of my way. You’re not my goddaughter anymore!”","Before Lady Northern Feng could say anything, the empress dowager announced that she and Lady Northern Feng were no longer mother and daughter. From now on, Lady Northern Feng was only Lady Northern Feng and had nothing to do with the empress dowager anymore!","The others were astonished again.","What was going on? Something big happened again? Lady Northern Feng had been removed from the empress dowager’s family member list before Feng Wu was done?"]},{"number":4103,"title":"Chapter 4103: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu frowned a little. She had never met such an unreasonable old lady before! What did Lady Northern Feng do to deserve the empress dowager’s attitude?","Lady Northern Feng didn’t want Feng Wu to create any more trouble, so she shook her head at her.","“But...” Feng Wu felt very guilty.","Lady Northern Feng shook her head with a wry smile. She then knelt down and kowtowed to the empress dowager three times to thank the old lady for bringing her up.","The empress dowager stared at Lady Northern Feng. “Fine! Fine! From now on, you’ll go your own way and stick with this girl. She’ll take your life sooner or later! ”","After that, the empress dowager turned to leave.","Just then, they heard laughter. “Your Majesty, please wait.”","That voice... Feng Wu frowned a little. Why did that sound so familiar?","Turning her head, she smiled bitterly. Weren’t they going to let her spend her birthday in peace?","It was none other than Master Yun of the Firmament Palace.","Back then, because Feng Wu’s cultivation ability was destroyed, Master Yun chose Zuo Qingluan as her final pupil. Ever since then, their positions had changed.","When the conflict between Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan escalated, the old palace master was on Zuo Qingluan’s side, and she had helped Zuo Qingluan time and time again. She was either targeting Feng Wu or trying to assassinate Jun Linyuan.","And now, she was back in the imperial capital in front of Feng Wu.","Staring at the old master of Firmament Palace, Feng Wu frowned.","Master Yun of the Firmament Palace was staring at Feng Wu as well. She narrowed her eyes and looked intrigued.","“It’s been a while, kiddo.” The old palace master greeted Feng Wu with a smile, but the smile didn’t reach her eyes, which gave her a gloomy look.","Feng Wu stared at Master Yun and raised her eyebrows. “It’s been a while.”","Last time in Northern Yan, Feng Wu was too weak to take part in the battles of the Spiritual Saint stage. Now, she was finally an intermediate Spiritual Saint. Although she was only a Level-5 Spiritual Saint, she had the capability of a Level-7 one.","Such an outstanding cultivator was already an uncommon sight on this continent. Therefore, Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated when she looked at Master Yun.","The empress dowager waved at Master Yun with a smile. “You’re finally here. I’ve been waiting for you.”","Feng Wu stared at the empress dowager. Had the empress dowager invited Master Yun here?","As expected, the empress dowager took Master Yun’s hand and sounded reassured. “I thought it would take you at least a few hours to get here. I didn’t expect you to arrive so soon. Have you made some progress?”","The empress dowager chatted with Master Yun as if no one was around, but Master Yun didn’t seem to find it strange at all. She smiled and said, “I was just lucky. I just happened to arrive at the imperial capital.”","“Where’s that girl, Qingluan? Why didn’t you bring her here? I haven’t seen her since the last time we met. I had some misunderstanding about her and said some harsh words, but I misunderstood her when I heard what the traitor said. It was all my fault.”","The empress dowager looked guilty. “The more I think about it, the more I like the idea of Qingluan becoming Junjun’s wife. Don’t you think so?” When the empress dowager tried to negotiate, no one could say no.","When Jun Linyuan was involved, no one could say no.."]},{"number":4104,"title":"Chapter 4104: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Yun looked at the empress dowager and said, “Therefore, Your Majesty, you were tricked by the woman’s sweet talk and made the wrong judgment. Of course, it wasn’t your fault. You can only blame the woman for being too evil.” Master Yun glanced at Feng Wu as if telling everyone that she was referring to the latter.","“But it’s great that Her Majesty the empress dowager can recognize the culprit and make the right choice again, be it for the royal family or the empire,” said","Master Yun with a smile. “As for Qingluan, she’s still receiving her inheritance. She’ll come back after she’s done.”","“Inheritance? What inheritance?”","The empress dowager was going to leave, but she was surprised when she heard how much Master Yun praised Zuo Qingluan.","“Of course, it’s the legacy of the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace.” Master","Yun glanced at Feng Wu with a half-smile and said in satisfaction, “The Matriarch of the Firmament Palace has woken up. She’s an existence that surpasses the Spiritual Saint stage.”","Everyone was astonished.","Someone that had surpassed the Spiritual Saint stage?!","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes as well. Beyond the Spiritual Saint stage? All the senior brothers she had met before were all of that stage, weren’t they? However, they were all big shots and the pillars of their respective empires. Therefore, the founder of the Firmament Palace was indeed a very capable figure.","If Zuo Qingluan really inherited the Matriarch’s power, she would be so much more capable.","“So, what level is that girl of the Zuo family now?” The empress dowager enjoyed taking revenge on Feng Wu.","Master Yun smiled. “An intermediate Spiritual Saint, I guess. She’s doing alright.”","Doing alright?","Was she joking?","Feng Xun was astonished.","Master Yun looked at Feng Wu and stressed each word. “So, Miss Feng Wu, you have to give me something now.”","Feng Wu stared at her with a half-smile. “Really? What is it?”","Master Yun said, “Your Divine Phoenix Blood.”","“With your Divine Phoenix Blood, Qingluan will become a divine lady. Are you going to give it to her or not?” Master Yun smiled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu’s pupils contracted. She glanced at the empress dowager. “Did you invite her here?”","The empress dowager only smirked.","Master Yun smiled. “Since I’m invited and I came to you myself, are you going to give me the Divine Phoenix Blood or not?” Feng Wu chuckled. “Are you kidding me?”","Master Yun said in a serious tone, “No.”","Feng Wu smiled, but it didn’t reach her eyes.","Master Yun said, “I see that you don’t want to give it to me.”","Feng Wu had been preparing for this. Hearing what Master Yun said, she nodded. “So what? Are you going to force me in front of everyone?”","Master Yun didn’t retort. She only said, “Qingluan needs it urgently, so I’m afraid you’ll have to put up with her.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Back then, Zuo Qingluan took my True Phoenix Blood and exchanged it for her own. Now that I have the Divine Phoenix Blood, she’s trying to take it from me. She’s not talented enough, so she’s been coveting other people all the time.. How can you say it out loud? Is that what Firmament Palace does?”"]},{"number":4105,"title":"Chapter 4105: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4105: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The head of the Firmament Palace smirked. “Well, you’re not capable enough.","You still have to give in when you’re faced with absolute power.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Really?”","The head of the Firmament Palace shouldn’t have done that, but she nodded with a smirk. “Yes.”","As soon as she said that, she leaped up and charged at Feng Wu at a frightening speed.","She was a Level-5 Spiritual Saint.","She was indeed an intermediate Spiritual Saint.","“Shit!” Feng Xun cried out inwardly.","The head of the Firmament Palace was unbelievably powerful. There was nothing he could do to help Feng Wu. What should he do?","Feng Xun wasn’t the only one who was nervous.","Those who had a good impression of Feng Wu felt their hearts skip a beat.","“The master of the Firmament Palace has crossed the line!” “How could she do that?!”","“Go tell His Majesty that something big has happened!”","Some cried out, some ran out to search for help, and some stumbled back, fearing that they might be implicated.","Feng Wu’s birthday party was going to be a boisterous one.","At that critical moment, Feng Wu made her move.","No one knew how she did it, but they all saw that the master of the Firmament","Palace seemed to have been slowed down.","As for Feng Wu...","She drew out her Fallen Star Sword.","Swordplay of the World!","Several people were surprised when they saw Feng Wu’s swordplay.","Long Yanyi, the head of Dragon Valley.","The head of the Dugu family.","As well as the other family heads.","They all stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","The head of the Firmament Palace also stared at Feng Wu so hard that her eyes popped. That was how shocked she was.","“The Swordplay of the World? Where did you learn it? Who taught you?!” She cried out in surprise.","Feng Wu smiled. Who taught her that? Of course, it was her third senior brother, but she wasn’t going to tell Master Yun. She only cast a cold glance at the woman and struck out with her Fallen Star Sword again.","The first strike, the second, the third...","The swordplay became faster and faster until it looked like a black hole that could devour everything.","Master Yun was very confident when she wasn’t fighting at first, but once she started fighting, she lost all her confidence because Feng Wu was suppressing her.","When Feng Wu used the ninth stance of Swordplay of the World...","With Feng Wu’s Fallen Star Sword in front of her and the whirlpool behind her, Master Yun was in a sorry state. She tried to run away several times, but Feng Wu kept catching up with her.","Everyone watched this in disbelief...","“Is it true? How’s that possible? I don’t believe it! Feng Wu is after the master of the Firmament Palace!”","“Why won’t I believe it? Feng Wu is a junior Spiritual Saint at most. How can she do it?”","“Feng Wu... Has Feng Wu reached this stage already? How... has this world gone insane?” Gongsun Qing was mumbling to herself.","It had only been a few years since Gongsun Qing and Feng Wu got into Imperial College together.","It hadn’t been two years, and Gongsun Qing was still the same.. She was still in the same cultivation stage... She was still a poor Spiritual Grandmaster, but what about Feng Wu?"]},{"number":4106,"title":"Chapter 4106: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4106: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had risen from the Spiritual Master stage to the Spiritual Elder stage, then the Spiritual Lord stage, then the Spiritual King stage, then the Spiritual Overlord stage, then the Spiritual Overlord stage, then the Spiritual Saint stage... Gongsun Qing couldn’t begin to imagine how many stages she had gone through.","Her eyes widened, and her heart raced. She couldn’t believe that she had gotten into Imperial College together with Feng Wu. She had even considered herself to be Feng Wu’s enemy...","Recalling the stupid things she had done, Gongsun Qing wished she could dig a hole and hide in it.","Meanwhile, Long Yanyi, the head of Dragon Valley, rose to his feet in excitement and stared at Feng Wu.","Last time at the banquet, the girl wasn’t his match when she fought Princess Yan Ling, but now, Long Yanyi wasn’t her match anymore. The stark contrast took Long Yanyi by surprise.","Long Yanyi wasn’t the only one who was shocked. The head of the Dugu family felt the same way, but unlike Long Yanyi, who was a kind man, the head of the Dugu family was filled with jealousy.","Right now, Feng Wu had no idea how shocking her cultivation level was. All she cared about was the master of the Firmament Palace.","Once upon a time, Master Yun was like an immeasurable mountain to her, someone she could only look up to. However, now that Feng Wu had risen to a Level-5 Spiritual Saint, she looked down upon the head of the Firmament","Palace.","Whoosh!","There was a flash of light.","As everyone watched in astonishment, the Fallen Star Sword pierced the master of the Firmament Palace in the heart.","Everyone’s head went blank, including the master of the Firmament Palace.","She lowered her head and stared blankly at the sword that had pierced her heart. She then looked down at Feng Wu. Her pupils contracted, and she was trembling from head to toe. She couldn’t believe her eyes.","She couldn’t believe it...","She...","“You...” She opened her mouth, but no words would come out.","She looked down at the sword that had pierced her heart.","Finally, she looked up at Feng Wu again and came back to herself.","She wanted to step back, but as soon as she did, the Fallen Star Sword in Feng Wu’s hand turned her in the chest.","Blood gushed out as the sword was drawn out.","Pressing her chest, Master Yun gritted her teeth and turned to flee, but Feng Wu wouldn’t give her that chance.","No one saw how Feng Wu moved, but when they looked closely, they saw that Master Yun seemed to be trapped in a transparent cage. She wanted to get out but couldn’t break the shield. She was anxious, but there was nothing she could do.","Pressing a hand on her chest. she stumbled around. trying to find a wav Oilt-","She looked like a prisoner on the verge of death, but there was no way out.","She only accepted the fact that she was going to die when she swayed so hard that she almost fell to the ground.","Gritting his teeth, she stared at Feng Wu. “What level are you now? What’s that","‘Swordplay of the World’ about? What’s your relationship with Master Chu","Tianxiao? How did you do it? Tell me!”","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile.. “Do you want to know?”"]},{"number":4107,"title":"Chapter 4107: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4107: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The head of the Firmament Palace stared at Feng Wu, hoping that she could answer his question.","However, Feng Wu only smiled. “How can I possibly answer your question? I’d rather die than make you a fool.”","Master Yun was astonished.","Feng Wu chuckled. ‘What did I do? Am I supposed to be merciful to someone who wants to destroy me? I’m not a saint!”","Master Yun knew perfectly well that Feng Wu would never forgive her.","“You want to kill me? Hahaha...” She stumbled back and forth as blood gushed out of her mouth. “It won’t be that easy!","“Qingluan will kill you for me! She’ll take revenge for me!”","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile. “I’ve killed her master, so why should I be worried about her? Master Yun, goodbye.”","After that, Feng Wu raised her hand, and the next second, the shield exploded.","Master Yun, who had been severely injured by Feng Wu, was pulverized.","Back in Northern Yan, she had ambushed Jun Linyuan on behalf of the head of the Zuo family. Three Spiritual Saints joined hands and almost drove Jun Linyuan crazy. Feng Wu still remembered that.","Therefore, she had killed the head of the Firmament Palace this time.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes when she saw the blood clots on the ground. She felt great to have her revenge.","However, the looks the others gave her had changed completely.","At first, when the empress dowager scolded her, Feng Wu’s supporters broke into a cold sweat. Feng Wu’s enemies were all gloating over her predicament, but as soon as Feng Wu made her move, they knew how capable she was.","Seeing that Feng Wu had insulted the empress dowager and killed the head of the Firmament Palace, Lady Wang almost choked... Fear filled her.","She and Feng Sang looked at each other and both saw fear in each other’s eyes. Both covered their chests and looked away... That was so scary! Their hearts were beating so fast!","The empress dowager was the most astonished of them all.","The empress dowager’s first move was Granny Gui, and Feng Wu kicked her away without hesitation.","The second move was Nameless, and Feng Wu threw him away.","The third move was the master of the Firmament Palace.","The empress dowager had indeed used a secret signal to bring the head of the Firmament Palace here. Otherwise, the empress dowager was worried that the emperor’s people would stop her from taking Feng Wu away. But now, Feng Wu had killed Master Yun.","The empress dowager sat there with a grim look on her face and didn’t Know what to do next.","She looked at Lady Northern Feng, hoping that the lady would give her an excuse so that she could go back to the imperial palace as soon as possible. Lady Wang wasn’t the only one who was scared. As the empress dowager, she was equally nervous...","When Feng Wu stared at her with her piercing black eyes, the empress dowager had the feeling that Feng Wu wanted to throttle her.","It had to be an illusion... She was the empress dowager!","However, the empress dowager’s eyes were twitching, but Lady Northern Feng kept her astonished gaze on Feng Wu.. She never looked back at the empress dowager, which infuriated her..."]},{"number":4108,"title":"Chapter 4108: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4108: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, hasty footsteps came from outside.","“Mother, stop!”","Emperor Wu’s voice arrived before he did.","Duan Chaoge had run to Emperor Wu for help when she saw how the master of the Firmament Palace was bullying Feng Wu.","Duan Chaoge made it sound so serious that she almost said that the master of the Firmament Palace was going to stab Feng Wu in the chest. Emperor Wu was really anxious. After all, he knew his mother very well. When she was really willful, nothing could stop her.","However, when Emperor Wu arrived with a group of people, trying to save Feng Wu from the empress dowager...","However, what Emperor Wu saw when he arrived wasn’t as miserable as he had expected.","Looking from the ground at the pale-faced empress dowager and the indifferent Feng Wu, he was confused. What was going on?","After taking care of the head of the Firmament Palace, Feng Wu turned around and nodded at Emperor Wu. She then smiled at the empress dowager.","The empress dowager’s stomach lurched when she saw the look in Feng Wu’s eyes, and she looked away involuntarily.","But the empress dowager soon came back to herself. That wasn’t right. She was the empress dowager and had never been intimidated by anyone. Why was she so scared of Feng Wu now?","Hence, she turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu used to respect the empress dowager for she was Jun Linyuan’s grandmother, and she had tolerated the willful empress dowager over and over again. However, as a result, the empress dowager was able to do whatever she wanted.","Therefore, Feng Wu wasn’t going to let her have her way anymore. She said indifferently, “Is that all the help you’ve hired?”","That contemptuous tone almost gave the empress dowager a heart attack. Granny Lan’s stomach lurched, and she cursed inwardly.","She had a bad feeling because the empress dowager had been the one who had forced Feng Wu to fight back, which was enough to prove that Feng Wu still tolerated the empress dowager.","But Feng Wu wasn’t going to back off now. She had provoked the empress dowager, which meant that she was taking the initiative.","Of course, the empress dowager could sense it.","She gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu. “She’s crossed the line! She really has!”","The empress dowager turned around and glared at Emperor Wu. “You’ve brought her up! Look what she’s like now! Not only did she talk back to me, but she has also insulted me on purpose! Is that even allowed?!”","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","The empress dowager went on. “I’m not only the empress dowager, but I’m also Junjun’s grandmother, the one who brought him up. She’s not even married yet, but she’s already so disloyal! Are you really going to make her the crown prince’s wife?!”","Emperor Wu felt a headache coming on. Why was he here?","Sigh.","Emperor Wu sighed inwardly, but he still had to solve the problem.","He was already in poor health, and he looked even paler now.","He went up to the empress dowager with a wry smile and said, “Mother, let’s go back to the palace.”","As for the empress dowager’s accusation, Emperor Wu pretended that he didn’t hear her.","Many people were shocked by Emperor Wu’s attitude.."]},{"number":4109,"title":"Chapter 4109: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (8)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Was Emperor Wu going to let Feng Wu go just like that? Why didn’t he blame Feng Wu? Wasn’t Emperor Wu supposed to be the empress dowager’s most filial son?","Or did Emperor Wu think more highly of Feng Wu than the empress dowager did? No, that wasn’t possible. Many people shook their heads.","The empress dowager was dumbfounded as well. She stared at Emperor Wu.","However, Emperor Wu only said, “Mother, let’s go back to the palace.”","Emperor Wu then held the empress dowager’s arm.","The empress dowager’s face turned livid.","This was outrageous! Not only was Junjun on Feng Wu’s side, but even the emperor was on her side! What kind of a person was she?! At that thought, the empress dowager glared at Feng Wu and hated her to the bone!","Emperor Wu wanted to keep things quiet, so the empress dowager had to be sensible, no matter how reluctant she was. However...","Things didn’t always go as planned, such as now.","“You want to leave after killing someone from my Firmament Palace?” A cold voice rang out.","The voice reminded one of a fiend from hell, and it kept resonating in people’s heads, making them shudder.","Everyone opened their eyes wide and looked around, but no one was there.","It was as if that person was intimidating them from a very faraway place.","Because of that, it was even more terrifying.","“It’s the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace!” The empress dowager realized what had happened and cried out.","The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu as she spoke, and she didn’t try to hide her satisfaction at Feng Wu’s predicament.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and smiled. “Master Yun wants to give my Divine Phoenix Blood to Zuo Qingluan. Your Majesty, do you think that’s just?” The empress dowager didn’t know what to say.","However, the cold voice only smirked. “We want to take your Divine Phoenix Blood, and that’ll be it. Fighting will be your original sin.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s a bold statement.”","The cold voice said, “You’re not capable enough to speak! Die!”","After that, the dark energy of death descended from above and charged at Feng wu!","“Watch out!” Feng Xun panicked.","The Patriarch of the Firmament Palace had gone too far. She was going to kill Xiao Wu to get their dignity back. That was why she was so merciless!","Feng Wu quickly ran out of the main hall and into the spacious courtyard.","However, the black vortex followed her everywhere.","“I didn’t expect you to be able to dodge that strike. I see that you’ve become a Spiritual Saint in a few years because of the Divine Phoenix Blood.” The cold voice was filled with excitement and greed.","Feng Wu even had a feeling that Zuo Qingluan didn’t really need her Divine Phoenix Blood. It was what the Matriarch wanted.","Moreover, she had said it aloud.","Naturally, the Matriarch was infuriated.","She had surpassed the Spiritual Saint stage... What kind of an existence was that? Before, people had only been imagining it, but now, they knew.","Even Emperor Wu couldn’t intervene in a battle like this.","“Die!” The Matriarch flew into a rage out of humiliation.","A gilded “kill” enlarged before it fell.","It wanted to crush Feng Wu!"]},{"number":4110,"title":"Chapter 4110: Clouds follow Dragons Wind follow Tigers(9)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The words rolled down so fast!","Emperor Wu cursed inwardly.","“Stop!”","Many people were nervous, and some gloated inwardly, but what they thought never happened.","That was because...","Just when the word was about to crush Feng Wu, a streak of light exploded from Feng Wu’s body, shattering the word.","“Linghu, how dare you sabotage my plan!” An angry voice rang out.","Master Linghu’s voice came from afar as well. “Do you dare to come to the imperial capital?”","Neither of them had shown up in their real forms. They had exchanged blows from afar, but it was very easy to tell who was stronger.","Emperor Wu let out a breath of relief.","Luckily, Master Linghu was here to hold down the fort. Otherwise, these","monsters would destroy the foundation of the empire.","Only then did Emperor Wu realize that this was a world where only the strong were respected, and sovereigns came second.","It was just that the powerful cultivators were hidden behind the scenes, and the emperor was in charge of maintaining order. For a moment, Emperor Wu was both glad and disappointed.","The empress dowager couldn’t understand it. She looked around, trying to find traces of the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace.","After exchanging a blow, with Master Linghu, the Matriarch never made another sound.","Was she going to give up just like that? The empress dowager was displeased.","Emperor Wu sighed inwardly when he saw the empress dowager’s reaction and recalled what he had told earlier about Feng Wu killing Master Yun of the Firmament Palace.","Feng Wu had grown into a great tree, and the empress dowager was still trying to take her down. She was asking for trouble. Emperor Wu decided that he would communicate with the empress dowager after he took her back home. If she wouldn’t listen, he would send her away.","“Back to the palace!” Emperor Wu glanced at the empress dowager, and his tone had never been so serious.","The guests all dropped to their knees to see Emperor Wu off.","Once Emperor Wu was gone, they would go back to their own residences. However, what happened today made them realize how capable Feng Wu really","was.","However...","Things didn’t end there because someone else arrived.","“Why are you all here? Even the emperor isn’t in his own palace.” A cheerful voice rang out.","A teenager rode a giant beast and flew toward them from afar, followed by eight servants.","They were more like guards than servants.","All eight guards were capable cultivators. One look and Feng Wu could tell that they were all Spiritual Saints.","The leader of the team was at least a peak Spiritual Saint. It was even possible that he had surpassed the Spiritual Saint stage because Feng Wu couldn’t tell how capable he really was. All she knew was that his cultivation level was unfathomable.","They were riding giant beasts that had never existed on this continent, and each beast was a powerful Spiritual Saint. They were so powerful that it made one despair.","The Spiritual Saints’ intimidating energy almost made the people of the Junwu Empire drop to their knees.","Only influential families in the imperial capital could attend a birthday party like this, and they were considered top-notch cultivators in the Junwu Empire. However, they felt defeated and had to flee for their lives.."]},{"number":4111,"title":"Chapter 4111: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4111: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (10)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Who are you people?!”","It wasn’t the right time for Emperor Wu to speak, so Lord Mu, Emperor Wu’s confidant, spoke instead.","Other people might not recognize them, but Feng Wu did.","She had met these people when she was in the Dongsang Kingdom, and they were all with Yan Yu. However, there were a lot of them back then, but now, there were only nine of them.","The nine of them almost crushed the Junwu Empire cultivators.","They were still hovering in mid-air and looking down at the most respected people of the Junwu Empire. To them, these people were as petty as ants. It was as if they could crush them with a stomp of their feet.","“Young General, there’s no need to waste your breath on them. Just kill them all.” The teenager’s men didn’t even try to lower their voices.","Young General? Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. So, this man was a young general in the Dayan Empire? Did he come here with Yan Yu?","“Which family’s young general?” Feng Wu asked.","“The young general of the Yi family.” The teenager raised his eyebrows when he saw Feng Wu’s face and teased her. “You’re a pretty girl. Are you engaged?” How frivolous!","Feng Wu straightened her face and asked coldly, “Are you from the Dayan Empire?”","With a wave of his hand, Young General Yi and his men landed with their mounts. Jumping off, Young General Yi walked toward Feng Wu. He then stopped in front of Feng Wu with a condescending smile on his face.","Feng Wu didn’t like this condescending attitude, so she asked coldly, “Are you really from the Dayan Empire?”","“Yes.” The teenager smiled at Feng Wu.","“Why are you here?” Feng Wu asked directly.","“Well...” Rubbing his chin, the teenager turned around and looked at the crowd.","However, he no longer had that smile on his face when he looked at Feng Wu.","Instead, he looked cold and cruel, and there was a murderous look in his eyes.","Those he glanced at felt a chill run down their spines, and they were only centimeters away from death.","“To harvest, of course.” The teenager turned to Feng Wu with a smile. “You have wheat here, don’t you? It’s like harvesting wheat when it’s ripe.","Understand?”","Ordinary people might not understand it, but the upper echelon of the Junwu Empire did.","By “harvesting”, the Dayan Empire didn’t mean harvesting wheat. They were going to harvest human heads.","The teenager stopped looking at Feng Wu and went up to Emperor Wu.","He stared at Emperor Wu and smirked. “Judging by your attire, are you the king of this small Junwu Kingdom?”","From the emperor of the Junwu Empire to the king of a small Junwu Empire... One could only imagine how frustrated Emperor Wu was.","However, his opponent was simply too intimidating, and everyone could sense the threat.","By then, many capable cultivators had arrived at Emperor Wu’s side to protect him.","They had been hiding in the dark all this time, but now, they had all shown up.","Feng Wu looked around and saw that Emperor Wu was quite resourceful. He had seven Spiritual Saints with him, and they were all quite capable.."]},{"number":4112,"title":"Chapter 4112: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (11)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4112: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (11)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu looked around and saw that Emperor Wu was quite resourceful. He had seven Spiritual Saints with him, and they were all quite capable.","But Feng Wu wasn’t sure.","Not only did the enemy have nine Spiritual Saints, but they also had nine Spiritual Saint mounts. Moreover, Yan Yu also had a large group of Spiritual Saints. The Dayan Empire had sent an army of Spiritual Saints.","The teenager glanced at the cultivators around Emperor Wu and asked, “What’s that supposed to mean? Are we going to start a war?”","Seeing so many capable cultivators, Lord Mu was filled with confidence. He stepped forward and stared at Young General Yi. “What does the Dayan Empire want?”","He wasn’t the only one who was so confident. The others were thrilled to see the row of Spiritual Saints around Emperor Wu. They all rubbed their hands together, thinking that Emperor Wu and the Dayan Empire would be a worthy rival.","But Emperor Wu wasn’t so sure.","He threw a dirty look at Lord Mu, telling him to stay out of it.","However, it was obvious that Lord Mu was blinded by all the Spiritual Saints, and he gloated. “What do you mean by ‘harvest’? What on earth do you want...” However, Lord Mu’s eyes widened before he could finish.","Young General Yi suddenly reached out, grabbed Lord Mu by the throat, and picked him up.","As a lord and Emperor Wu’s favorite subject, Lord Mu wasn’t the most superior figure in the empire, but now, he was being picked up by Young General Yi of the Dayan Empire like a chicken.","“Let... go...”","Only then did he realize that Young General Yi wasn’t joking. He really could kill him.","Would he kill Lord Mu?","Many people found it impossible.","As overbearing as the Dayan Empire was, Lord Mu was still Emperor Wu’s subject, so the Dayan Empire had to show him some respect.","Even Emperor Wu thought the same.","Although Feng Wu had left him a message earlier, saying that the Dayan Empire wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire, Emperor Wu wasn’t completely convinced.","“Let him go.” Emperor Wu stared at Young General Yi with a grim look in his eyes.","But to everyone’s surprise, Young General Yi was so ferocious!","He didn’t let go of Lord Mu.","Not only wouldn’t he let go of the lord, but he was also going to kill the latter.","Crack...","There was the sound of breaking bones.","Broken bones?!","The larynx...","Feng Wu rushed to his side and saw with her own eyes that Lord Mu’s neck had been snapped... His head had fallen to his chest, and he was dead.","There was dead silence all around.","Everyone was astonished.","How was that even possible?!","That should never have happened!","But it just happened!","That was the famous Lord Mu!","“Argh!! Lady Mu screamed and passed out.","That scream woke everyone up. They looked at each other and saw fear in each other’s eyes.."]},{"number":4113,"title":"Chapter 4113: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (12)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4113: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (12)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","A chill ran down their spines.","The empress dowager, who was a few steps away, swayed when she saw this and almost fainted with Lady Mu.","That was so cruel!","That was unbelievable!","Emperor Wu looked up and stared at Young General Yi. “How dare you?!”","Young General Yi gave Emperor Wu an innocent look. “Why wouldn’t I dare?","That’s so strange.”","Emperor Wu was so angry that he trembled and felt a chill run down his spine.","Jun Linyuan would be upset at him all the time, and Emperor Wu would tremble from anger. But now, Emperor Wu missed Jun Linyuan, his talented son.","Young General Yi glanced at the people behind Emperor Wu, then at everyone else.","Everyone were already in awe of him, but now, they were terrified.","He had killed Lord Mu without hesitation, which meant that they were no more than ants to him. However, there was nothing Emperor Wu could do about it.","Emperor Wu stared at Young General Yi.","Young General Yi suddenly smiled and said to Emperor Wu, “I counted just then. There are quite a few of you, and ten of you are above the Spiritual Saint stage. Fine. Since this is the first time we’re harvesting, we’ll cut down the number. We’ll only take seven.”","Emperor Wu paled even more.","It wasn’t that he hadn’t heard Young General Yi, but he didn’t dare to listen... The empress dowager asked in a trembling voice, “What... do you mean?”","Young Master Yi glanced at the empress dowager and said in a serious tone,","“Don’t you know what I mean? Do you need me to explain it to you?”","The empress dowager said, “Explain yourself.”","Young General Yi said arrogantly, “Fine. Since you don’t understand, I’ll cut to the chase. What I’m saying is that you ten Spiritual Saints should cut off seven of your heads, and I’ll take them with me. That way, this harvest will be over and you’ll have a year of peace. What do you think?”","The empress dowager almost fainted.","Young Master Yi’s attention was indeed on the empress dowager now. He smiled at her and said, “It seems that the old woman has an idea. What do you think?”","An old woman? The empress dowager almost fainted when she heard that.","How dare he!","Many people wanted to laugh when they heard that, but they couldn’t.","Feng Wu was the only one who chuckled.","In the silence, Feng Wu’s laughter was especially conspicuous. Everyone looked in her direction and even Young General Yi couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu lowered her head and pretended that nothing had happened.","The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu and clenched her fists. She wouldn’t let Feng Wu get away with this! Never!","The empress dowager looked at Young Master Yi. “Did you just say that I’ll be the one to choose?”","Young Master Yi nodded.","The empress dowager suddenly smiled. “Young General Yi, have you heard of the Divine Phoenix Blood?”","Young General Yi’s eyes lit up a little. “This is great! Amazing! A genius like that is more useful than a hundred other cultivators of the same level put together.”","The empress dowager nodded. “We have a Spiritual Saint here with the Divine Phoenix Blood.. Do you think she’s worth six ordinary Spiritual Saints?”"]},{"number":4114,"title":"Chapter 4114: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (13)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Mother! Emperor Wu’s face was livid, and he scolded the empress dowager loudly!","However...","He didn’t seem to be as intimidating as before, at least not to the empress dowager.","The empress dowager was thrilled.","She felt that she was doing something great for the Junwu Empire.","Hence, the empress dowager told Young General Yi in satisfaction, “She’s a Spiritual Saint with the Divine Phoenix Blood. Kill her. According to you, she’s worth a hundred Spiritual Saints.”","“Mother!” Emperor Wu tugged at the empress dowager and bellowed, “What are you talking about?!”","“Your Majesty!”","The empress dowager was displeased as well. She stared at Emperor Wu and said, “Are you out of your mind? Didn’t you hear what the young general said? He’s from a superior empire and is here to kill powerful cultivators. What are you going to do about the seven Spiritual Saints? Are you going to kill them","Emperor Wu’s face turned livid.","The empress dowager said, “Or should we choose from the influential families? The Long family? The Dugu family? The Gongsun family? Should each family sacrifice a Spiritual Saint?”","Emperor Wu’s face darkened.","The empress dowager said angrily, “I won’t let you do it even if you want to! These are the foundations of the Junwu Empire! We can’t afford to lose any of them!”","Emperor Wu said angrily, “Does Xiao Wu deserve to be sacrificed?!”","The empress dowager said, “What choice do I have, then? Do you think I want to? I don’t want to, but what’s going on here? She can make up the remaining six places all by herself. Who else can we choose? Just tell me!”","Emperor Wu clenched his fists in frustration. His head was spinning, and he thought he was going to pass out.","“No! Absolutely not!” Emperor Wu gritted his teeth. “Even if I’m dead, nothing can happen to Xiao Wu! We can’t sacrifice her!”","“Are you crazy or something?” The empress dowager was furious at Emperor Wu’s stubbornness. “Do you know what you’re talking about? Are you really going to harm the entire Junwu Empire? Or are you in love with her?!”","“Mother, what are you talking about?!” Emperor Wu was furious. “She’s Junjun’s love of life. If Junjun knows what happened today, he’ll lose his mind! He really will!”","At the thought of Jun Linyuan, the empress dowager was much less intimidating, but she still wouldn’t admit it. “Didn’t I say that I would marry Zuo Qingluan to Junjun? The feelings of a young man are fleeting. As time goes by, everything will pass, including Junjun.”","“Junjun is different!” Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say to make the empress dowager understand. Jun Linyuan’s feelings for Feng Wu were completely different. If he really sacrificed Feng Wu today, Jun Linyuan would tear down the entire Junwu Empire when he came back.","While Emperor Wu and the empress dowager were bickering, Young Master Yi crossed his arms and watched with a smile.","“Have you made up your mind?” Young Master Yi prompted them with a grin.","Although he was smiling, everyone knew that he was a merciless killer.","The empress dowager spoke first. “It’s been decided. Take her away and do whatever you want with her.”","“No!” Emperor Wu took a deep breath as if he had made a difficult decision. “If you want to harvest someone, do it with me. Let Xiao Wu go.”","“Have you lost your mind?!”","The empress dowager glared at him.."]},{"number":4115,"title":"Chapter 4115: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (14)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4115: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (14)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She could live with the idea of sacrificing seven Spiritual Saints, but why would Emperor Wu do that?","“Because...” Emperor Wu smiled bitterly.","Because he recalled what Feng Wu told him once.","He finally knew that the Dayan Empire didn’t want the seven Spiritual Overlords but the entire Junwu Empire.","He didn’t want to live to see such a cruel thing happen.","“Take me.” Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “If you have to take someone.”","Young General Yi looked at Emperor Wu in surprise. It had never occurred to him that the emperor of the Junwu Empire would sacrifice himself to save other people. That was unbelievable.","However...","“If that’s the case, I can do it.” Young Master Yi nodded at Emperor Wu.","“No!” The empress dowager rushed to Emperor Wu’s side and spread out her arms, protecting him like a mother hen. “We can’t sacrifice the emperor!","Never!”","The others also knelt down and pleaded not to take Emperor Wu away.","Young Master Yi chuckled and gave the empress dowager a sidelong glance. “If Emperor Wu can’t do it, I can always choose you.”","The empress dowager looked astonished.","Staring at the empress dowager, Young Master Yi gave her a half-smile. “Do you want to do it instead?”","The empress dowager froze on the spot as if she was dumbfounded.","Young Master Yi darted a contemptuous look at the empress dowager and smirked. “If you can’t bring yourself to die, stop acting like you’re in charge of everything! You’re not in charge here!”","The empress dowager went scarlet in the face, but she didn’t dare to retort.","With a wave of his hand, Young General Yi said, “That’s enough. Take Emperor","Wu away.”","Soon, someone came up to fetch Emperor Wu. However, Feng Wu stepped out and shouted, “Wait!”","With a wave of Young General Yi’s hand, the man stopped and glanced at Feng wu.","Staring at Feng Wu, Young Master Yi smiled. “Kiddo, if you want to trade someone for your emperor, you can always do that. Since you’re so pretty, I’ll take you whoever you want.”","Feng Wu glanced at the empress dowager, and the latter blanched.","The empress dowager’s stomach lurched. Was this girl going to abuse her power for personal revenge?","“How dare you!” The empress dowager bellowed.","Feng Wu smirked. “Didn’t Her Majesty say that she was so nice to His Majesty and that she loved the people more than her own children? What? You don’t want to make a little sacrifice?”","The empress dowager said, “You!”","Feng Wu waved her off. “Of course, I’m not you. I won’t do such a thing.”","Feng Wu turned to Young General Yi. “Release His Majesty.”","Young Master Yi said, “Kiddo, you can’t take advantage of your good looks. Yes, you’re very pretty, but you can’t do whatever you want like this.” Feng Wu stared at Young General Yi. “I said, let His Majesty go.”","Young Master Yi said, “What if... I just won’t?”","Feng Wu smiled. “I won’t be so nice, then. ”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Young Master Yi almost laughed. “You’re only a Level-5 Spiritual Saint. Do you know what I am? How dare you challenge me?”","Feng Wu said solemnly, “His Majesty has done me a great favor. I have to return it. Even if I can’t defeat you, I still have to fight you..”"]},{"number":4116,"title":"Chapter 4116: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (15)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4116: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (15)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Young General Yi was still smiling. “I’m not competing with you in ordinary challenges. If you want to fight, fight for real.”","Feng Wu immediately said, “Alright.”","Young General Yi narrowed his eyes. “I’m talking about a fight-or-die battle!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright!”","It was rare for Young General Yi to be so serious. Keeping his face straight, he studied Feng Wu with his sharp eyes, trying to figure out why she was so confident.","“How dare a mere Level-5 Spiritual Saint challenge me? That’s preposterous.” Young Master Yi stared at Feng Wu. “But I can send someone to fight you. Situ","Nanbo!”","“Yes,” said Situ Nanbo.","Young General Yi said to Feng Wu, “Situ Nanbo, a Level-6 Spiritual Saint. If you can defeat him, you’ll be exempted.","“Don’t think that I’m taking advantage of you by having a Level-6 Spiritual","Saint fight you. In fact, Situ Nanbo is already the weakest member of this team. We can’t find anyone weaker.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Young General Yi said to Situ Nanbo, “There’s no need to show mercy. Just kill her. You’ll be rewarded!”","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Before, Young General Yi seemed to treat Feng Wu differently, but now, it seemed that he wanted to kill Feng Wu... The people of the Dayan Empire were indeed very ferocious.","“Go ahead.” Feng Wu stared at Situ Nanbo and was ready for battle.","Situ Nanbo stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in his eyes. The next second, he rose to his feet.","Thump, thump, thump!","Situ Nanbo was indeed relentless. There was nothing fancy about his moves, but they were all simple and efficient.","His attack was straightforward, expansive, and powerful!","Feng Wu was a Level-5 Spiritual Saint, and many people were worried about her. Although Feng Wu had fought Nameless and Master Yun in a row, Situ Nanbo of the Dayan Empire was obviously more difficult to handle now.","But Feng Wu knew perfectly well that Situ Nanbo wasn’t her match.","She could kill Situ Nanbo in ten strikes, but in the end, Feng Wu still decided to hide some of her strength.","The battle lasted for 50 rounds before the winner was determined.","Feng Wu swiped her Fallen Star Sword across the air, and Situ Nanbo spat out a mouthful of blood.","Whoosh!","Blood gushed out like a fountain.","Young General Yi’s face darkened.","“Situ Nanbo, you’ve lost! Back off!” Young Master Yi bellowed.","Holding his throat, Situ Nanbo threw a dirty look at Feng Wu before going back to his team.","Apart from Young General Yi and Situ Nanbo, all other members of the Dayan Empire stared at Feng Wu with cold eyes.","They didn’t expect the Junwu Empire to have such a capable cultivator. She actually dared to kill a member of the Dayan Empire.","If Young General Yi hadn’t shouted in time, Feng Wu would have pierced Situ Nanbo’s throat by now. Even God wouldn’t have been able to save him then. “Young General, I’m Gud Mornin! Please let me fight!”","Gud Mornin? That was such an awkward name that Feng Wu couldn’t help but look at the person.","It was a middle-aged man with a dark face. He was as stalwart as an iron tower and looked like a strong warrior.","Young General Yi darted a look at Gud Mornin and remained silent.","All Feng Wu needed to do now was stall.."]},{"number":4117,"title":"Chapter 4117: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (16)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4117: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (16)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She had sent Feng Xiaoqi to get Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin usually followed Feng Wu around, but Feng Wu didn’t know where he was this morning, so Feng Xiaoqi went to look for him. If they could find him, they might be able to solve the problem today.","Although Feng Wu didn’t know where she got her confidence from, she knew it.","Therefore, she put her bet on Luo Zilin.","All she needed to do now was stall.","Gud Mornin asked for another battle.","Young General Yi stared at Feng Wu. “Gud is a Level-7 Spiritual Saint. Do you dare to fight him?”","Everyone drew in their breaths. A Level-7 Spiritual Saint? What kind of a cultivator was that?","Emperor Wu blanched again and stopped Feng Wu. “You’re not his match. Stop fighting.”","Everyone thought that Feng Wu wouldn’t be his match.","As a matter of fact, it made sense.","Feng Wu was already a Level-5 Spiritual Saint, and it was already a miracle that she could defeat a Level-6 Spiritual Saint. But now, she was challenging Gud, who was a Level-7 Spiritual Saint. She had to have a death wish!","But Feng Wu only smiled. “Sure.”","The others looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","He was a Level-7 Spiritual Saint.","Lady Wang almost choked on her own breath. Feng Wu, the girl they had grown up with, had become a Spiritual Saint so easily... Her own children had made no progress... She felt like crying.","Lady Wang wasn’t the only one feeling that way. The others held their breaths as well ana starecl at Feng wu nervously, overwnelmea DY tne astonisnment they had experienced over and over again.","Young General Yi shifted his gaze and told Gud Mornin, “Fine. You fight her. I’ll say it again. Kill her.”","Gud Mornin nodded. “Don’t worry, Young General. It’s no big deal.”","But was it really a piece of cake?","Gud Mornin stared at Feng Wu with a half-smile. “Young lady, don’t worry. I’ll let you make three strikes first.” Feng Wu nodded with a smile. “Alright.”","Gud Mornin was speechless.","This was the first time he had met such an unpredictable girl, and he didn’t know what to do.","But it also indirectly showed how scared the girl was of him, thought Gud.","However, he only realized how capable the girl was when the battle started.","There was no doubt that a Level-7 Spiritual Saint would defeat a Level- 5 Spiritual Saint.","But to his disappointment, he couldn’t kill the girl in one go because she was too fast. She didn’t fight him head-on and kept slipping away.","Looking up at the sky, Young Master Yi frowned and reminded Gud Mornin, “Faster.”","Gud Mornin smiled bitterly and complained. “She won’t even fight me! I have to follow her because she’s fast!”","Young General Yi rolled his eyes. “Isn’t speed a part of one’s capability? Gud","Mornin, you’re not inferior to her, are you?”","Young Master Yi wasn’t the only one making fun of Good Moning. His teammates were laughing with him as well.","Seeing that he couldn’t take the girl down, his friends didn’t know what to say. “Hey, Gud, can you do it or not? If not, get down here!”","“You’re a Level-7 Spiritual Saint, for heaven’s sake.. Have you forgotten how capable you are? You can’t even defeat a Level-5 Spiritual Saint"]},{"number":4118,"title":"Chapter 4118: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (17)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4118: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (17)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Or is he pitying her because she’s so pretty? We can’t let that happen.”","All his friends were either laughing or attacking Gud, which frustrated him greatly. He quickened his pace and intensified his attack, but Feng Wu was as slippery as a fish and kept running as fast as she could.","Seeing the discussion and the battle, Emperor Wu suddenly had a strange feeling. Why was it that as soon as Feng Wu showed up, the Dayan Empire didn’t feel so hostile toward them anymore? Wasn’t it supposed to be a one-sided battle between the empire and its subject?","But now, Feng Wu was fighting against her opponent as if they were equal. What an amazing girl. Emperor Wu thought to himself.","All of a sudden, Feng Wu stumbled and almost fell.","“This is our chance!” Young Master Yi and the others were all watching the battle, and they spoke first when they saw Feng Wu’s opening.","Feng Xun and the others hadn’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet, so they didn’t know what was going on. Seeing the pleasant surprise on Young Master Yi’s face, Feng Xun was worried sick. Was Xiao Wu going to be in trouble?","Gud Mornin smirked and jumped to his feet. “I’ll crush her!” He pounced at Feng Wu, trying to pin her down.","“Shit!” Young Master Yi was the first to react. “Gud, back off!”","However, it was too late when Young General Yi shouted those words.","By then, Feng Wu had dodged, and Gud missed his target.","It wasn’t a complete miss because there was something under him.","But at that moment, there was a rumbling sound!","There was a loud explosion, and the ground shook violently.","Many rooms in the Feng clan had collapsed.","Surrounded by the smoke, Gud Mornin coughed, but soon, he screamed.","It happened so fast that many people didn’t see it clearly.","“What’s going on? What’s going on?” Many people asked.","Long Yanyi explained, “Feng Wu dodged when he pounced at her and set a bomb on the ground. He didn’t land on Feng Wu but on the bomb. It was impossible for him to dodge because the bomb was detonated.","“That was why the bomb exploded and injured Gud Mornin. Feng Wu attacked him at the critical moment.” Long Yanyi was secretly astonished.","It sounded easy, but it was very difficult to do.","Moreover, it usually applied to cultivators of the same level, but Feng Wu was two levels lower than Gud Mornin. Long Yanyi couldn’t figure out how Feng Wu did it.","Feng Wu was so amazing that she calculated the time perfectly.","The smoke dissipated.","Gud Mornin was covered in blood, severely injured, and barely breathing.","Young General Yi was speechless.","He didn’t know what to say.","“Idiot!” Young Master Yi stepped out and kicked Gud Mornin hard.","She was two levels lower than him, but he was beaten to this stage. Moreover,","Feng Wu was capable enough to kill him, but because he was from theDayan Empire, she didn’t want to provoke them, which was why she didn’t kill him instantly.","Young General Yi understood that, as did all the capable people here. That was why he was even angrier.."]},{"number":4119,"title":"Chapter 4119: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (18)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Young General Yi understood that, as did all the capable people here. That was why he was even angrier.","Gud Mornin didn’t know what to say.","“Get back!” Young Master Yi kicked him back into the team. He then turned his gaze on Feng Wu.","Unfortunately, Feng Wu was sitting on the ground and recovering her spiritual essence.","The battle just then might seem simple, but it was in fact a hair-raising one. One wrong move, and Feng Wu could lose her life. Luckily, despite the tense process, it ended well.","Right now, Young General Yi was examining Feng Wu closely!","Not only could a Level-5 Spiritual Saint defeat a Level-6 Spiritual Saint, but","she could also defeat a Level-7 Spiritual Saint. What kind of person was she?","“Fight again!” Staring at Feng Wu, Young General Yi didn’t care if she was recovering her cultivation ability or not. He said directly, “Lei Yiran, you’re up.” Lei Yiran felt conflicted, but in the end, he followed Young General Yi’s order and stepped out.","“You don’t like it?” Young Master Yi stared at Lei Yiran.","Lei Yiran said awkwardly, “Young General, I’m a Level-8 Spiritual Saint, and she’s just a Level-5 one. She won’t be able to withstand my strike! I don’t want to fight her.”","Young General Yi smirked. “You don’t want to fight her? Maybe you’re the one who’s going to lose.”","Lei Yiran said, “That’s impossible!”","Young Master Yi said, “Give it a go, then.”","Lei Yiran said, “I...” He wanted to say that he didn’t want to fight a mere Level-5 Spiritual Saint, so he stood there in frustration.","“No,” Emperor Wu intervened. “Xiao Wu can’t fight anymore.”","Young General Yi looked at Feng Wu. “If you fight, you’ll lose one less Spiritual","Saint. Don’t you want to?”","He wanted to know how much potential Feng Wu would have in the end.","“I’ll take her place!” a Spiritual Saint next to Emperor Wu volunteered.","But Young General Yi ignored him and only stared at Feng Wu. “You’re the only option. Are you going to do it or not?”","He added, “Don’t you want to save them? If you win, you can save a Spiritual","Saint. Can you bring yourself to do that?”","When the repair was finally completed, Feng Wu rose to her feet and stared at","Young General Yi. “Do you really want to know where my potential is?”","Young General Yi didn’t try to hide it. He nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Alright.”","Staring coldly at Feng Wu, Young General Yi frowned. “Do you agree?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “You aren’t happy when I say no, and you won’t like it when I say yes. What on earth do you want from me?”","Young General Yi nodded. “Alright. Lei Yiran, do your best to force her to show her true capability.”","Lei Yiran still felt conflicted. What potential?","“Young General, I’m a Level-8 Spiritual Saint. If I can’t even take down a Level-5 one, I’ll just cut my own belly open and kill myself. I won’t be able to face the world anymore.”","Lei Yiran believed that he was going to win.","Everyone thought that Lei Yiran was going to win, apart from the suspicious Young General Yi.","Feng Xun was whispering in Feng Wu’s ear. “Xiao Wu, how are you going to fight him? Say no and stall for a few more days. Boss Jun is coming back!”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly inwardly. A few days? Of course, they wouldn’t let her stall for that long. She would be lucky if she could stall for two hours.."]},{"number":4120,"title":"Chapter 4120: Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (19)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu smiled at Feng Xun. “Don’t worry. I know what I’m doing.”","Feng Xun was exasperated. “How can you be so sure?! He’s a Level-8 Spiritual Saint! How are we supposed to fight him? He’ll beat you to the ground as soon as you make a move! You can’t go! I won’t allow it!”","Feng Xun blocked Feng Wu’s way as he spoke, and the look on his face was one of anxiety and self-reproach.","Feng Wu knew what he was worried about and what he was blaming himself for.","He was anxious because there was nothing he could do, and he blamed himself for the same reason.","Feng Xun was already making rapid progress, but he and Feng Wu weren’t on the same level. Feng Wu was all about rapid breakthroughs, and her speed was unmatched.","Feng Wu smiled at Feng Xun. “Just wait and see.”","Of course, Feng Xun didn’t believe her, but he couldn’t stop Feng Wu and could only watch her leave.","As a matter of fact, Feng Wu had shocked everyone over and over again today, so much so that they were used to it. They had thought that Feng Wu was going to lose.","That was true at first.","Feng Wu had been losing ground the whole time and was in a sorry state.","She wanted to run. She was faster than Gud Mornin, but she still wasn’t Lei Yiran’s match.","Therefore, Feng Wu wasn’t able to get away.","Thump!","Behind Feng Wu, Lei Yiran struck out again.","The energy rushed toward Feng Wu like a tidal wave, distorting the air. Feng Wu was hit on the back, and she spat out a mouthful of blood.","That was the tenth mouthful of blood she had spat out.","Feng Wu’s clothes were covered with blood. She stumbled and could barely run.","Young Master Yi narrowed his eyes and kept his sharp gaze on Feng Wu. He was watching her every move, even the tiniest one!","Gud Mornin couldn’t help but glance at Young General Yi. He knew very well that although the general didn’t seem to care about anything, he was actually a very scheming man. He might laugh and shout at other people, but he could change his attitude faster than anyone else.","There were very few times that he could be serious.","He didn’t even bat an eyelash when he was around Prince Yan Yu, but now, he was watching every move of this girl and didn’t miss any expression on her","face...","Gud Mornin turned to look at the arena. He wasn’t mistaken. Lei had indeed gained the upper hand. Feng Wu was losing ground.","She would be killed after a few more strikes from Lei Yiran and had no hope of turning things around. So, what was Young General Yi looking at?","“I knew it. Is she going to die?” Seeing that Feng Wu had been struck again, Young General Yi let out a breath of relief. He then said to Gud Mornin, “So, in terms of talent, Her Royal Highness is still the best.”","Gud Mornin rolled his eyes at Young General Yi. “Young General, what are you talking about? Her Royal Highness is a completely different story! Feng Wu is just a petty village girl from a small Junwu Kingdom. How can she possibly be comparable to Her Royal Highness, the descendant of a Heavenly God? You’ve got to be kidding me!”","Young General Yi neither nodded nor shook his head. He thought to himself,","“She’s no random village girl.. If she’s given the chance to grow up, she’ll have a","promising future! “"]},{"number":4121,"title":"Chapter 4121 Clouds follow Dragons and Wind follow Tigers (20)","paragraphs":["How proud could that girl be? Even when Princess Yan Ling wanted to be her study companion, she only had to say one thing: Yan Ling wasn’t good enough for her.","As expected, the princess was the only genius in the world. As for Feng Wu, she would die in the cradle.","Young General Yi gave Lei Yiran a warning look, telling him to kill Feng Wu.","Lei Yiran nodded, indicating that he understood.","However...","To their surprise...","Feng Wu repeated the trick and pretended to fall again.","“How fake!” Lei Yiran smirked. “You’ve put on an act once, and you want to do it again? I’m not going to fall for it this time!”","Lei Yiran didn’t jump at Feng Wu, fearing that Feng Wu would throw another bomb at him. However...","He had stayed where he was.","There was a loud bang where Lei Yiran was standing. When he realized what had happened, two thick vines had shot out of the ground and wrapped around his legs, immobilizing him. At the same time, a poisonous gas surrounded him!","Taking advantage of the poisonous gas, Feng Wu stumbled back. With a thump, she put a protective shield over herself.","What?","After forcing Lei Yiran back, she had put a protective shield over herself. What on earth was she doing? She could use this opportunity to run away.","Young General Yi couldn’t figure out what Feng Wu was doing until he saw that Feng Wu was cultivating with her legs crossed.","Cultivate?!","Seriously?!","Young General Yi heard an obvious buzzing sound.","Wasn’t that the signal of a breakthrough?","avatar","NEXT"]},{"number":4122,"title":"Chapter 4122: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (21)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He didn’t hear a word, for the toxin Feng Wu had released was meant for his ears. With the toxin in his eardrum, he couldn’t hear a word.","All he wanted to do now was to kill Feng Wu and treat his ears.","However, when he charged at Feng Wu and exerted all his strength..","Feng Wu used the momentum to absorb the impact!","Thump!","Hum!","Feng Wu was already a Level-6 Spiritual Saint, and now, she had reached Level 7.","What?","Lei Yiran was so shocked that he rubbed his eyes, fearing that he was seeing things.","“What’s going on?","“Why is she suddenly...","“Isn’t she a Level-7 Spiritual Saint? Since when did she become a Level-7","Spiritual Saint? Or did she hide her true capability from the very beginning?”","Recalling everything that had happened, Lei Yiran said angrily to Feng Wu,","“You’re a Level-7 Spiritual Saint, aren’t you? You were pretending to be a Level-5 Spiritual Saint!”","Feng Wu remained sitting on the ground with her legs crossed, trying to consolidate the spiritual essence she had absorbed from the breakthrough. A short distance away, Young General Yi wanted to kick Lei Yiran away!","How stupid!","The people he brought were idiots!","At first, Young Master Yi had a sense of superiority as a member of the Dayan Empire, but now, he felt that he had brought along an idiotic teammate. What did he mean by pretending to be a Level-5 Spiritual Saint? She had just made a breakthrough in front of him!","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was finally done with her breakthrough and tidying up. She rose to her feet.","“She’s on her feet!”","“Xiao Wu has risen to her feet after her breakthrough! That Lei Yiran didn’t disturb her! He’s such a nice person!”","“You don’t say. A breakthrough is supposed to be the most dangerous thing. If someone disturbs you, you may get injured or even suffer from Qi Deviation. I didn’t know the Dayan Empire had such a kind person.”","The speakers were from the Junwu Empire.","They didn’t try to keep their voices down, so Young General Yi heard them.","Right now, Young General Yi wanted to kick Lei Yiran in the head. What an idiot!","The murderous look in Young General Yi’s eyes sent a chill down Lei Yiran’s spine. This wouldn’t do. He had already made a mistake.","He was trapped by the vines because he was too careless, and he was so shocked that his enemy made two breakthroughs in a row. If he went on like this, the young general would kill him.","Lei Yiran knew perfectly well that after losing two battles in a row, Young General Yi’s rage had reached its peak.","“Die!” Infuriated, Lei Yiran showed no mercy.","Not only that, but he had also spared no effort.","Right now, one was a Level-7 Spiritual Saint, and the other a Level-8 one. Which side would win?","“Xiao Wu is going to win, isn’t she? She didn’t lose even when she was a Level-5 one, and she’s only one level below that man now. I don’t think she’s going to lose.”","“Not necessarily. Lei Yiran was too careless before because he didn’t think much of Feng Wu. But now, he has exerted all his power. After all, Feng Wu is one level below him. I don’t think Feng Wu can defeat him.”","“I think Feng Wu is going to lose, too.. After all, she was severely injured by Lei","Yiran...”"]},{"number":4123,"title":"Chapter 4123: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (22)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone offered their opinions.","Members of the Junwu Empire and Dayan Empire were discussing among themselves.","“Dude, you didn’t lose for nothing.” Lin Xu, a Level-9 Spiritual Saint, patted Situ Nanbo, who was a Level-6 Spiritual Saint, with a smile on his face. “Look, she has almost defeated a Level-8 Spiritual Saint.”","Holding the wound in his throat, Situ Nanbo smiled bitterly, indicating that he wasn’t comforted.","But she really was a genius... Situ Nanbo looked up at Young General Yi. He wanted to say that she was as talented as the princess, but he didn’t dare to say it when he recalled that the princess was Young General Yi’s dream girl. “I think she’s going to win...” Situ Nanbo made a mental bet on Feng Wu.","That was indeed the case.","Thump!","In the end, Feng Wu kicked Lei Yiran toward Young General Yi. Lei Yiran had no means of retaliating and was severely injured after he hit the ground. He kept coughing out blood.","“Good job.” Feng Wu cupped her fists at Lei Yiran with a smile.","Lei Yiran was mortified!","Recalling what he said on the stage, he flew into a rage out of humiliation. Holding his breath, he threw a dirty look at Feng Wu, who gave him a perfectly guileless look.","Lei Yiran coughed out and spat out another mouthful of blood.","Feng Wu cleared her throat and rubbed her nose. She looked into Young","General Yi’s black eyes and smiled. “He vomited blood himself. I didn’t touch him. You can’t blame it on me.”","Young General Yi kept his gaze on Feng Wu and studied her closely.","She looked like an innocent girl who knew nothing about worldly affairs, but Young General Yi knew perfectly well that she was a scheming girl.","The girl was indeed attractive, but keeping her around would only bring disaster to wreak havoc.","All she needed was a ladder, no, a wooden board, and she would be able to climb all the way up to the top. With her looks, as long as she was willing, she would be able to take over the Dayan Empire!","Therefore, he couldn’t let her live!","Staring at Feng Wu, Young General Yi narrowed his eyes. “You’re not bad at all.","You’ve already won three places for the Junwu Empire.”","“Do you want to go on?” There was a strange look in his eyes.","Before Feng Wu could say yes, the empress dowager said, “Of course!”","Emperor Wu glared at the empress dowager and was about to scold her when the empress dowager cut him off. “Of course, she will! She can fight Level-8 opponents, can’t she? She’s Level-7 now, so, of course, she can fight Level-9 opponents, or even Level-I or Level-2 Spiritual Emperors. Maybe she can make a breakthrough again.”","“Mother!!!” Emperor Wu was furious.","What was that supposed to mean? Xiao Wu had used up a lot of her potential to make two breakthroughs just then. Emperor Wu had heard from Feng Wu that she had been trying her best not to make too many breakthroughs. Otherwise, it would damage her health.","Moreover, it was extremely difficult for a Spiritual Saint to make a breakthrough, but the empress dowager made it sound so easy. She didn’t see how difficult it was for Xiao Wu at all!","Emperor Wu stared at the empress dowager.."]},{"number":4124,"title":"Chapter 4124: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (23)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu stared at the empress dowager.","However, when he was about to say those words, he looked into the empress dowager’s eyes.","Seeing the matter-of-fact arrogance and selfishness in the empress dowager’s eyes, Emperor Wu didn’t want to say anything.","Staring at Feng Wu, Young General Yi smiled a little and said, “Since you’ve agreed to fight, let’s do it.”","Meanwhile, Lin Xu, a Level-9 Spiritual Saint, was ready to fight. He was almost there. All he needed was an order from Young General Yi.","Lin Xu wasn’t the only one who thought that way. Those on Feng Wu’s side also thought that a Level-9 Spiritual Saint was going to fight because that was how Young General Yi had been doing. With each person he sent out, their cultivation level would rise by a level.","Because of that, Emperor Wu didn’t reject it on behalf of Feng Wu. Deep down, he thought that although it was dangerous, she could still fight.","Young General Yi’s decision was unexpected.","He didn’t send a Level-9 cultivator because he was going to fight Feng Wu himself.","He slowly walked up to Feng Wu, stopped in front of her, and gave her a half-smile. “I’m your opponent this time.” Feng Wu sighed inwardly.","He really was going to do it himself...","Feng Wu wondered if stalling would work.","Would Luo Zilin really come? And would he really be useful? It was still unknown if his capability and his status in the Dayan Empire would be enough to defeat these enemies.","However, Feng Wu knew that if she didn’t fight for it, the entire Junwu Empire would be destroyed.","At that thought, Feng Wu stared at Young General Yi with a sharp look in her eyes.","By then, everyone around them had been astonished by what Young General Yi did!","“Wait! What did I just hear? Am I hearing things?”","“Young General Yi is going to fight her in person?! His capability...”","Long Yanyi’s face was livid. He said in a low voice, “This Yang General Yi has surpassed the Spiritual Saint stage. I think he’s a Spiritual Sovereign.”","Why “should be’? Long Yanyi wasn’t a Spiritual Sovereign, so he didn’t know much about that stage.","“Ssss...”","Many people of the Junwu Empire drew in their breaths when they heard what Long Yanyi said.","So cruel!","That was so cruel!","Feng Wu was only a Level-5 Spiritual Saint five minutes ago, but the Spiritual Sovereign was going to fight her. That was outrageous!","“I’ll fight you!” A peak Level-9 Spiritual Saint next to Emperor Wu stepped out.","Feng Wu agreed to fight, she would definitely die.","However, Young General Yi had many capable cultivators around him. Lin Xu stepped out as soon as he heard those words. Crossing his arms, he smiled at the Junwu Empire cultivators.","The Level-9 Spiritual Saint on the Junwu Empire’s side was an old eunuch with a hunched back. Despite his old age, he had bright eyes and seldom showed his face in public. He had been protecting Emperor Wu in the imperial palace.","This time, when the Junwu Empire’s life was hanging in the balance, he had no choice but to show his face.","“If you want to fight, I’ll fight with you. How about that?” Lin Xu grinned at the eunuch.","“Master Yu.” Emperor Wu looked concerned.."]},{"number":4125,"title":"Chapter 4125: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (24)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4125: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (24)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Master Yu.” Emperor Wu looked concerned.","Yu the eunuch nodded at Emperor Wu, then walked up to Young General Yi. “I’ll fight you!”","Lin Xu went up to him and grinned. “If you want to fight my general, you’ll have to go through me first.”","Young General Yi waved his hand impatiently. “Go away. Don’t get in my way.” Lin Xu gestured at Yu, but Yu didn’t want to fight him.","He had to keep an eye on Feng Wu. What if something happened to her?","On the Junwu Empire’s side, many people were worried about Feng Wu, but a few were secretly gloating over her predicament. Needless to say, they were from the Dugu family.","Feng Wu had used the Hua family to destroy the Zuo family, and the Zuo family and the Dugu family were allies.","The Dongsang Kingdom’s influence in the Junwu Empire had shifted from the Zuo family to the Dugu family. Naturally, Princess Yan Ling was close to the Dugu family when she visited the Junwu Empire last time.","And now, the Dayan Empire was targeting Feng Wu, which was something the Dugu family loved to see.","Mrs. Dugu and Master Dugu exchanged looks, and both saw excitement in each other’s eyes.","So, Feng Wu was going to die today!","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was looking at Young General Yi with an indifferent look on her face.","Seeing how unperturbed she was, Young General Yi thought even more highly of her.","She was as magnanimous as his princess.","“Are you sure?” Feng Wu sighed.","Young General Yi chuckled. “Of course. How about we kill your Master Yu first? We’ll have to kill four Spiritual Saints, anyway.” How arrogant!","Feng Wu hadn’t felt so frustrated for a while.","She had worked so hard so that she wouldn’t be stepped on. But now, she had to work harder...","Feng Wu smiled. “Do you think you can kill me just like that?”","Young General Yi gave her a half-smile. “How about we give it a go?”","Just then, someone said, ‘We have Master Linghu. He’s a Spiritual Sovereign, isn’t he?”","Just then, they heard the sound of fighting.","Two people rushed into the other dimension.","Feng Wu took a deep breath. Other people might not see it, but Feng Wu did.","It was Master Linghu and a woman. If she guessed right, that woman was the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace.","Therefore, Master Linghu, the most powerful cultivator of the Junwu Empire, was stopped by the Matriarch of the Firmament Palace, who was also a Spiritual Sovereign. Feng Wu was convinced that Master Linghu was better, but it would take a while for a Spiritual Sovereign to defeat his opponent.","Therefore, she couldn’t count on Master Linghu.S earch newn0vel’ on g00gle","Young General Yi grinned at Feng Wu. “Did you see that? Master Linghu, your biggest trump card, has been lured away. Do you still count on him? I don’t think so.”","Not only did Young General Yi’s words set Feng Wu off, but he also successfully set the other members of the Junwu Empire off. Emperor Wu’s face went ghastly pale!","The Matriarch of the Firmament Palace was supposed to be a member of the Junwu Empire, but she had stalled Master Linghu.","“So, you’re on your own, young lady.” Young General Yi grinned at Feng Wu. “I’m going to count to three. Fight me, or I’ll start killing. Your choice.","“Three.","“Two.”","“Bring it on!”"]},{"number":4126,"title":"Chapter 4126: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (25)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4126: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (25)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s fight,” Feng Wu said indifferently.","Young General Yi glanced at Feng Wu with a smile, but he looked surprised.","He had thought that Feng Wu would say no.","After all, if he were in Feng Wu’s place, he would never put himself in such danger to save someone else.","“Good.” He nodded. “Since you’re so generous, I’ll let you die in glory. Bring it on!”","After seeing Feng Wu’s talent, Young General Yi was even more intimidated by Feng Wu. As a result, he wanted to kill Feng Wu.","As soon as the battle started, Young General Yi exerted his full power!","He struck down at Feng Wu.","Before Feng Wu could steady herself, she flew backward like an arrow and landed on the ground.","How terrifying!","The Spiritual Overlord was indeed a capable cultivator. He only needed one strike...","Many people on Feng Wu’s side were concerned.","Feng Wu had fought three battles today, and she was covered in wounds from them. Now that she had been severely injured, she...","“Xiao Wu, come back!” Feng Xun rushed out to help Feng Wu.","Xuan Yi followed him out.","So did Duan Chaoge.","Feng Wu spat out three mouthfuls of blood in a row. Only then did she feel that she had spat out all the blood in her chest. Chaoge helped her to her feet. Looking up, she saw that Young General Yi was walking toward them.","In the end, he stopped in front of Feng Xun, glanced at Feng Wu, and stared back at Feng Xun. “Out of my way.”","Feng Xun spread out his arms and shook his head angrily. He wasn’t going to give in!","“Gosh.” Young General Yi raised an eyebrow and darted a look at Feng Xun.","“You’re so weak. One slap from me, and you’re dead. How dare you stand here?” He then raised his hand.","“Stop!” Feng Wu bellowed. She then took a few steps forward and tugged at Feng Xun. “Get out!”","Feng Xun still spread out his arms, shielding Feng Wu behind him. “I’m not going to let you fight alone! Let me help you!”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly inwardly. Of course, she knew what Feng Xun was thinking, but he was still a Spiritual Overlord, and there was nothing he could do... Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “If you die like this, who’s going to take revenge for me?”","Next to Feng Wu, Duan Chaoge burst into tears.","“Xiao Wu, you’re not going to die! The crown prince is coming out soon! You’re not going to die!” After comforting Feng Wu, Chaoge quickly walked up to Young General Yi and shoved him.","Young General Yi was dumbfounded.","The others were dumbfounded as well. Was she really not afraid of death?","Duan Chaoge glared at Young General Yi. “Who the hell do you think you are? You’re nothing compared to the crown prince! If he wasn’t here, you wouldn’t have been able to bully us like this!”","Young General Yi gave Chaoge and Duan Chaoge a half-smile and smirked. “Get lost.”","But Duan Chaoge wouldn’t leave.","Young General Yi was obviously going to lose his temper.","He was a Spiritual Sovereign!","Feng Wu immediately took Chaoge and Feng Xun’s hands and smiled bitterly. “My mum needs you to take care of her. If you die for nothing, who’s going to take care of my mother and Xiaoqi from now on? Go away.”","“I don’t want it!” Holding Feng Wu’s arm, Duan Chaoge burst into tears.","Feng Wu looked at her in sorrow. Seeing that she was crying so hard that she couldn’t breathe, Feng Wu felt sorry for her as well.","In the face of absolute power... In front of the powerful Dayan Empire..."]},{"number":4127,"title":"Chapter 4127 Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (26)","paragraphs":["How many more Spiritual Sovereigns did the Dayan Empire have?","Cough, cough...","At that thought, Feng Wu was overwhelmed by sorrow, and she spat out a mouthful of blood.","She wasn’t Young General Yi’s match at all and wouldn’t be able to withstand a second strike... What could she do?","Meanwhile, Young General Yi smirked at the people blocking his way. “What can you possibly do?”","After that, he raised his right hand, and violent energy was forming in his palm.","Feng Wu paled!","It was even more powerful than before!","“Get lost!” Feng Wu used the last bit of her strength to push Feng Xun and the others away, while she faced Young General Yi’s strike.","Young General Yi smirked. “Die!”","Goodbye, the girl that could threaten the princess.","A fierce look flickered in Young General Yi’s eyes, but he paused the next second.","Not only did he stop, but the energy he exerted also froze in mid-air. Meanwhile, Feng Wu watched this in amazement.","She looked from the teenager next to her to Young General Yi, and her head buzzed...","Feng Wu was bewildered. “You...”"]},{"number":4128,"title":"Chapter 4128: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (27)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","His girl?","Yi Ziqi frowned and looked at Luo Zilin in bewilderment. “Yours?”","Young General Yi had a bad feeling. The Luo family didn’t get along well with the Yan manor. Not only that, but they had always been at loggerheads. If he wanted to help Feng Wu now, it wouldn’t be easy to kill her.","Luo Zilin patted Feng Wu’s head and nodded at Yi Ziqi. “That’s right. She’s my girl. Why? Do you have a problem with that?”","Feng Wu wanted to throw off his arm, but she knew that now was the time to take advantage of the situation.","Hence, Feng Wu decided to take advantage of Luo Zilin’s presence. Crossing her arms, she glanced at Yi Ziqi. “What? Do you have a problem with that?”","Meanwhile, the others were all bewildered.","The people on Feng Wu’s side were first shocked by the fact that Feng Wu had a member of the Dayan Empire with her. Moreover, it seemed that this Young","Master was quite an influential figure. At least, he was able to intimidate Young General Yi.","What made them even more confused was that Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan were supposed to be engaged, but now, Luo Zilin had shown up. Were the two boys competing for the same girl?","Feng Xun was even more anxious. He threw a dirty look at Luo Zilin and would have questioned him if they hadn’t been in such a dangerous situation.","People of the Dayan Empire were even more shocked.","Since they were from the Dayan Empire, they naturally knew who Luo Zilin was. The Luo family was a terrifying force from the Dayan Empire. Young General Yi’s status was nothing compared to that of Young Master Luo.","He didn’t expect Luo Zilin to help Feng Wu. Even Yan Yu would have a headache over it.","By then, Young General Yi had finally recovered from his astonishment. He stared at Luo Zilin and asked, “Young Master Luo, may I have a word with you?”","Yes! That was right! Young General Yi’s men agreed with him inwardly. The Dayan Empire was on the same side now, and they should make some excuse to keep Young Master Luo out of it.","However, Luo Zilin only smiled a little. “That won’t be necessary. Why are you so sneaky? Do you think I’m that kind of person?”","The unpredictable Young Master Luo gave Young General Yi a headache. But he couldn’t lose his temper yet, for the man was much more influential than he was.","Young General Yi had no choice but to swallow his anger and keep his composure.","Feng Wu studied Yi Ziqi curiously.","Before Luo Zilin showed up, Yi Ziqi was the one who controlled the situation. His every word and action could decide the fate of everyone here. Therefore, everyone revered and feared him, and he enjoyed the feeling of being the one in control.","However, once Luo Zilin showed up, Young General Yi changed. He was no longer the one who could decide a person’s fate, but someone who had to bow to Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin, on the other hand, was smiling. He didn’t seem to be doing anything, but he was very intimidating, which was why Yi Ziqi was afraid of him.","Yi Ziqi said in resignation, “Young Master Luo, this is the Yan Manor’s","business. Please excuse us. I’m sure they’ll reward you generously.”","“If it were any other family, I might have stepped aside, but the Yan Manor? No way.” Luo Zilin turned him down without hesitation.","Wow!","People on Feng Wu’s side finally saw that Young Master Luo was with them. So, things weren’t so bad for them.","Emperor Wu was the most excited of them all, for he was the emperor of the","Junwu Empire.."]},{"number":4129,"title":"Chapter 4129: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (28)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4129: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (28)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu looked at Luo Zilin in excitement and clenched his fists.","He then looked at Feng Wu in excitement... The girl was amazing. No wonder she had been so calm recently. She had such a big card up her sleeves!","As for the relationship between Feng Wu and Luo Zilin, Emperor Wu wasn’t worried at all. His Junjun was so outstanding that even if Luo Zilin was from the Dayan Empire, he still wouldn’t be Junjun’s match!","The empress dowager was the other one who was shocked. She looked at Feng Wu in surprise. She didn’t expect Feng Wu to have such a card up her sleeves. However, she then looked at Luo Zilin.","What was Feng Wu’s relationship with this Luo Zilin?! He kept saying that Feng","Wu was with him, and that Luo Zilin was living in Fallen Star Yard! How dare Feng Wu do such a thing to Junjun... The empress dowager’s face twisted. She decided that she would expose Feng Wu when Junjun came back!","Yi Ziqi stared at Luo Zilin. “Young Master Luo, are you sure you want to get involved?”","Luo Zilin didn’t deny it.","Yi Ziqi gritted his teeth. “Young Master Yu is the one leading the team this time. Are you sure you won’t show him any respect?”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “Gosh, you sound as if I’ve shown Yan Yu some respect back there.”","Yi Ziqi was even more frustrated. No matter what he said, Luo Zilin wouldn’t change his mind.","“See you around, then!” After that, Yi Ziqi turned to leave with his men.","With Luo Zilin around, they wouldn’t stand a chance. Not only wouldn’t they get any advantage, but they might also be taken advantage of. At that thought,","Yi Ziqi wanted to leave.","But...","“Hey, who told you that you can leave? Who do you think you are? Do you think you can come and go as you please? You have no respect for me!” Luo Zilin shouted after Yi Ziqi.","Feng Wu noticed that Young General Yi drew in his breath.","That was indeed the case. Young General Yi had to take a deep breath to calm himself down. Otherwise, Luo Zilin would pick on him again.","“Young Master Luo, what do you mean?”","Luo Zilin smirked. “My girl has vomited blood because of your attacks. Are you going to leave just like that? Since when is my family so easy to bully?”","Yi Ziqi’s face darkened. That was to say, Luo Zilin wasn’t the only one involved. The Luo family was in it as well.","“Young Master Luo, are you really going to make the Luo family our enemy?","It’s also the eldest princess’s idea!”updat? by n?wno?el.","The eldest princess? Feng Wu made a mental note of that name, but she let out a breath of relief at the same time.","She realized something very important.","According to Yi Ziqi, attacking the Junwu Empire was a matter of the Yan Manor and the eldest princess’s will. That was to say, the invasion wasn’t the will of the emperor of the Dayan Empire.","Feng Wu had been worried about becoming the enemy of the Dayan Empire, for she couldn’t fight against a powerful superior state all by herself. However, if it was a prince’s residence and a princess... It wouldn’t be impossible.","“Is Young Master Luo still going to implicate the entire Luo family?” Yi Ziqi asked coldly.","Luo Zilin laughed, then struck out.","There was a loud smack!"]},{"number":4130,"title":"Chapter 4130: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (29)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4130: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (29)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","There was a loud smack!","Luo Zilin slapped Young General Yi, and the arrogant young man stumbled back.","He looked up and stared at Luo Zilin.","This time, Luo Zilin kicked him.","With a thump, Luo Zilin kicked Young General Yi away and smirked. “Who gave you the right to be so arrogant in front of me? Even your master doesn’t dare to talk to me like that!”","What a spoiled brat... Feng Wu vented her sarcasm inwardly.","Zilin was obviously a spoiled brat, which meant that he had to be very well-connected.","Feng Xun clenched his fists. He recognized someone in Luo Zilin. It was none other than himself.","In the Junwu Empire, Feng Xun used to have the privilege to do whatever he wanted, but when the Dayan Empire gradually showed up and began to bully them, Feng Xun realized that he wasn’t capable enough.","He had to work very hard... Feng Xun made up his mind.","Young General Yi glared at Luo Zilin. ‘Young Master Luo, you’re all by yourself, aren’t you? You’re the only member of your family in the Junwu Empire, aren’t you?”","Luo Zilin smirked. “So what if I’m the only one in the Junwu Empire? Do you want to do something?”","The look on Young General Yi’s face was ferocious as he stared at Luo Zilin. “I’m too petty to do anything to you. It’s just that Prince Yu knows that Young Master Luo is the only one here, and he’s on his way. I hope Young Master Luo hears about this and doesn’t run away.”","Young General Yi didn’t tell Luo Zilin that Yan Yu was leading a large group of people.","However, Feng Wu tugged at Luo Zilin’s sleeve and told him that she had seen Yan Yu’s powerful subordinates in the Dongsang Kingdom. Feng Wu looked concerned. “Is Yan Yu on his way? How are you compared to him?” Luo Zilin cleared his throat and whispered to Feng Wu, “I’m better than him.”","Feng Wu was elated. “Are you a lot better than him?”","Luo Zilin cleared his throat. “My brothers are much better than him, but I’m only slightly better.”","Feng Wu stared at Luo Zilin. “That is to say, you can fight other people while fighting Yan Yu.”","After some thought, Luo Zilin sighed and nodded. “He’s the only one I can fight.” He didn’t know if Yan Yu had made a breakthrough recently. If he had, Luo Zilin would..","“That’s not good.” Feng Wu looked concerned. “Yan Yu has so many men with him that we can’t possibly handle them all. Something big is going to happen!”","Emperor Wu was standing next to Feng Wu, and he looked worried when he heard Feng Wu’s words.","The crisis was coming.","As a matter of fact, Yan Yu arrived shortly afterward with all his men.","When all thirty Spiritual Saints stood there, they looked so intimidating.","Emperor Wu’s head went dizzy, and his face went ghastly pale.","The empress dowager almost fainted.","The other guests were equally shocked.","They were only here as a formality to celebrate Feng Wu’s birthday.. Who Imew that something like this would happen? They had to face the Dayan Empire so soon!"]},{"number":4131,"title":"Chapter 4131: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (30)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4131: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (30)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yan Yu walked up to Luo Zilin, tilted his head, and gave him a half-smile. “So, you’re all by yourself.”","Luo Zilin was even more intimidating than Yan Yu. He smirked. “So?”","Yan Yu smirked. “How dare you come here alone? You’re on your own, so how are you going to fight me? Luo Zilin, you’re all by yourself.”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “So what if I’m alone?”","Yan Yu said, “You’re all by yourself. What do you think you can do if I want to kill you?”","Luo Zilin smirked. “I never knew you could be so arrogant.”","Yan Yu shook his head. “That’s not arrogance. It’s the truth. You must think that I’m afraid because if the news gets out, your family won’t let it drop and I’ll be in a lot of trouble. But don’t forget...’","He moved closer and said with a half-smile, “People here are all going to die, and the dead won’t talk.”","Luo Zilin stared at Yan Yu and saw the serious look in his eyes. That was to say, he was telling the truth.","Luo Zilin was here in the Junwu Empire to look for someone.","Because of the information he received from Chu Tianxiao, Luo Zilin knew that the person he was looking for was from the Junwu Empire. Her surname was Feng, which was why he had come here in a hurry. He didn’t know much about anything else.","For instance, the Yan manor was going to destroy the Junwu Empire.","It wasn’t until he arrived at the Junwu Empire and found the person he was looking for in the Feng clan that he gradually realized Feng Wu’s current situation.","However, Luo Zilin wasn’t afraid even though he was alone.","He gave yan yu a halt-smile. “Silence.” yan yu, why do I feel that you’re so childish?”","Yan Yu stared at Luo Zilin and smirked. “Luo Zilin, you know what? I’ve never liked you since I was little. Do you know why?”","Luo Zilin said, “Really?”","Yan Yu said, “Because you’re a little bit more capable than me in every competition, I’ve lost to you every single time. My father has been humiliated in front of other people, but he vents his anger on my mother after he goes back home. I’ll hold you responsible for everything.","“You’re indeed alone now. Do you think I’ll let you go?” Without another word, he waved his hand. “Everyone, attack! Kill Luo Zilin first!”","Young General Yi stared at Luo Zilin with a cruel look in his eyes.","“Luo Zilin, I’m so glad to see you like this!”","This was a feud between the Yan manor and the Luo family, and he was thrilled that he could defeat one of the most talented members of the Luo family.","Feng Wu and the Junwu Empire didn’t matter now. He had to kill Luo Zilin first!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","A fight broke out between Luo Zilin and Yan Yu, and the two of them rushed into another dimension as they fought, for this place wasn’t strong enough for them to fight like this.","However, his thirty Spiritual Saint subordinates weren’t there. Right now, they were all staring at the people of the Junwu Empire.","“Prince Yan Yu has told us to start killing all the people of Junwu Kingdom. We can’t let any of them live!”","They had to keep it a secret that Yan Yu had killed Luo Zilin.","Although they hadn’t killed anyone yet, the people of the Yan manor were very confident. They were so confident because they had so many capable cultivators.."]},{"number":4132,"title":"Chapter 4132: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (31)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4132: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (31)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Prince Yan Yu and Luo Zilin had entered the other dimension, and the thirty Spiritual Overlords were enough to wipe out the entire Junwu Empire.","Emperor Wu’s face turned livid. He didn’t want to fight, but he had no choice now.","“We have ten Spiritual Saints in total.” Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Ten against thirty would be a drop in the bucket.","“Your Majesty!”","Just then, he heard an anxious voice. Emperor Wu turned around and saw that it was Feng Xiangnan.","“General Feng!” Emperor Wu’s face lit up when he saw Feng Xiangnan. He said to Feng Wu in excitement, “General Feng is here!”","Feng Xiangnan didn’t come alone. He was here with some capable cultivators of the Peace Grassland.","Mr. Xu, Mr. Lu, Elder Helian, and Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu immediately noticed that Feng Xiangnan was covered in blood. They looked exhausted, but they were obviously excited.","“What’s going on?” Emperor Wu asked in a hurry.","Feng Xiang said, “A war has just taken place in the Peace Grassland. Your","Majesty, please don’t worry. Xue Zhibei and his men have been annihilated. I noticed that Prince Yan Yu and his men were here in the imperial capital, so I brought my team here. What...”","Feng Xiangnan also felt dizzy when he saw the thirty Spiritual Saints.","Not only were there thirty Spiritual Saints, but they were also advanced Spiritual Saints. How terrifying!","“Have Xue Zhibei and his men been wiped out?” Emperor Wu was pleasantly surprised.","Over the years, Xue Zhibei and Feng Xiangnan had been confronting each other in the Peace Grassland, neither giving in.","Xue Zhibei was the sharpest blade of the Dongsang Kingdom, and so was Feng Xiangnan to the Junwu Empire.","Xue Zhibei had always been Emperor Wu’s problem, but now, he heard that Xue Zhibei was dead...","Feng Xiangnan nodded. “That’s right. Xue Zhibei is dead, and we’ve killed all his generals. From now on, the Dongsang Kingdom won’t be a problem.” Emperor Wu nodded solemnly.","The Dongsang Kingdom was indeed nothing to worry about, but they were worried about the Dayan Empire now.","Feng Wu handed them some energy bars right away.","It was a spiritual essence concentrate that Feng Wu had created herself. It could instantly restore the spiritual essence that had been drained by the battle.","Feng Xiangnan’s eyes lit up when he saw the energy bar. Patting Feng Wu on the shoulder, he said, “Xiao Wu is the best.”","Just then, they heard a snort. “What are you all mumbling about? Are you going to fight or not?”","It was Young General Yi. He had been scolded by Luo Zilin before, but now that Luo Zilin wasn’t around, and he was the most capable man here, he became arrogant again.","Feng Wu’s team would be attacked regardless of whether they wanted to fight or not.","Hence, Feng Wu said coldly, “Let’s fight in another dimension.”","However, Young General Yi smirked. “Why should I? I’m not going in!” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Young General Yi smirked. “We’re here to destroy the Junwu Empire. I don’t care if this land is going to sink. Wouldn’t it be better if it does?”","Everyone behind Feng Wu drew in their breaths.","They were here to destroy the Junwu Empire, and they couldn’t stop thirty","Spiritual Saints.."]},{"number":4133,"title":"Chapter 4133: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (32)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu knew that it was going to be a fight-or-die battle.","At that thought, Feng Wu told the guests, “Those above the Spiritual Saint stage, please stay. Those below the Spiritual Saint stage, please leave!” Hence, Long Yanyi was the only one left, and almost everyone else fled the scene.","“Xiao WII...”","Chaoge. Feng Xun. and Xuan Yi all looked pervously at Feng Wu-","“Leave now.”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything else and only stared at them. “This isn’t the place for you. Remember, keep running until you’re out of the Junwu Empire. Don’t look back even if I’m dead.","‘Where there’s life, there’s hope. “You’re the last bit of hope.”","Feng Wu said solemnly.","“No, you’re the last hope. Xiao Wu, just run. I’m sure you’ll get out. You...” Feng Xun tried to grab Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu only smiled bitterly. “If I run away as well, the Junwu Empire won’t be able to hold on for much longer. Without Jun Linyuan, I have to defend the empire!”","“And you,” Feng Wu reminded Feng Xiaoqi. “Take Mother and the others and","Feng Xiaoqi still wanted to protest, but he couldn’t utter a word under Feng Wu’s stern gaze.","Feng Xiaoqi turned around and ran toward the Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu knew that with the thirty Spiritual Saints around, it would be next to impossible for Feng Xun and the others to get out, but she still had to try.","‘Where do you think you’re going?” Young General Yi grinned maliciously and waved his hand. “Everyone, attack!” Destroy the Junwu Empire!","The battle could start at any moment.","The cultivators below the Spiritual Saint stage backed away and ran as fast as they could.","However, the entire imperial capital was under attack. Where could they possibly go?","The Spiritual Saints on Feng Wu’s side charged at the enemies.","On the Junwu Empire’s side, Emperor Wu had seven Spiritual Saints, while Feng Xiangnan had four. Together with Feng Wu, there were only fourteen Spiritual Saints. On any other day, they would be so capable.","But this time...","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The sound of fighting filled the air.","They were going to tear the Feng clan apart!","The number of Spiritual Saints in the Dayan Empire was almost doubled, and the Junwu Empire wasn’t their match.","Feng Wu’s eyes were bloodshot red, and her face was livid!","She saw with her own eyes that Feng Xiangnan was surrounded. One of his arms was almost cut off, and there were dozens of cuts on his abdomen.","The others weren’t any better.","They couldn’t withstand their enemies at all...","No matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t do anything to the terrifying Dayan Empire.","Emperor Wu’s eyes were bloodshot red, and he looked very sad.","It was over...","The Junwu Empire was going to end with him.","All members of the Junwu Empire would be executed.","The territory of the Junwu Empire would be used as an altar.","Emperor Wu recalled what Feng Wu said about the sacrificial altar. She wanted to use all of them as sacrificial offerings, but who was the sacrificial offering for?","Emperor Wu was about to stab himself in the chest with a dagger.","As the ruler of the empire, he could die but not be humiliated!","A short distance away, many guests were running for their lives, but they didn’t go very far, for they couldn’t get out of the battleground.."]},{"number":4134,"title":"Chapter 4134: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (33)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What should we do now?”","“Why is this happening all of a sudden?” “Is the Dayan Empire really going to kill us?”","“Are we really going to die?”","Everything happened so fast that they didn’t have time to react.","Only two hours ago, they were here to celebrate Feng Wu’s birthday, but now, their lives were hanging in the balance, their homes were almost gone, and their entire empire was going to be destroyed.","No one could accept that. “That’s so sudden!” “Why is this happening?”","“I don’t believe it. I don’t...”","Many refused to believe it, but many reacted in time, including Lady Northern Feng.","Right now, Lady Northern Feng was standing among the crowd. She looked over her shoulder at Feng Xiangnan and tried to go to him a few times, but was stopped each time.","“If you’re going to die, I’m going to die with you,” Lady Northern Feng murmured.","Only then did the empress dowager realize what had happened. She looked at Emperor Wu and asked anxiously, “So, it’s true. Is everything you told me true?”","Earlier, Emperor Wu said that he was going to send her to Qintai Mountain and that the Junwu Empire might be destroyed. However, the empress dowager wouldn’t believe it. Not only that, but she had also rushed out of the palace to get back at Feng Wu.","To her surprise, Emperor Wu was telling the truth, and so was Feng Wu.","Emperor Wu glanced at the empress dowager and smiled bitterly. His face was ghastly pale.","The empress dowager felt so guilty. “I had no idea that the Dayan Empire would be so cruel..","Emperor Wu smirked. “All your peaceful days were because someone was carrying the burden for you. Xiao Wu was the one who carried the burden for us, and you’re blaming her all the time!”","The empress dowager only realized how capable Feng Wu was after she was threatened by the people of the Dayan Empire. The more she watched, the more impressed she became. But now... “What do you think we should do now?”","The empress dowager was afraid of death.","Although she had been holding on, when this happened, the empress dowager was so scared that she was trembling.","As the empress dowager, she had enjoyed her life for so long that she didn’t want to die.","Emperor Wu remained silent. If the empire fell, he would die.","At that critical moment, a cold voice rang out. “Stop!","It was none other than Patriarch Helian.","Only a handful of Spiritual Sovereigns were here, and they were all fighting. The side that gained Patriarch Helian’s help would win.","In the other dimension, Prince Yan Yu raised his eyebrows when he sensed the presence of the Spiritual Sovereign. “Luo Zilin, you’re dead!”","Luo Zilin was unperturbed at all times. He glanced at Yan Yu with a half-smile. “Really?”","Yan Yu said, “Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang will arrive after me. Judging by the noise outside, they must be here. Luo Zilin, I didn’t know you would come this far. If those people in the imperial capital see this, they’ll laugh one of their heads off..”"]},{"number":4135,"title":"Chapter 4135: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (34)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4135: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (34)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin, the playboy, was known for his flashy clothes, his good horses, his beautiful face, his abode, and all the beautiful things he loved, but he didn’t do any decent things. Instead, he spent the rest of his days enjoying his life without having to take responsibility for anything. He would vent his anger on anyone he didn’t like, regardless of their social status. He was known as the young Censor Official of the imperial capital, and his days were very pleasant.","BGt other people coGldn’t do anything to him, becaGse the LGo family was his patron.","The conscientioGs and hardworking Yan YG was very displeased.","To make it worse, Luo Zilin, who spent his days playing around and flirting with women, had been secretly cultivating a skill that was as good as Yan Yu’s. The more Yan Yu thought about it, the more frustrated he became.","Seeing that he woGldn’t be able to take care of LGo Zilin, Yan YG smirked. “Hide here if YOG can!”","He left the dimension after that.","He was dumbfounded when he saw what was going on.","He had thoGght that Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang had arrived, bGt things didn’t look like this.","An impact sent all thirty SpiritGal Saints flying backward. They fell to the groGnd and spat oGt moGthfGls of blood. Some of the severely injGred ones had passed oGt.","Well...","Yan YG looked Gp and stared at the person opposite him.","“And YOG are?!” The look on Yan YG’s face was very grim.","“It’s Patriarch Huyan of the Northern Yan Kingdom.” Next to Yan Yu was Young General Yi.","Yi Ziqi reacted qGickly and was able to get away before Patriarch HGyan activated his power. Hence, his injGry was minimal, and he was still able to stand.","However, he wasn’t doing too well either, for there was blood at the corner of his moGth. The impact had to have injGred his internal organs.","“He’s a Spiritual Sovereign.” Gritting his teeth, Young Master Yi whispered in Yan Yu’s ear. “His capability is unfathomable. I don’t know what level he is, but he’s indeed very capable.”","Yan YG nodded. His face was grim, and there was a dangeroGs look in his eyes.","“Sir.” Unlike the condescending attitGde he had toward the JGnwG Empire, Yan YG had changed his demeanor. He stepped forward with a smile on his face.","“Senior HGyan, please stop. Let’s talk.”","Meanwhile, Patriarch Huyan was still fuming.","He had gone into seclGsion to forge a weapon for a little while. However, something happened to little Feng WG before he coGld finish the weapon.","Patriarch HGyan rGshed over, fearing that something woGld happen to the girl.","Therefore, Patriarch HGyan’s face darkened when he saw Yan YG.","Meanwhile, the others were astonished to see Patriarch Huyan.","Especially Emperor WG!","The empress dowager grabbed Emperor WG’s sleeve and said excitedly, “YoGr Majesty, didn’t YOG say that YOG had written to Northern Yan for help? Patriarch HGyan is here now. YoGr letter has worked! I knew it! Emperor Yan will definitely help Gs!”","Emperor Wu wondered if that was the case.","Ever since Patriarch HGyan showed Gp, he had been standing by Feng WG’s side and protecting her. He never said anything aboGt protecting the emperor.","Emperor WG had a feeling that to Patriarch HGyan, he wasn’t as important as Feng WG.","Meanwhile, in the crowd a short distance away..."]},{"number":4136,"title":"Chapter 4136: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (35)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4136: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (35)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Patriarch Huyan glared at Yan Yu, his face livid.","Meanwhile, in the crowd a short distance away...","They were astonished.","They had thought that the Junwu Empire was doomed, but things had turned around. The Patriarch of Northern Yan had come to their aid!","So, were they going to be saved?","His Majesty was so impressive. He had even persuaded the Patriarch of","Northern Yan to come to their aid. He had put Northern Yan’s fate on the line! Just then, Yan Yu turned to look at Patriarch Huyan and said in a threatening tone.","“Senior Huyan, may I ask if you’re here to represent Northern Yan or yourself?” Yan Yu’s eyes were cold, and he looked like the prince of a superior state again. Patriarch Huyan smirked. “Cut the crap and get lost with your people!”","Yan Yu’s face darkened. He had always considered himself to be a superior figure and looked down upon the Junwu Empire. However, he had just been scolded by someone from a lower-ranked kingdom. Although that person was also a Spiritual Sovereign, it still wouldn’t do.","“Senior!” Yan Yu raised his voice. “You’re only a senior when I see you in that way! Don’t think too highly of yourself!”","Patriarch Huyan said impatiently, “Cut the crap.”","Yan Yu’s face darkened even more. He glared at Patriarch Huyan and gritted his teeth. “So, you’re not going to back off, are you?”","He didn’t even address Huyan as “Senior”, which showed how frustrated he was.","Patriarch Huyan said, “No!”","Yan Yu said coldly, “That is to say, you don’t care about the lives of the people of the Northern Yan Kingdom at all. If you offend the empire, your kingdom will be destroyed as well!”","A short distance away, the crowd was terrified.","Would the kingdom be destroyed if the Dayan Empire was offended? Would Patriarch Huyan leave?","However, to their surprise, Patriarch Huyan didn’t back off. Instead, he gave Yan Yu a contemptuous look.","The look in his eyes gave Yan Yu the creeps.","Just then, a voice rang out. “Yan Yu, do you really think you’re the only one from the Davan Empire? Do vou think that Senior Huvan hasn’t been there","before? Do you really think you can fool an expert like Senior Huyan with your information? You’re so naive!”","Yan Yu glared at Luo Zilin. “Shut up!”","Luo Zilin didn’t shut up. Instead, he revealed more information. “I’m from the Dayan Empire as well. Why didn’t I know that His Majesty had given the order to destroy the Junwu Empire? Why didn’t I know that you were so influential that you could destroy an inferior kingdom whenever you wanted?”","Yan Yu glared at Luo Zilin and tried to stop the latter. “Luo Zilin, there are things you shouldn’t say. You know what I mean!”","Luo Zilin shrugged. “I don’t understand. So, I need to ask you. Who gave you the order to destroy the Junwu Empire? Is it really His Majesty? Show me the evidence.”","Yan Yu’s face turned livid. He knew that he wouldn’t be able to stop Luo Zilin.","Emperor Wu’s pale face lit up when he heard those words, and his eyes flickered.","“If His Majesty didn’t give the order, who did?!” Junwu Empire stepped forward and stared at Yan Yu.."]},{"number":4137,"title":"Chapter 4137: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (36)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4137: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (36)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Had it not been for the threat of the Dayan Empire, the Junwu Empire might have been able to withstand it.","Yan Yu smirked. “It doesn’t matter what His Majesty wants because it’s our common understanding to destroy the Junwu Empire!”","“Your common understanding? Who are you referring to?” the Emperor Wu asked.","Yan Yu guffawed. “Are you asking me that? That’s hilarious.”","However, Luo Zilin cut him off. “Who else could it be? Her Royal Highness, of course.”","Yan Yu glared at Luo Zilin. “Since you’re so eager to die, I’ll grant your wish. The princess will come to you when we get back to the empire.”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “See? You’ve admitted it.","Yan Yu said, “You!”","Luo Zilin said, “Hey, are you going to fight or not? If not, take these people and get lost. It’s so annoying.”","Prince Yan Yu was speechless.","He had no choice but to ask for Senior Huyan’s help again. “What does the Junwu Empire pay you? I’ll double it. No, I’ll give you ten times what they offer you!”","Until now, Yan Yu still thought that Patriarch Huyan had been bought over.","However, Patriarch Huyan only gave him a “you idiot” look and shook his head.","Yan Yu asked, ‘After we destroy the Junwu Empire, how about we give this land to Northern Yan?”","Logically speaking, Patriarch Huyan would have said yes, for it would double the size of Northern Yan.","The crowd believed that Patriarch Huyan would say yes. After all, it was a large piece of land.","The empress dowager grew nervous as well, for if she were Patriarch Huyan, she would definitely say yes!","Hence, the empress dowager grabbed Emperor Wu and said, “Your Majesty, do","something. Quickly...” If there was anything else, give it to Patriarch Huyan so that he won’t abandon us!”","Before Emperor Wu could say anything, Patriarch Huyan smirked at Yan Yu. “Cut the crap! Don’t you understand what I’m saying?” Yan Yu said, “You’re not here for the Junwu Empire, are you? You’re here for...”","He pointed at Feng Wu. “You’re here for her, aren’t you?”","Patriarch Huyan found the man talking too much.","If he let Yan Yu know that Feng Wu was the final disciple of his master, with how hostile those people were toward his master, his junior sister would have a very difficult time living there in the future. Hence, he couldn’t expose her identity.","At that thought, Patriarch Huyan made his move. “Let’s do it, then!”","He was a Spiritual Sovereign, and a very advanced one at that. As soon as Patriarch Huyan struck out, Yan Yu almost couldn’t withstand it.","What a powerful being!","Even in the Dayan Empire, such a person was a formidable figure.","Moreover, he found the person rather familiar.","“You are...” Yan Yu stared at Patriarch Huyan. “Have I seen you somewhere before?!”","Without another word, Patriarch Huyan went on fighting.","Thump!","His fist smashed into Yan Yu, sending the latter flying backward.","This time, Yan Yu was indeed severely injured, but what happened reminded him of a time long ago when he was punched away.","That person had the same temper, the same spiritual essence, and the same stances...","“Who’s Mr. Wuya to you?!” Yan Yu cried out.","Mr. Wuya?","The people of the Junwu Empire didn’t know the name, but those from the Yan Empire opened their eyes wide.."]},{"number":4138,"title":"Chapter 4138: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (37)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4138: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (37)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The people of the Junwu Empire didn’t know the name, but those from the Yan Empire opened their eyes wide.","Mr. Wuya?","Was there a connection between this Senior Huyan and Mr. Wuya? If so, it would be so terrifying!","Senior Huyan only smiled. ‘Why did you bring up my eldest senior brother?” The eldest senior brother?","That surprised not only the people of the Dayan Empire but Feng Wu as well.","Patriarch Huyan’s senior brother was hers as well!","What kind of a person was this Senior Brother Wuya?","Feng Wu could see how astonished and revered the people of the Dayan Empire were.","Revered?","Was her senior brother that capable?","Yan Yu was shocked by the news as well. “Senior, are you a disciple of the Sacred Mu Cliff?”","What was the Sacred Mu Cliff? Feng Wu looked curiously at Patriarch Huyan.","However, Patriarch Huyan nodded without hesitation. “That’s right.” Yan Yu drew in his breath.","He couldn’t for the life of him figure out why someone from a low-ranking kingdom would be associated with the Sacred Mu Cliff, which was the sacred ground of the empire!","Although there were only a few members, it was still a sacred ground for super forces!","He took a deep breath and thought to himself, “The Junwu Empire is easy to bully, but no one will dare to pick on the people of Sacred Mu Cliff.”","Who could do that?","No one would be capable enough!","At that thought, he could only ask again, “Senior, are you determined to protect the Junwu Empire? Do you have to?!”","Even the eldest princess would have a headache when dealing with people from Sacred Mu Cliff. Therefore, if that was what Senior Huyan meant, Yan Yu would have to come up with a new plan.","The others all looked eagerly at Patriarch Huyan.","Especially the empress dowager, who was waiting for Patriarch Huyan to say","yes.","Of course it was.","If it wasn’t for the Junwu Empire, who else would he do it for?","However, Patriarch Huyan only patted Feng Wu’s head and snorted at Yan Yu. “Don’t you know? I’m protecting this girl. The Junwu Empire has nothing to do with me!”","WHAT?!","Those words shocked everyone again.","They had lost count of how many times they had been shocked today. All they knew was that things had turned out to be more unexpected than they had anticipated, and they had been shocked over and over again!","Protect Feng Wu, not the Junwu Empire?","The empress dowager panicked and involuntarily tugged at Emperor Wu’s sleeve. “Your Majesty?!” Say something!","However, Emperor Wu nodded earnestly. “That’s right. Patriarch Huyan is indeed here for Xiao Wu.”","The empress dowager said, “That’s impossible!”","Emperor Wu said, “That’s the truth!”","The empress dowager asked, “Why? Because of that girl? Is she capable enough to do that?”","Emperor Wu nodded. “Xiao Wu is much more capable than you think. Mother, she’s more capable than you can imagine.”","The empress dowager was speechless.","The empress dowager was dumbfounded and couldn’t believe what she was seeing.","When did she know who Feng Wu was? It seemed to be two years ago, when Feng Wu was so weak and had so few connections. Since when did she become so capable? Even the empress dowager felt that she had to look up to the girl.."]},{"number":4139,"title":"Chapter 4139 Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (38)","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, everyone was shocked by what Patriarch Huyan said. Feng Xun and Lady Northern Feng had already come back.","Lady Northern Feng turned to Feng Xun. “Wh- what’s going on?”","Feng Xun was elated. He then turned to Lady Northern Feng and said, “I know that. Patriarch Huyan really treats Xiao Wu very well. When we went to Northern Yan, we lived in his tower. Even the king of Northern Yan couldn’t enter it at will.”","Lady Northern Feng was pleasantly surprised as well. “Good, good.” She was worried that Patriarch Huyan was only joking. If that was the case, what would happen to Xiao Wu?","Meanwhile, Yan Yu stared at Patriarch Huyan and suddenly said, “If you’re protecting this girl, fine. We won’t touch her, but you can take her with you.”","What was that supposed to mean?","Although Yan Yu didn’t say it explicitly, everyone understood what he meant.","“So, Patriarch Huyan is only protecting Feng Wu?”","“What should we do? What about the Junwu Empire?”","“Didn’t Yan Yu mean that Patriarch Huyan should take Feng Wu away? Are the rest of us going to die?!”","Many people were so agitated that they burst into tears.","What should they do?","What should they do?","Right now, everyone looked at Feng Wu as if she was their savior. Even those who didn’t like Feng Wu before now looked at her expectantly.","“Help us... Feng Wu is our only hope now...”"]},{"number":4140,"title":"Chapter 4140: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (39)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He glared at Feng Wu. “I can let your family go with you.”","Everyone in the Junwu Empire stared at Feng Wu nervously.","Especially the empress dowager, who was looking at Feng Wu in a way that even she herself couldn’t see.","Feng Wu smiled. “I told you already. The Junwu Empire is here, and I’m here! If the Junwu Empire falls, I’ll die with it!”","This was a kingdom that Jun Linyuan wanted to protect, and she had to protect it for him no matter what.","Emperor Wu was touched.","Everyone of the Junwu Empire was touched.","Even the empress dowager looked at Feng Wu with tears in her eyes. She looked at Feng Wu as if she was looking at a fairy. Why was this girl so","adorable?","However, Yan Yu was obviously infuriated. He glared at Feng Wu and said, “So, you’re going to learn it the hard way!”","Feng Wu smirked. “How are you going to punish us, then?”","He ignored Feng Wu and turned to Patriarch Huyan. “Senior Huyan, did you hear that? I gave her a chance and even let her leave with her family, but she turned me down. I’m not to be blamed.”","Patriarch Huyan glanced at him and smirked.","Yan Yu wasn’t intimidated. Even though he knew that Patriarch Huyan was from the Sacred Mu Cliff, he only bowed a little. However, he remained where he was, for he knew that if he couldn’t do it today, he would never be able to do it again.","Why weren’t Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang here yet?","At that critical moment, Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang arrived.","Whoosh!","Two streaks of light flashed across the sky in the distance and landed on the ground.","“My lord?” Uncle Yan was surprised to see this. Wasn’t the battle supposed to be one-sided? Why was there a confrontation?","It meant that they were evenly matched.","Yan Yu glanced at Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang. The next second, he jumped up and pounced at Feng Wu.","To defeat the enemy, one had to catch the leader first. Feng Wu was the leader here. Everything would be fine as long as she was caught!","To Yan Yu’s surprise, Feng Wu was already prepared for battle and had even made a secret plan with Little Phoenix. Therefore, when Yan Yu pounced at","Feng Wu, Feng Wu crouched down and slid past him.","Little Phoenix spat out a mouthful of poisonous gas.","Because Little Phoenix could turn invisible, and it hadn’t shown up yet, Prince Yan Yu had no idea of its existence. Hence, he was caught off guard.","“What’s that?!” Yan Yu tried to wipe his face, for he felt itchy all over, especially his eyes. Tears rolled down his cheeks.","However, before he could do anything, Patriarch Huyan flared up.","“How dare you sneak up on Xiao WII?!” Infuriated, Patriarch Huyan picked up","Yan Yu.","Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang weren’t to be trifled with. They charged at Patriarch Huyan as soon as the crown prince made his move!","Just then, Patriarch Huyan grabbed Yan Yu with one hand, lifted him up, and stared at the two men. “Do you still want your prince alive? Or do you want to collect his body?”","It was a blatant threat...","Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang exchanged looks and both saw frustration in each other’s eyes.."]},{"number":4141,"title":"Chapter 4141: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (40)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4141: Clouds Follow Dragons and Wind Follow Tigers (40)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mr. Huyan was so fast that he was definitely better than them.","Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang stared at Mr. Huyan, and Uncle Yan narrowed his eyes. “Put the prince down!”","Patriarch Huyan didn’t beat around the bush. He tossed Yan Yu over. “Catch.” And the force he used was terrifying!","Both Uncle Yan and Uncle Wang exerted all their strength and almost lost their footing. However, even if they did catch Yan Yu, his face went ghastly pale. He covered his chest with both hands and only calmed down after a while.","“Let’s go!” Without another word, he led the others away.","These people were indeed from the Yan manor. They left without asking any unnecessary questions.","People of the Junwu Empire were over the moon.","Was the person who wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire finally leaving? However, Yan Yu stopped after a few steps.","Everyone held their breaths as soon as he stopped. What was it now?","Yan Yu looked from the crowd to Feng Wu and smirked. “Do you think you’ve won? No.","“Patriarch Huyan is here to protect you, but remember this: the empire is more powerful than you think!","“And you, Patriarch Huyan.","“Sacred Mu Cliff used to be so powerful that all forces trembled in fear, but now that Master Mu is gone, is it still the same? I hope you’ll behave yourself and don’t bring Mr. Wuya any trouble!","“I’ll be back in a year!","“The day I come here will be the day the Junwu Empire falls.”","Before that... Yan Yu had a cold look in his eyes. It seemed that they really could work on the Sacred Mu Cliff now.","Disciples of the Sacred Mu Cliff were in the Junwu Empire and were protecting a girl, who had the same Divine Phoenix Blood as Master Mu. That was a very big deal, and the princess would be interested.","Of course, the Yan manor wasn’t enough to handle the Sacred Mu Cliff. They had to get the princess involved.","Yan Yu gave Feng Wu a long look, left a one-year promise, and left with the others.","They left promptly, leaving behind a mess after the battle.","An idea struck Patriarch Huyan, and he said to Feng Wu, “Take care of yourself! ”","“What about you?” Involuntarily, Feng Wu took Patriarch Huyan’s arm. Patriarch Huyan said, “It’s urgent. I’m afraid I can’t stay.”","Patriarch Huyan left as quickly as he came as if he had never been there. But because of him, the Junwu Empire remained intact. Otherwise, it would have been wiped out already.","After that, many people realized how important it was to have a capable cultivator.","Today was supposed to be Feng Wu’s birthday, but after everything that had happened, no one was in the mood to attend the banquet anymore. They all left.","Lady Wang, Feng Sang, and the others saw the guests off.","Only Emperor Wu, the empress dowager, and a few others left behind.","Emperor Wu looked into Feng Wu’s eyes. He knew better than anyone else that if it hadn’t been for Feng Wu, Patriarch Huyan wouldn’t have arrived. The Junwu Empire would have been in ruins by now.."]},{"number":4142,"title":"Chapter 4142: New Start (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4142: New Start (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Xiao Wu...” Emperor Wu patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “I’ll cut to the chase. After all, the Junwu Empire is mine now, but it’ll be yours and the crown prince’s one day.”","Feng Wu was dumbfounded. Although she wanted to explain, a lot of people rushed to her side and thanked her in excitement.","They saw with their own eyes that Feng Wu had indeed saved them all.","A few steps away, Lady Wang and Feng Sang exchanged looks.","Looking at Feng Wu and recalling what they had done to her, they shuddered inwardly...","The empress dowager stood next to Emperor Wu and watched Feng Wu with an indescribable feeling in her heart. Involuntarily, she looked away, for she felt rather embarrassed when she recalled what she had done to Feng Wu.","“Let’s go back.” The empress dowager left in a sorry state. Emperor Wu nodded at Feng Wu. “Come to see me after this is over.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Emperor Wu left as well.","In the end, only members of the Feng clan were there.","“Xiao Wu...” Lady Wang hesitantly took a few steps forward with a guilty look on her face. “Xiao Wu, it was all my fault. I shouldn’t have...”","Feng Wu looked at Lady Wang indifferently and waved her off. “It’s all in the past now, and you’ve turned over a new leaf. Don’t bring it up again.”","All Lady Wang wanted was for Feng Wu not to take her revenge. As a matter of fact, Feng Wu wasn’t going to do anything about it, for she was already a Spiritual Saint and wouldn’t bother with someone like Lady Wang.","“Wait, where’s Xiaoqi?” Looking around, Feng Wu didn’t see Feng Xiaoqi anywhere and was perplexed.","The kid had gone to see Luo Zilin and had come back with him. Why was he gone all of a sudden?","“Don’t tell me he’s gone to the inner courtyard” Feng Wu murmured to herself as she quickly walked toward the inner courtyard.","Seeing Feng Wu leave, Lady Wang looked a little shaken. She then turned to Feng Sang and said, “Feng Wu is so powerful now that we can’t even begin to imagine. We can’t afford to offend her. Got it?”","Patting her chest, Feng Sang nodded and said, “Of course, I don’t dare to offend her now. I’ve been treating her nicely and taking good care of Fallen Star Yard.","Mum, aren’t you the same?”","Feng Yanfeng chimed in. “Xiao Wu may seem cold to us, but she’s kind deep down. After what we did to her, she forgave us in the end... We have to be nicer to her from now on.”","Feng Yanfeng’s family had made up their mind that they would stick to Feng Wu from now on. What they didn’t know was...","Something big was happening in Fallen Star Yard!","Feng Wu had been wondering why Feng Xiaoqi wasn’t in the front yard, but when she walked into Fallen Star Yard, she realized that something wasn’t right.","Granny Zhao and Uncle Qiu were lying in the courtyard. One was facing upward, and the other was lying in the mud... They didn’t move at all and looked like they were dead!","Feng Wu was shocked. “Granny Zhao!","“Uncle Qiu!”","Feng Wu rushed over to check their breathing.","They were barely breathing, but luckily, they weren’t dead.","“Luo Zilin!” Feng Wu called out.."]},{"number":4143,"title":"Chapter 4143: New Start (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin had been loitering outside, but when he heard Feng Wu’s voice, he rushed in. “What’s wrong? What’s wrong?”","He then saw the two elderly servants, who were barely breathing and lying on the ground.","By then, Feng Wu had already rushed into the room.","Luo Zilin looked around and realized the danger, so he followed Feng Wu in.","“Mum?! Mum?!”","Feng Wu rushed into the beautiful lady’s room, but there was no one there.","“Xiaoqi?! Feng Xiaoqi?!”","Feng Wu searched every room and every corner, but they were nowhere to be found. Feng Wu panicked, and her head went blank!","“Luo Zilin! My mother is missing, and so is Xiaoqi!” Feng Wu turned around and looked at Luo Zilin.","Feng Wu’s mother and Xiaoqi were the people that had warmed Feng Wu’s heart ever since she came to this world. Protecting her family was what motivated Feng Wu to keep making breakthroughs, but now, her family, the most important thing to her, was gone!","“They’re probably out there! I’ll go get them!” Feng Wu rushed out.","Meanwhile, Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and Duan Chaoge were still around. They were walking toward Fallen Star Yard when they saw Feng Wu rushing out of Fallen Star Yard.","“Xiao Wu!” Feng Xun panicked. He wanted to run up to Feng Wu, but Feng Wu was simply too fast for him to catch up with!","Feng Wu was genuinely anxious.","Yes, Feng Xiaoqi would run around, but not the beautiful lady!","“Feng Xun, my mother is missing, and so is Xiaoqi!” Feng Wu ran around like a headless fly.","Hearing that, Feng Xun and the others started searching for Feng Wu as well.","Just then, Xuan Yi, who went into the house next door, cried out in surprise. “Grandpa!”","The garden next door belonged to Grand Secretary Fang. Not only was Grand Secretary Fang Xuan Yi’s grandfather, but he was also Feng Xiaoqi’s teacher. And Xuan Yi’s voice was so shrill... Xuan Yi would never have reacted like this if he hadn’t been so shocked.","Feng Wu dashed toward the house next door, where Xuan Yi was holding an old man in his arms. He was panic-stricken.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched, and she had a very bad feeling.","As expected, she ran up to the old man lying in Xuan Yi’s arms...","It was Grand Secretary Fang...","Feng Wu rushed to Grand Secretary Fang’s side and checked his breathing. However, Grand Secretary Fang was no longer breathing.","Feng Wu checked his pulse in a fluster and realized that she couldn’t feel his pulse.","“Let me.”","Before she knew it, Luo Zilin had arrived. He pulled Feng Wu to the side with a grim look on his face while he examined Grand Secretary Fang. As soon as he examined the old man, Luo Zilin knew that something was wrong.","Because...","“He’s dead. I’m sorry for your loss.” Luo Zilin sighed.","Dead?","Was Grand Secretary Fang dead just like that?","Grand Secretary Fang, who had helped Feng Wu and taught Xiaoqi, was dead?","“That’s impossible! I don’t believe it! Luo Zilin, get out of my way!” Feng Wu rushed over and pushed Luo Zilin to the side. She then took a deep breath and checked Grand Secretary Fang’s pulse.","She said, “I just couldn’t find his pulse, that’s all. Big deal. I’ll find it soon. I...’ Before Feng Wu could finish, Xuan Yi looked at her in sorrow.","Feng Wu still couldn’t find his pulse, but she was still stuffing elixirs into Grand Secretary Fang’s mouth.."]},{"number":4144,"title":"Chapter 4144: New Start (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She put Supreme Level and Semi-divine pills into Grand Secretary Fang’s mouth.","“Swallow it! Swallow it! You’ll come back to life!”","“Xiao Wu!” Xuan Yi grabbed Feng Wu’s sleeve, shook his head at her, and said in a sorrowful voice, “...Grandpa is dead.”","Feng Wu blanched, but she still wouldn’t give up. She tried her best to save Grand Secretary Fang, but in the end... Grand Secretary Fang was beyond saving.","Everyone’s face darkened.","Just then, Luo Zilin returned, and Feng Wu asked anxiously, “Have you heard from my mother and Xiaoqi?”","Luo Zilin shook his head.","Even Luo Zilin, who had always been unperturbed, had a solemn look on his face. He looked at Feng Wu and said, “I’m afraid it’s not going to be easy. Calm down. You won’t be able to solve the problem no matter how anxious you are.”","Feng Wu nodded, took a deep breath to calm herself down, and asked, “Do you have any leads?”","Luo Zilin shook his head.","Feng Wu said coldly, “No lead is the biggest lead. If something goes wrong, there must be a trace. So, it has to be a cultivator much more capable than them.”","Just then, Luo Zilin crouched down and examined Grand Secretary Fang. In the end, he said, “I think we have a lead now.”","“Speak!” Feng Wu prompted.","“That’s the smell of Skull Leaf Grass.” Luo Zilin pointed at Grand Secretary Fang’s chest.","Grand Secretary Fang was struck in the chest and killed.","“The Skull Leaf Grass only grows in the territory of the Dayan Empire. You don’t have it on this continent at the moment, so we can conclude that someone from the empire is involved,” Luo Zilin said calmly.","The first person that came to Feng Wu’s mind was Yan Yu.","“And there’s the palm print. If I remember it correctly, it was left behind by a Spiritual Sovereign. Spiritual Saints can’t do that,” said Luo Zilin.","Feng Wu nodded. “Dayan Empire, Spiritual Sovereign.” That was Luo Zilin’s conclusion.","There was no enmity between Grand Secretary Fang and the Dayan Empire, so how could he be targeted by the Spiritual Sovereign and assassinated? Or did Grand Secretary Fang’s death have something to do with the disappearance of ner morner ana maoqlf","“Under Grand Secretary Fang’s nails...” After a closer look, Feng Wu saw that there was a little black mud under Grand Secretary Fang’s nails.","Feng Wu realized right away that it was the black mud of Fallen Star Yard!","Feng Wu had carefully set up the entire Fallen Star Yard with a formation. She had even enhanced the black mud with her spiritual essence, so she recognized it right away.","“How can there be black mud under Grand Secretary Fang’s fingernails? Could it be that when Xiaoqi was taken away, Grand Secretary Fang only managed to grab someone’s shoe when he tried to grab Xiaoqi?”","Feng Wu examined Grand Secretary Fang’s nails and saw that they were indeed scratched.","“Grand Secretary Fang must be the last person to see Xiaoqi and my mom!” Feng Wu said affirmatively. “Grand Secretary Fang wanted to save my mom and Xiaoqi, but they were so powerful that Grand Secretary Fang...”","“I think you’re right,” Luo Zilin said to Feng Wu. “If that’s the case, your mother and Xiaoqi should still be alive. If they really want to kill someone, they could have done it, just like what they did to Grand Secretary Fang. They wouldn’t have gone through so much trouble to take the body away..”"]},{"number":4145,"title":"Chapter 4145 New Start (4)","paragraphs":["“Who took my mother and Xiaoqi? How dare they kill Grand Secretary Fang?!” Feng Wu clenched her fists. She wasn’t going to let that person pay for this!","So what if they were Spiritual Sovereigns? Yes, that was a capable cultivator, but she was already a Spiritual Saint!","“Where are you going?” Seeing that Feng Wu was heading for the door, Luo Zilin stopped her.","“Go find Yan Yu and his people!” Feng Wu said calmly, but she wasn’t calm at all.","Luo Zilin said, “Yan Yu has a lot of people on his side. If you go to him now, you’ll only get yourself killed. Plus, are you sure he’s the one who has taken your family?”","Feng Wu said, “Even if he didn’t do it, he had something to do with it!”","Luo Zilin said, “The strike that killed Grand Secretary Fang’s is indeed similar to the Killer Palm from the Yan Manor, but it’s only similar. There’s no conclusive evidence.”","Feng Wu said, “They’re not your family, so of course you’re not in a rush!”","Seeing that Feng Wu was going to leave, Luo Zilin said anxiously, “Trust me. I’m in a more urgent state than you think!”","Feng Wu wouldn’t believe him.","Luo Zilin said in resignation, “Alright, I’ll take you to Yan Yu, but I don’t know if I’ll be able to catch up with him.”","Luo Zilin led Feng Wu onto his flying sword and headed for the Dongsang Kingdom.","Yan Yu had made a promise that he wouldn’t do anything to the kingdom for a year.","When they arrived at the Dongsang Kingdom, they saw the miserable state the kingdom was in. Feng Wu’s eyes widened because this place was almost completely different from what she saw last time."]},{"number":4146,"title":"Chapter 4146: Dynasty Road (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Can you tell me how the Junwu Empire got away?” Night Owl stared at Feng Wu and asked, “How did you get away?","All Feng Wu could think of was...","If she couldn’t protect the Junwu Empire in a year, all the people of the Junwu Empire would be slaughtered.","Feng Wu clenched her fists. Was being weak their fault?","Wherever capable cultivators went, all hell broke loose, and no one could blame them!","“These people are innocent!” Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Luo Zilin looked at Feng Wu and said seriously, “That’s why you have to become stronger. Only when you’re stronger than him will you not be bullied. Look, he didn’t even dare to make a sound in front of Senior Huyan.”","Feng Wu clenched her fists and nodded. Luo Zilin was right. She had to work harder!","“Let’s go!”","Feng Wu and Luo Zilin charged forward again.","In the far north, there was a place where the continent met the Dayan Empire, and that was the only way to get to the empire. If Yan Yu and the others wanted to leave, they would have to use this passageway as well.","When Feng Wu and Luo Zilin arrived, Yan Yu and the others had opened the tunnel and were ready to go in.","Feng Wu glanced around but couldn’t see the beautiful lady or Xiaoqi anywhere.","“Yan Yu doesn’t smell like the Skull Leaf Grass, nor does anyone else,” Luo Zilin whispered to Feng Wu.","Yan Yu was about to go in when he heard the noise and came back to himself. He smiled a little when he saw Feng Wu. “I was wondering who it was. So, it’s Feng Wu. Are you here for me?”","Feng Wu studied Yan Yu’s face, trying to figure out what he was thinking.","Yan Yu smiled casually and went up to Feng Wu. Crossing his arms, he asked, “What? You don’t want me to leave? Do you want to come with me? I’ll make you a concubine when we get back. What do you think?”","“Yan Yu!” Luo Zilin gave him a warning look.","“Oh, I forgot about that. You’ve hooked up with Luo Zilin and taken the Luo family’s path,” Yan Yu smiled. “I can tell you now that the path you’re taking is a dead end!”","He turned to leave after that.","“You have something to do with my mother and Xiaoqi’s disappearance, don’t you?” Feng Wu asked in a cold voice as she watched him leave.","He smirked, turned around, and stared at Feng Wu. “Really? Why do you think","Feng Wu kept her unblinking gaze on him. “Because you talk too much and you’re trying to change the subject.”","Yan Yu smirked, “But you’re wrong. I didn’t take them. Go look for them if you don’t believe me. See if your mother and brother are in the crowd.”","Feng Wu turned to Luo Zilin and said, “There’s another person, and he’s more capable than all of them.”","Luo Zilin clenched his fists and asked Yan Yu, “Who’s that?”","Yan Yu laughed. “I didn’t know you could deduce such things. Well, I can tell you, but how about we make a bet?”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “What do you mean?”","He pointed at the glowing passageway behind them and said to Feng Wu, “You can reach the Dayan Empire from here. It’s called an express tunnel..”"]},{"number":4147,"title":"Chapter 4147: Dynasty Road (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But there’s another way, which is called Dynasty Road. It’s not a direct route, but one that’s full of twists and turns. Through these obstacles, you can also reach the Dayan Empire.","“If you can become the top contestant in Dynasty Road, that person will give your mother and brother back to you.”","Feng Wu stared at Yan Yu. “Who’s that person?!”","Yan Yu pursed his lips. “Don’t ask who that person is. I can’t afford to offend them, nor can Luo Zilin. Apart from yourself, no one can save them.”","Feng Wu turned to look at Luo Zilin, who was obviously displeased. Feng Wu asked, “Do you know who it is?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “If that’s the case...","Luo Zilin hesitated. “If that’s really the case, even the Luo family won’t be able to handle it.”","Who was that person? Why was the whole thing so mysterious?","But with everything that had happened, Feng Wu didn’t have any other choice. Moreover, she could still take the risk.","“Why is there a first place on Dynasty Road?” Feng Wu stared at Yan Yu.","Yan Yu grinned. “You’re not the only one walking that path. You can assume that your continent is on the west and the Dayan Empire is on the east- Tn the","middle is the area of the desert and ancient ruins, and there are countless tunnels from the west to the east. However, the tunnels will converge in the end, and when they reach the Dayan Empire, they’ll form a main road.","“On your way here, you’ll earn points from killing magical beasts, obtaining the legacies of the ancient ruins, or breaking the exam record.","“Of course, in the late stage, killing other participants will give you a percentage of the points.","“Once you’re on Dynasty Road, you won’t be invisible anymore. The referees will know everything you’ve done. As for the referees, one of them is from Yan Manor.” Yan Yu gave Feng Wu a half-smile. “Do you dare to take the challenge?”","Luo Zilin said, “The Luo family has one as well.”","Feng Wu nodded.","“So does the Sacred Mu Cliff as well,” Luo Zilin said to Feng Wu.","Luo Zilin didn’t know the real relationship between Feng Wu and the Sacred Mu Cliff, but he knew that they were on friendly terms. If the Sacred Mu Cliff and the Luo family helped Feng Wu, she would be treated like a princess in the Dayan Empire.","Feng Wu nodded again. “Alright.”","Yan Yu glanced at Feng Wu with a half-smile and said, “In that case, I’ll see you in Dayan Empire, my dear girl.”","What was that supposed to mean? Luo Zilin was the first to lose his temper. However, before he could say anything, Yan Yu marched into the tunnel and disappeared from sight.","“The Dynasty Road is very dangerous,” Luo Zilin said in frustration. “Plus, I’ve already walked Dynasty Road, so I can’t be by your side to protect you. In fact, even if we don’t take Dynasty Road, I can take you to the Dayan Empire. With the Luo family’s protection, you’ll be able to do whatever you want in the empire.”","“But with Lord Yan and the princess working together, the Luo family can only fend for themselves. There’s nothing else you can do, right?” Feng Wu looked at Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin said, “Well...","Feng Wu said seriously, “Since Yan Yu has made an offer, it means that my mother and Xiaoqi are safe for the time being. After you go back, you can ask around for me..”"]},{"number":4148,"title":"Chapter 4148: Dynasty Road (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin nodded. “Of course, I’ll ask around for you, but you...”","“Don’t worry. Dynasty Road may seem dangerous, but it won’t be a problem for me.” Feng Wu paused, then said in a solemn tone, “Didn’t Yan Yu say that there are a lot of places with treasures and heritage of ancient ruins on Dynasty","Road?”","Luo Zilin nodded.","Feng Wu said, “I’ll go find the treasure and heritage. When I reach the Dayan","Empire, I’ll become a Spiritual Sovereign! ”","Luo Zilin almost choked on his own spit. “What did you just say? A Spiritual","Sovereign?”","Feng Wu nodded and said seriously, “That’s right. I’m going to become a Spiritual Sovereign, and only a Spiritual Sovereign can walk freely in the Dayan Empire. Am I right?”","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “You think too highly of the Dayan Empire, then. It’s not as scary as you think. A Spiritual Sovereign can do a lot more than walking around freely in the empire. They can do whatever they want. Think about it. Isn’t that Senior Huyan a Spiritual Sovereign? Yan Yu was scared out of his wits, too. And look at Yan Yu’s guard. He’s only a peak Spiritual Saint.”","Feng Wu was already a Spiritual Saint now, not to mention that she was an advanced one. However, she didn’t know if she would ever have the chance to make another breakthrough. After all, to make a breakthrough into the Spiritual Sovereign stage required more than talent, but luck as well. Feng Wu said, “If luck is the key, trust me. I’ve never lost to anyone before.”","After they got back to the Junwu Empire, Feng Wu went to look for Emperor wu.","Feng Wu didn’t see Emperor Wu when she went to court. Instead, she ran into the empress dowager in the long corridor.","The empress dowager tried to walk away when she saw Feng Wu.","Ever since the incident with Yan Yu, the empress dowager had felt an instinctive sense of guilt and reverence for Feng Wu. She didn’t know how to handle such complicated feelings, so she chose to stay out of the way.","Hence, she turned to leave when she saw Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was speechless.","After a few steps, the empress dowager suddenly realized that she was the empress dowager. Why should she leave?","Even if she had underestimated Feng Wu, it didn’t mean much. She was the empress dowager, and no one would dare to criticize her.","At that thought, the empress dowager was filled with confidence and courage. She turned around and glanced at Feng Wu, who was about to walk past her to see Emperor Wu.","“You don’t even greet me? What? Do you hate me that much?” The empress dowager’s voice was cold and hard.","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on. This empress dowager was so hard to handle.","She glanced at the empress dowager. “Can I help you with something?”","The empress dowager was speechless. Was that how a junior treated her?","The empress dowager wasn’t used to having her temper under control. Just when she was about to flare up, Granny Lan stepped out and smiled at the empress dowager. “Your Majesty, didn’t you say that Miss Feng Wu helped you a few days ago and that you were going to reward her?”","The empress dowager darted a haughty look at Feng Wu and said grumpily, “Why should I reward her for her stubborn attitude? Heh!”","The corner of Granny Lan’s mouth twitched, and she didn’t know what to say.","The empress dowager was the one who had been sighing about how wonderful Miss Feng Wu was and how wrong herself had been. Unfortunately, the empress dowager was as stubborn as His Royal Highness.."]},{"number":4149,"title":"Chapter 4149: Dynasty Road (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to chat with the empress dowager, for she still had something very important to tell Emperor Wu.","The empress dowager was furious as she watched Feng Wu leave.","“She left just like that?!”","“I’m her future grandmother! Is that how she treats me?!","“Look at the look on her face. She’s so eager to leave that she doesn’t want to talk to me anymore! She’s so capable now!”","Granny Lan sighed. Why did the empress dowager have to say such mean things? She had changed her opinion of Miss Feng Wu and even said that she would agree to her marriage with the crown prince, but the words coming out of her mouth felt like daggers...","Meanwhile, the empress dowager was equally frustrated. She smacked her own mouth and wondered why she could be so mean. She decided that she would show Feng Wu some respect the next time the girl came to court.","No one knew when Feng Wu would be in court again, which was something the empress dowager didn’t expect.","Feng Wu entered Emperor Wu’s study.","No one knew what they talked about, but Master Gao saw the serious look on Feng Wu’s face when she left.","Feng Wu went back to the Fallen Star Yard to find Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and Duan Chaoge waiting for her. Seeing her, Duan Chaoge rushed to her side. “Xiao Wu, where are Xiaoqi and your mother...”","Seeing how hesitant they were, Feng Wu knew that they were worried, so she told them about how she and Luo Zilin had stopped Yan Yu.","“So, Auntie and Xiaoqi are fine, and someone from the Dayan Empire did it?” Duan Chaoge was furious. “That abominable Dayan Empire! Why are they everywhere?! What do they want?!”","Feng Xun was furious as well. “I really want to go to the Dayan Empire now!”","“But we’re not strong enough yet...” Xuan Yi looked a little angry. All of a sudden, he turned his serious gaze on Feng Wu. “We want to get stronger, and we have to!”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin and thought the same. Feng Xun and the others were very capable when the people of the Dayan Empire didn’t show up, but now that they were here, Feng Xun and the others weren’t capable enough.","Chaoge was a junior Spiritual Overlord now, while Xuan Yi and Feng Xun were intermediate Spiritual Overlords. It would take them a lot of effort to make any progress, and they would have to have enough fortuitous encounters!","“That’s why I want to go to Dynasty Road! ” Xuan Yi said earnestly. “My grandfather’s death has made me realize that this is a world where the strong are respected. I have to get stronger and take revenge for my grandfather!”","Feng Wu didn’t answer Xuan Yi right away. Just then, Feng Xun said in a serious tone, “I have to get stronger, too! I saw you getting bullied by that Young General Yi, and I didn’t know what to do. Xiao Wu... How can I be your brother? I have to get stronger!”","“And me! Xiao Wu, you’re making breakthroughs so fast that I don’t want to be left behind. Take me with you! I won’t be a burden! I’ll work hard to become stronger!”","Feng Wu pursed her lips. “Dynasty Road is very dangerous, and I don’t know if I can get out of here alive. You...’","Chaoge said, “I’m not afraid! I’d rather die than become a cripple!”","“Me, too!”","“Me, too!”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Luo Zilin said, “There’s something Yan Yu didn’t tell you earlier. Entering Dynasty Road isn’t a one-on-one thing. You have to be in a group of five.."]},{"number":4150,"title":"Chapter 4150: Dynasty Road (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You won’t get in on your own, and you’ll die anyway.","“There are four of you now, and you’re still one more member.” Luo Zilin looked at Feng Wu. “Dynasty Road is a very important place, so be careful.” Feng Wu gave it some thought and asked Luo Zilin, “Will four people do it?”","Luo Zilin shook his head. “No, it has to be five.”","Feng Wu asked, “Can’t you do it?”","Luo Zilin said, “I’ve been there before, and I’m a Spiritual Sovereign. I can’t do it.”","Feng Wu was speechless. For a moment, she couldn’t think of a good candidate.","“Xiao wu! Xiao wu!”","Just then, footsteps and anxious voices came from outside. Feng Wu looked over her shoulder and saw a figure rushing toward her like a small tornado.","It was none other than Yu Mingye, whom she hadn’t seen in a while.","“I can do it! I can do it!” Yu Mingye ran into the room in excitement, raising his hand as he ran, fearing that someone might leave him behind.","Feng Xun was frustrated when he saw Yu Mingye. He mumbled, “Why does he look so unreliable?”","Yu Mingye glanced at Feng Xun and ignored him. He then ran to Feng Wu’s side and tried to hold her hand. However, Feng Wu wouldn’t let him, so Yu Mingye had to tug at her sleeve. “Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu, can you take me there?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Feng Xun was dumbfounded, Xuan Yi rubbed his forehead, and Chaoge didn’t know what to say...","Feng Wu looked from Feng Xun to Luo Zilin. “Him, then?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “It’s your decision. By the way, this is the family token of the","Luo family. It may work if you run into danger on Dynasty Road. After all, the","Luo family is one of the top four forces.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “The top four forces? What are they?”","Luo Zilin said, “The Dayan Empire you’re talking about, is it a force that controls the entire continent and is respected by all people?”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it not?”","Luo Zilin said, “Yes and no. It used to be the case with the Dayan Empire, but ever since Master Mu Jiuzhou left the empire, the empire has lost a lot of control.","“Many forces have separated from the Dayan Empire.","“Therefore, the four super forces are the weakened Dayan Empire, the Sacred Mu Cliff, the Luo family, and the residence of Prince Yan.","“Apart from that, there are six major sects. They’re the Primordial Pagoda of Buddhism, the Formless Sect of the Sword Sect, and the Red Feather Room, where the woman cultivates.","“There’s also the Medicine God Valley, the Mountain Sea Academy, and the Murong family.","“That’s something you need to pay attention to because it’s very easy for you to run into youngsters of these forces on Dynasty Road because they’ll all go there to train. After all, that was what I did back then.”","Feng Wu nodded. Before she could ask another question, Luo Zilin said, “Because you’re not from the Dayan Empire, I can’t tell you too much. That’s a rule and taboo. It won’t do you any good.” Feng Wu nodded. “But I still have a question.”","Luo Zilin said, “Go ahead.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “So, what’s our relationship? I won’t believe it if you tell me that it’s nothing because you’ve been helping me the whole time. I don’t think you’re that generous.”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “So, you know that I’m not a generous person..”"]},{"number":4151,"title":"Chapter 4151: Dynasty Road (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin chuckled. “So, you know that I’m not a generous person. If you want to know, I won’t keep it from you, but now isn’t the time. How about this? I’ll wait for you there when you reach the end of Dynasty Road. I’ll tell you what our relationship is. How about that?”","Feng Wu said, “Deal?”","Luo Zilin said, “It’s a deal!”","Feng Wu had her own speculations about their relationship, but she still needed Luo Zilin’s confirmation. Since they had agreed to meet at the end of Dynasty Road, she would wait until then.","The next day, Luo Zilin sent Feng Wu and her team to their starting point on Dynasty Road.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","Ordinary people couldn’t get in, and only Luo Zilin’s hand plate could open the boundary stone, which was where Dynasty Road started.","He looked at Feng Wu. Although he couldn’t bring himself to let her enter","Dynasty Road, he still remembered what his elders told him, so he had to tell","Feng Wu, “Dynasty Road is open now. You guys can go in.”","Feng Wu nodded and led her team onto Dynasty Road.","Her friends had no idea where they were going, but Feng Wu had Luo Zilin draw the map overnight, so they knew the way.","Feng Wu said, “We’re going to have 18 trials.”","“18?!” Feng Xun was the first to react. He jumped to his feet and stared at Feng wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “There are a lot of trials, but they won’t be too difficult. We can do it.”","Yu Mingye glanced at Feng Xun and snorted. “What? Are you scared? Feng Xun,","I see that you’re not good enough.”","Feng Xun punched him in the shoulder. “Who can’t do it? Do you want to compete?”","Seeing that they were going to bicker again, Feng Wu rubbed her temple in resignation.","Xuan Yi and Chaoge stepped up and pulled them away. Only then did the two of them separate.","Feng Wu took out the map and told them, “This is the first trial we’re going to pass. ”","Feng Wu pointed at the desert on the map and told the others, “This is where we’re going for our first stop. It’s where the ruins of the desert palace are. If we can get the legacies from here, our future will be much easier.”","Chaoge asked curiously, “The legacy of the desert palace?”","Feng Wu nodded. “We’re in the territory of the Dayan Empire once, but it has shrunk since then. Look at the map. It used to belong to the empire, but now...” Feng Wu drew three circles on the map.","“According to Luo Zilin, the Dayan Empire is located in the inner circle, and the other forces are in the middle and outer circles.","“The Desert God Palace is in the outer circle, and no forces or sects have ever lived here. It’s a place with no one to rule. They used it to train their disciples.","“The Desert God Palace won’t be too dangerous, and it’ll be safer for us.” Feng Wu glanced at the others.","Chaoge hadn’t reached the Spiritual Overlord stage yet. Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were intermediate Spiritual Overlords, and Yu Mingye was a peak Spiritual","Overlord who could reach the Spiritual Saint stage at any moment. Therefore, Feng Wu decided that she had to make Yu Mingye a Spiritual Saint. That way, their team would have two Spiritual Saints and their safety would be guaranteed.."]},{"number":4152,"title":"Chapter 4152: Desert Divine Palace (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, was it as safe as Feng Wu said?","It was five days later when they arrived at the desert palace.","“We’re finally here.” Chaoge saw the ruins of the divine palace a short distance away and turned to Feng Wu. “Luckily, you know the way. I would have gotten lost by now if I were you.”","The Desert God Palace was surrounded by a formation. Ordinary people wouldn’t be able to get in, but Feng Wu’s formation level was already very advanced, so it wouldn’t be a problem for her.","They were still walking in the formation when they heard a voice. “Hey, are you here to look for the ancient ruins as well?”","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","An excited voice rang out.","Feng Wu looked up and saw a teenager in a red robe. He was running happily toward Feng Wu and stopped in front of her. “Are you trapped here as well? Do you have anything to eat? Give me something to eat!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","“Who are you?” Before Feng Wu could say anything, Feng Xun stepped out and narrowed his eyes.","“I’m from the Mountain Sea Academy, and my name is Ji Xingcheng. I’ve been trapped here for so long that I thought I was going to starve to death. Luckily, I ran into you.” The red-robed teenager suddenly frowned. “Are you trapped here as well?”","Feng Wu gave him some food but didn’t answer his question. Instead, she asked him why he was trapped there.","Ji Xingcheng heaved a long sigh. “I came here with my senior brothers and sisters, but I got separated from them and got stranded here. I don’t know what happened to them, but they have the map, and with Senior Sister Zhao Xin, who knows formations, they should have left by now.”","The teenager said to Feng Wu as he ate, “But don’t worry. Senior Sister Zhao Xin will definitely come in to save us. Just come with me. When they come to me, you can leave with them.”","Feng Xun said grumpily, “Don’t worry. Xiao Wu will get us out of here. There’s no need to wait for your Senior Martial Sister.”","Ji Xingcheng looked at Feng Wu in surprise. “Judging from your accent and clothes, I don’t think you’re from Dayan.”","Feng Xun said, ‘We’re from the Junwu Empire.”","“The Junwu Empire? What’s that... Ah!” Ji Xingcheng smacked his forehead. “I studied geography in school. The Junwu Empire? It’s more like a small kingdom, isn’t it? Are you really from that uncivilized place?”","Uncivilized place?","Feng Xun didn’t like the sound of that at all and retorted, “What do you mean? The Junwu Empire is great! It’s nothing like that!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “Judging by the map, your small Junwu Empire is only the size of a sesame seed. How can it not be... Alright, alright. Since you’ve given me the supplies, I won’t say another word, alright?”","So, it really was an uncivilized place, Ji Xingcheng thought to himself.","He had some hope for this team at first, hoping that they might actually get him out. However, ever since he found out that they were from a backwater place, he lost all hope because it was impossible.","“Just listen to me. Sit here and wait. You’re not going anywhere...”","“Wait a minute!"]},{"number":4153,"title":"Chapter 4153: Desert Divine Palace (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4153: Desert Divine Palace (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ji Xingcheng was surprised. “Holy crap! Is there light ahead of us?","“Are we out of that trap already?” Ji Xingcheng couldn’t believe his eyes. He then turned to Feng Wu. “You... you really know formations, and you’re very good at them.”","Ji Xingcheng remembered that when Zhao Xin led the way, she would hold the astrolabe in her hands and locate the spot as she walked. She was so careful, so serious, and so prudent... She was so afraid that she wouldn’t be able to make it if she made the slightest mistake.","Ji Xingcheng remembered that this group simply chatted as they walked as if they were strolling in front of a court. They looked so relaxed, and they walked out just like that.","Was it just luck? Ji Xingcheng thought to himself. He didn’t believe that the people of that uncivilized place knew formations better than those of Dayan.","Feng Wu didn’t take it to heart.","“Ji Xingcheng!”","Feng Wu and the others were about to leave when they heard a girl’s voice.","Immediately after that, many people looked in their direction.","Feng Wu looked up to find a teenage girl in a purple dress running toward them. She ran straight for Ji Xingcheng with a look of disbelief on her face.","“Ji Xingcheng, you’re out! You’re out!” The girl gave him a nudge. “How many times do I have to tell you? This formation is unfathomable. Don’t let your mind wander off. How dare you leave your team?!”","Ji Xingcheng didn’t utter a word.","The girl jabbed a finger in his forehead with a stern look on her face. “Do you know what we’re going to tell the principal when we get back? You’re the principal’s only child! I’m so mad!”","Liang Jin, the senior brother, stopped Zhao Xin. “There, there. Luckily, our junior brother is out. He’s alright now. But my junior brother, aren’t you lost in there? How did you get out?”","Ji Xingcheng pointed at Feng Wu. “I came out with them.”","Liang Jin thanked Feng Wu on Ji Xingcheng’s behalf, and Feng Wu greeted him with a nod.","“It’s not easy to get out of this maze. May I ask who your master is?” Liang Jin asked Feng Wu curiously.","The girl had an outstanding temperament and was stunning. If she knew formations, she wouldn’t be a nobody in Dayan. He should have heard of her before...","“Hahaha! Senior Brother, you must find it strange. Why haven’t you heard of them before?” Ji Xingcheng gloated.","Liang Jin nodded. “We’ve met and exchanged blows with almost all the outstanding members of the younger generation of the families and forces, and we know each other well. However, I’m sorry, but I didn’t recognize them.”","“They’re from the Junwu Kingdom,” said Ji Xingcheng with a smile. “Senior Brother, it’s normal that you haven’t heard of them before. I was shocked when I heard about that place too.”","Liang Jin was surprised. How could such an amazing girl be born in a place like that? That was incredible.","However, he soon stopped looking surprised and smiled. “That’s very surprising.”","Feng Wu, Feng Xun, and the others exchanged looks. It seemed that the Junwu","Empire wasn’t worth their attention at all.","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it, but Feng Xun and the others seemed displeased.","Zhao Xin had wanted to compare notes with Feng Wu on formations, but she lost interest when she heard that they were from such a small place.."]},{"number":4154,"title":"Chapter 4154: Desert Divine Palace (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4154: Desert Divine Palace (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun and the others were all sensitive people, so of course, they could sense those people’s contempt. They made up their minds that they would work harder on their cultivation.","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it. She only smiled. “So, aren’t you going in?”","Wasn’t the entrance to the desert palace right ahead? The mottled bronze ring was right above the door. Shouldn’t they push the door open and enter?","However, Liang Jin only gave Feng Wu a wry smile. “Not yet. Not everyone is here yet. We can’t go in yet.”","Feng Wu asked, ‘Why not?”","Liang Jin said, “To open the door, we need a Spiritual Emperor to help us, and we need to remove the restriction. We don’t have either, so we can’t open the door.”","Feng Wu asked, “What are we waiting for, then?”","Before Liang Jin could say anything, Zhao Xin said, “We’re waiting for someone to remove the seal, and that person is coming our way.”","Liang Jin nodded. “It’s Fairy Jingmi of Red Feather Room. She’s the only one who can open the seal.”","Feng Wu wouldn’t believe it. She walked up to the ring and began to study the seal.","Wait, didn’t this formation look like a cube?","“Does that mean you only need to match the color?” Feng Wu turned around and asked Liang Jin.","Liang Jin nodded. “That’s right, but it’s so difficult to match the color. If something goes wrong, it’ll become more and more complicated. It used to be Level 3, but Zhao Xin made two mistakes just then, and it’s Level 5 now.” Feng Wu nodded and started working without another word.","“Hey, wait! Wait! ” Everyone in Liang Jin’s team shouted at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at them in bewilderment. “Is there a problem?”","Zhao Xin frowned before Liang Jin could say anything. “Don’t touch it!”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Zhao Xin said, “I’ve turned it into a Level-5 one. I heard that the Senior Brother of the Murong family can solve it. What if you make a mistake? What if we reach the sixth level? Even Senior Brother Murong family can’t solve it!”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Yu Mingye walked up to Zhao Xin and glanced at her. Resting his arm on Feng Wu’s shoulder, he said in an intimidating tone, “Xiao Wu is awesome. She’ll be able to pass even Level 10, let alone Level 5. Right, Xiao Wu?”","Zhao Xin stomped her foot in frustration. “Hey, barbarians from other lands, can you stop being so conceited? You’ve never seen the world and don’t know how difficult the formation of the Dayan Empire is. You have no idea at all... It’s impossible! Senior Brother Liang, talk to them!”","Liang Jin didn’t know what to do either. He had always been a kind person, and since Feng Wu had saved Ji Xingcheng, he couldn’t bring himself to say anything harsh. However, he smiled bitterly in the end and said, “Miss Feng Wu, how about we wait for the Murong family? Murong Linhai will be here soon, and he owes us a big favor. Now...”Crack!","Feng Wu made a move before Liang Jin could finish, and the door to the restriction finally opened.","Liang Jin stopped abruptly.","Zhao Xin and Liang Jin looked at each other in disbelief.","Just like that?","Wait, how did she do it? Why did it open? It was as if she had just casually..."]},{"number":4155,"title":"Chapter 4155: Desert Divine Palace (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ji Xingcheng was equally humiliated. He stared at Feng Wu and said, “You, you didn’t get lucky! You really are a very capable formation master!”","Seeing how surprised they were, Feng Wu’s team members gloated. These people had underestimated Feng Wu!","Yu Mingye even threw a hand over Feng Wu’s shoulder and glanced at the others in satisfaction. “Now you know how capable Xiao Wu is.”","Feng Wu moved Yu Mingye’s hand away in resignation.","Feng Xun stepped forward and shoved Yu Mingye out of the way. “Be civil. What’s with all the touching? Out of my way.”","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","Yu Mingye smirked. “Feng Xun...”","Feng Wu said in a hurry, “You two, shut up! Right now!”","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye exchanged looks, snorted at each other, and turned to leave.","While Liang Jin and the others were still in shock, Feng Wu walked into the desert palace first.","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye rushed in after her.","Liang Jin and Zhao Xin looked at each other, and Liang Jin said, “Shall we go in as well?”","Zhao Xin nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu didn’t know this place well, so Liang Jin quickly walked up to her and said, “The further we go, the more powerful the spiritual essence will be. Do you see the clearing over there?”","Feng Wu nodded. There was indeed an open space in front of the hall.","“Walk past that open space and you’ll reach the second floor. There are rush cushions inside. It’s said that everyone only has one chance to choose one.","“Choosing the cushion is like rolling the dice. If you’re lucky enough, sit on the right one, and you’ll have a chance to inherit the ability.","Feng Wu asked, “Can only the capable ones get to the second floor?”","Liang Jin said, “That’s not it. The more talented one is, the more qualified they are to enter the second floor. After all, the masters of the Desert Divine Palace only test one’s talent, not their capability. If one were to compare their capability, all the legacies here would have been taken by the more capable ones.","“So, the succession depends on fate. If you’re fated or talented enough, you’ll have a chance to inherit it. But you...”","“What about us?” Feng Wu asked in bewilderment.","Liang Jin said, “But you’re all from the other world. How talented can you be?","I’m sorry, but I’m not good at lying.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. “In that case, you might as well keep it to yourself.”","Liang Jin said, “Well, maybe you’re fated with the masters, aren’t you? It has nothing to do with talent. It’s all about luck.”","Feng Wu looked at the empty space in front of her and was lost in her thoughts.","Zhao Xin walked away before Liang Jin could say anything.","Everyone knew that the first one would be more likely to get it.","After all, there was a limit to what one could inherit.","“Senior Sister, why are you so fast?” Seeing that Zhao Xin was marching forward, Ji Xingcheng wanted to stop her, but he couldn’t because she was moving too fast.","“Senior Sister, aren’t you looking down on them? Miss Xiao Wu was the one who opened the restriction. Shouldn’t she enter first? Why did you get to it first? That’s just ridiculous!” Ji Xingcheng was a little angry. His senior sister was so snobbish. Seeing that they were from an uncivilized land and didn’t have any connections in the Dayan Empire, she decided to break the rule.."]},{"number":4156,"title":"Chapter 4156: Desert Divine Palace (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","If Feng Wu and her people were all from the Dayan Empire, no one would dare to break the rules.","Liang Jin apologized to Feng Wu in a hurry. Feng Wu only glanced at him without saying a word, but she frowned a little.","“Let’s go,” Feng Wu told her friends.","They followed Feng Wu.","Seeing that Feng Wu kept moving forward, Liang Jin couldn’t help but smile bitterly. Did she really think that she was walking on flat ground? This was the gravity domain, and the further she went, the stronger the suppression.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","Take Zhao Xin as an example. She had been walking fast at first, but she had stopped and was very careful with her steps.","“She’s a stubborn girl,” Liang Jin said to Ji Xingcheng. “But she’ll soon know how hard it is. Forget it. She’s from a small town. If she doesn’t learn her lesson, she’ll run into even bigger obstacles in the future...”","However, he stopped abruptly when he saw that Feng Wu was a meter away from Zhao Xin.","Ji Xingcheng said, “Senior Brother, that Feng Wu... she...’","Liang Jin was surprised. “Why is she walking so fast? Why is she behind Zhao Xin so soon? Zhao Xin is already one of the most talented students in the college!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “That’s right. Senior Sister Zhao Xin is quite talented. Doesn’t that mean that Feng Wu is...”","“Just wait a little longer. Maybe she’ll stop soon.”","However...","Liang Jin was humiliated again.","Zhao Xin was the one who stopped, not Feng Wu.","Right now, Feng Wu and Zhao Xin were walking side by side.","Zhao Xin was focused on her walking when she sensed a shadow. She looked up and spotted Feng Wu.","“You!” Zhao Xin stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Why are you here? You...” She couldn’t believe it!","Wasn’t this girl called Feng Wu from a small, uncivilized country? People there","were all very untalented, but why was she moving so fast in this Place that tested one’s talent only?","Zhao Xin wouldn’t have it, and she was filled with jealousy.","But soon, Feng Wu surpassed Zhao Xin.","Zhao Xin was astonished.","15 steps! Feng Wu had made 15 steps!","Moreover, Feng Wu walked effortlessly without stopping. What did that mean? It meant that the first 13 steps weren’t a problem for her at all! It meant that she still had a lot of potential!","Zhao Xin turned around and exchanged looks with Liang Jin, who was walking toward her with Ji Xingcheng.","Liang Jin smiled bitterly. He didn’t expect to be humiliated again.","In the few minutes since he met Feng Wu, he felt as if he had been slapped more times than he had ever done in his life.","Liang Jin didn’t dare to try to define Feng Wu anymore, so he told Zhao Xin,","“Just walk your path. That girl may be an exception.”","Was Feng Wu an exception? Of course, she was, but was she the only exception?","Zhao Xin was still sulking when she realized that another shadow had fallen over her.","A teenager stood next to her.","Turning her head, Zhao Xin saw that it was Yu Mingye, the teenager from Feng","Wu’s team..."]},{"number":4157,"title":"Chapter 4157: Desert Divine Palace (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4157: Desert Divine Palace (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","With his sword over his shoulder, Yu Mingye darted a sidelong glance at Zhao Xin when he felt the gaze on him. Heh, the teenager smirked, then took another step.","Zhao Xin was speechless.","This teenager was more talented than she was!","Zhao Xin wasn’t the only one surprised. Liang Jin and Ji Xingcheng were equally surprised. They were from the Mountain Sea Academy.","What did that mean?","The Mountain Sea Academy was the top academy of the Dayan Empire and one of the four major forces and six major sects. It used to be one of the six major sects, but it had almost risen to one of the four major forces.","But now, they had been surpassed by the nobodies of an uncivilized land.","Yu Mingye soon walked past them and followed Feng Wu.","Zhao Xin clenched her fists. “Walking fast doesn’t mean anything. You’ll only win if you can make it to the end! These two people are going to surpass us... Forget it. I’ll let them! Going fast doesn’t mean anything! ”","But to her surprise...","Feng Wu and Yu Mingye weren’t the only ones.","As for Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Chaoge, and Duan Chaoge, they had all surpassed her.","“Ah!!!” Zhao Xin cried out in frustration.","“Senior Sister Zhao, are you alright?” Ji Xingcheng looked uneasy.","Zhao Xin gritted her teeth. “They’ve all surpassed us! All of them!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “Well, I don’t know what to say. After all, I’m still confused.”","That was beyond their imagination.","Zhao Xin gritted her teeth. “They... they’re just walking fast. What good will that do? We don’t know who’s going to have the last laugh!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “Senior Sister, if walking fast doesn’t mean anything, why did you leave first? Feng Wu should have left first.”","Zhao Xin didn’t know what to say. This junior brother was so annoying.","Zhao Xin said, “They’re just talented, that’s all!”","Ji Xingcheng stared at Zhao Xin in disbelief. “Senior Sister, can you hear yourself? One’s talent will determine how far one can go in the future! Are you out of your mind?!”","Zhao Xin threw a dirty look at Ji Xingcheng. She was jealous, and what was wrong with venting her jealousy? Did he have to be so serious? She was so mad!","Liang Jin smiled bitterly. ‘We’ve been misled. It seems that there are talented people in that place as well.”","Zhao Xin said, “Hmph! I don’t believe that they can get to the second floor!”","Ji Xingcheng asked, “What if they do?”","Zhao Xin smirked. “If they really can get to the second floor, you can pick anything in my pouch!”","Ji Xingcheng’s eyes lit up. “Senior Sister, will you keep your promise?”","Zhao Xin smirked. “Since when do I go back on my word?”","Ji Xingcheng said, “Senior Sister, look! Miss Feng Wu is almost at the stairs. She’s going up!”","Zhao Xin said, “She can’t get up there!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “You never know.”","Just then, they heard a voice. “It looks quite boisterous here.”","“Brother Murong! “"]},{"number":4158,"title":"Chapter 4158: Desert Divine Palace (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4158: Desert Divine Palace (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhao Xin turned around and saw Murong Linhai. She waved at him in excitement. “Brother Murong, come here! ”","It was indeed Murong Linhai of the Murong family and his friends.","The Murong family was also one of the six major sects, and they often interacted with the Mountain Sea Academy. Therefore, Zhao Xin knew Murong Linhai, the teenager of the Murong family.","Murong Linhai was one of the best among the younger generation of the","Murong family. He had a junior sister and several junior brothers with him.","“The restriction outside has been lifted?” Murong Linhai walked toward Zhao Xin and the others. “Which one of you has removed it?”","Liang Jin was about to say something when Zhao Xin cut him off. “It was a coincidence. ”","Coincidence? Liang Jin glanced at Zhao Xin. That didn’t seem like a coincidence at all.","Zhao Xin gave Liang Jin a warning look before turning to Murong Linhai.","“Brother Linhai, you’re here already. We’ll be relieved to see you here.”","Murong Linhai smiled. “Don’t worry. With me around, you won’t run into any danger.”","The person behind Murong Linhai reminded him.","Murong Linhai nodded and said to Zhao Xin, “Since the door is open, let’s move on. Choosing the prayer mat will be the most difficult trial. There are six palace masters in this place. Apart from Luo Zilin, the genius of the Luo family, no one has inherited the teachings of the first palace.","“There are so many of us here. Maybe one of us will be lucky enough to inherit the teachings of a palace master.” Murong Linhai’s eyes flickered.","Zhao Xin nodded. “If anyone has the highest chance of inheriting the teachings of the masters, it has to be Brother Linhai.”","Murong Linhai chuckled and said humbly, “You flatter me. Since we’re all here, of course, we all have a chance.”","Zhao Xin tried to flatter him again. “Brother Murong is the most capable and talented of us all. If the masters have to pick someone, of course, they’ll pick you.”","Murong Linhai was pleased, but he still said humbly, “Luck is the most important thing in the palace. Talent doesn’t count. It’s an equal opportunity for everyone.”","Liang Jin and Ji Xingcheng exchanged looks and both shook their heads. Zhao Xin was flattering Murong Linhai too much.","Just then, Murong Linhai heard a noise from the second floor.","“What was that?” Murong Linhai frowned.","Zhao Xin said, “Someone has gone up there.”","“Gone up? When? How? How can an ordinary person get up there?!” Murong Linhai blurted out. Staring at the stone staircase, he grew anxious.","He wanted to run as fast as he could, but the gravity in the hall was like a swamp that stopped him. It would take him a while to gather his spiritual essence and move forward.","He wasn’t alone. Liang Jin and the others felt the same.","Zhao Xin looked troubled.","Murong Linhai asked harshly, “What on earth happened?!”","Zhao Xin said grumpily, “There are a few cultivators from an uncivilized world. Somehow, they’ve come to the Dayan Empire..”"]},{"number":4159,"title":"Chapter 4159: Desert Divine Palace (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4159: Desert Divine Palace (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Were they the ones who opened the door?” Murong Linhai looked alarmed.","Zhao Xin nodded. “That’s right. The leader is called Feng Wu. She opened the door to the desert palace by accident.”","“Are you sure it was opened by accident?” Murong Linhai asked.","Zhao Xin nodded. “Yes! It was an accident!”","Only then did Murong Linhai feel a little better. If one had unintentionally opened a door, that was luck, but if the person opened the door after hard work, it would be a sign of capability. Murong Linhai wouldn’t allow anyone better than him in that aspect, especially those of his generation!","But...","After much difficulty, Murong Linhai, Zhao Xin, and the others finally reached the second floor.","They saw five people each sitting on a rush cushion.","Golden light shone from them, and they looked as if they were covered by Buddhist light.","They sat cross-legged with spiritual essence lingering around them, looking like gods and goddesses descending to the mortal world.","“What...” Murong Linhai’s face darkened.","It was obvious that all five of them were receiving the inheritance.","Zhao Xin cried out as well.","She had said a lot of bad things about these people on their way here, but reality had just slapped her in the face!","“Are they accepting the legacy?” Zhao Xin couldn’t believe her eyes. “That’s impossible!”","Murong Linhai said, “Of course it’s possible! It’s happening!”","Murong Linhai took a deep breath.","There were only six palace masters in total. After Luo Zilin inherited one of them, there were only five left. Murong Linhai wanted to say that it was impossible just like Zhao Xin did.","But he had to admit that it was the truth.","Zhao Xin asked, “Did all five masters give away their legacies?”","Luo Zilin used to be the only one who had obtained it, and it wasn’t like one could buy it wholesale.","Murong Linhai threw a dirty look at the five people, took a deep breath, and turned to leave.","“Brother Linhai, where are you going?” Zhao Xin rushed to his side.","Before Murong Linhai could say anything, one of his junior sisters smirked. “The treasure of this trial has been taken by someone else. What’s the point of staying here? Are you waiting for them to humiliate you after they wake up?","Naturally, we’re going to find the second trial now.”","The members of the Murong family left in a hurry, but Feng Wu and her friends left a lasting impression on them.","One didn’t have to obtain the treasures to pass the 18 trials. In fact, there were 18 hidden treasures in the trials. If one was lucky enough, they could inherit or take them. If not, they would simply move forward.","However, such an opportunity could only be accessed once in a lifetime, and it would be such a pity to miss it.","Zhao Xin glared at Feng Wu.","It wouldn’t be so bad if only Feng Wu had inherited the legacy of a palace master, but why did all five of them inherit it? Why?","“Why?!” Zhao Xin wouldn’t accept it.","Only then did Liang Jin and Ji Xingcheng realize what had happened and draw in their breaths.","“As expected of Sister Feng Wu!” Ji Xingcheng gave her a thumbs up. “That’s incredible! All five of them!”","The chance of getting even one was slim, but they all got it..."]},{"number":4160,"title":"Chapter 4160: Desert Divine Palace (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4160: Desert Divine Palace (9)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Liang Jin suddenly said, “Are they lucky, too talented, or too capable?” No one answered.","Liang Jin asked another question. ‘What about the second trial? Is it going to","be...”","At that thought, Liang Jin said in a hurry, “Let’s not wait anymore. Let’s go to the second floor now so that we don’t have to wait for Feng Wu to finish her trial. I think she’s a little unbelievable!”","They hurried toward the second trial.","To their surprise, they couldn’t obtain the treasure, nor could Murong Linhai.","Naturally, Feng Wu, who had arrived later, got it.","Three months passed in a hurry.","That day, they reached the 18th trial.","“Xiao Wu, Sister Xiao Wu, can I call you that?” Ji Xingcheng wanted to kneel down.","His three months in Dynasty Road had changed his opinion on everything.","How could anyone do such a thing?","She was unbelievably lucky!","In the first few trials, they wouldn’t believe it and insisted on competing with Feng Wu to see who would get the treasure first. However, after a few trials, they lost so miserably that they couldn’t find anything.","Feng Wu took all the treasures.","It just so happened that all the treasures here were helpful for one’s cultivation, and they could only be used on the spot. Hence, no one could take them away.","The trials were supposed to be so difficult that only a handful of geniuses of the Dayan Empire had been able to obtain a few things. However, Feng Wu had never missed any of them.","Ji Xingcheng looked enviously at Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and the others.","Of course, he was envious.","When they first met, Chaoge hadn’t reached the Spiritual Overlord stage yet. Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were intermediate Spiritual Overlords, while Yu Mingye was a peak Spiritual Overlord.","However, with all the cultivation treasures they had obtained over the past three months, their capability had skyrocketed!","Duan Chaoge was already a peak Spiritual Overlord!","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi became junior Spiritual Saints.","Yu Mingye had long reached the Spiritual Saint stage and was already an intermediate one!","Ji Xingcheng was so envious that he almost burst into tears, for Yu Mingye was as capable as he was now. Just a few days ago, he had a competition with Yu Mingye, but Yu Mingye had outshone him.","Ji Xingcheng looked up at the sky and wanted to cry.","He was the genius of the Mountain Sea Academy, and even his father had praised his talent more than once. However, these people from the wild lands...","Ji Xingcheng wasn’t the only one feeling envious.","Zhao Xin felt like she had been on a rollercoaster ride. At first, she tried her best to slander Feng Wu and her friends, wishing that she could reduce them to nothing. However, as time went by, she had been shocked by Feng Wu over and over again and had been humiliated repeatedly. By now, she had become so quiet that she couldn’t even hear a word, for she didn’t want to hear anything about Feng Wu at all.","Seeing the blood lotus in Feng Wu’s hand, Ji Xingcheng almost wanted to beg her for it.","Feng Wu casually handed the lotus to Chaoge and said, “Eat it with Xuan Yi and the others, then sit down and cultivate. You still have a lot of room for breakthroughs. While we’re still on this road, make good use of this time to cultivate.”","Duan Chaoge looked at the lotus and nodded in excitement.. She clenched her fists and said, “I’ll become a Spiritual Saint as soon as I can!”"]},{"number":4161,"title":"Chapter 4161: Desert Divine Palace (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4161: Desert Divine Palace (10)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The others had all reached the Spiritual Saint stage, but not her. She wouldn’t want to slow them down.","What Duan Chaoge didn’t know was that she had been making breakthroughs so fast that many geniuses had to cultivate for decades to catch up with her.","Ji Xingcheng gave Feng Wu a pleading look.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Aren’t you the son of the head of the Mountain Sea","Academy? Do you need more resources?”","“Sister Xiao Wu, it’s completely different! Dynasty Road is a place that youngsters of influential families like us can use to make rapid breakthroughs. Therefore, when we reach a bottleneck, we’ll choose to come here to cultivate and search for treasures.","“Only by cultivating in Dynasty Road can one perfectly match the spiritual essence here and achieve twice the effect with half the effort. Otherwise, Duan Chaoge and the others wouldn’t have been able to make such rapid breakthroughs!","“But no one knew you would be such a genius. How did you do it? You’ve plundered most of the cultivation resources along the way. You have no idea how jealous everyone else is.” Ji Xingcheng looked at the crowd a few steps away as he spoke to Feng Wu.","As they walked toward the destination, more and more cultivators gathered around. Most of them were from influential families, and they were all proud and unruly. They already had a problem with Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said proudly, “I didn’t steal anything. I got it with my own ability. Why should I care what other people think?”","Although that was the case, Ji Xingcheng was still worried about Feng Wu, for there were simply too many people eyeing her.","“Look at the blue-robed men behind me. Do you see them? They’re from Prince Yan’s residence, and the other team are all girls. They’re from the Red Feather Room...” Ji Xingcheng introduced them to Feng Wu.","“The chosen ones of this year may not all be the heirs to their families, but they’re all core members. You’ve taken what should have been theirs...”","“Hey, wait. I did take the treasures, but I didn’t take any of their stuff. Even without me, they probably wouldn’t have been able to get those things,” Feng Wu said grumpily.","Ji Xingcheng said, “Yes, they probably won’t be able to get it without you, but there’s still a small chance that they’ll get it. They’ll only think that you’ve stolen their treasure, and they hate you now. So, be careful.”","Feng Wu thought to herself, “I’m a Spiritual Sovereign now, and I’m not afraid of these people.”","“I don’t think I’ll ever see them again after I get out. So be it.” Feng Wu shrugged.","“Gosh, don’t tell me you don’t know that there’s one last trial on Dynasty Road?” Ji Xingcheng reminded her in a low voice.","Feng Wu said, “I’ve passed all 17 trials. Are you saying that I can’t pass the last one?”Se??ch ?ew?o?e? ,o?g on ?oo?l?","Ji Xingcheng said earnestly, “This trial is different. It’s very different!”","“Really?” Crossing her arms, Feng Wu asked Ji Xingcheng curiously, “What do you mean?”","Ji Xingcheng said, “This trial isn’t like the previous 17 trials, where you can search for treasures. This trial is a battle. Do you see those people behind us? They’re the genius cultivators of the four forces and six major sects, and you’ll have to fight them to win this trial..”"]},{"number":4162,"title":"Chapter 4162: 5v5 Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4162: 5v5 Battle (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What will I get?” Seeing that Ji Xingcheng wanted to say something but hesitated, Feng Wu asked curiously.","Ji Xingcheng said, “A lot of people will be watching this battle. The battlefield may be on Dynasty Road, but do you see the arena? The arena can broadcast the battle live. That is to say, all the forces and sects are watching the upcoming battle.","“Each member of the team that wins in the end will receive a Five Spiritual Glazed Flame Pill. It’s a supreme-grade pill that the four major sects and six major forces have hired the medicine king of the Divine Medicine Valley to refine. It’s very beneficial to our foundation and marrow. It’s almost supreme-grade!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “How supreme-grade is it?”","Tilting his head, Ji Xingcheng gave it some thought before explaining to Feng wu.","“For instance, I’m not as talented as Feng Xun and the others now, right? But if","I win, I’ll take a Five Spiritual Glazed Flame Pill, and after absorbing it, even if I’m not as talented as Feng Xun, I’ll still be on par with him. That’s how effective it is!”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin. It was indeed a great pill. It just so happened that Feng Xun and the others couldn’t make much progress anymore. With this pill, they might be able to make some more progress for a while.","Such rapid progress would have been harmful to their health, but Feng Wu was a medicine refiner herself and had experienced it herself. Hence, she had been guiding their spiritual essence and removing impurities for them the whole time.","Feng Wu suddenly remembered something. ‘Wait. The students of the four forces and six major sects are taking part, aren’t they? What kind of a force are we, then?”","Ji Xingcheng scratched his head. “Well... I don’t think you’re qualified to participate. ”","Feng Wu stared at Ji Xingcheng.","Ji Xingcheng said, “Well, after all, the four forces and six sects donate so much money and resources every year to the Medicine God Valley so that their descendants can get their hands on the pills. They don’t expect to give the opportunity to someone else, so you don’t get to participate.”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Ji Xingcheng. “We’re not qualified. You’re so happy, aren’t you?”","Ji Xingcheng said, “Of course not!”","While Feng Wu was talking to Ji Xingcheng, a group of people was talking nearby as well.","Murong Linhai had suffered a blow and had yet to recover.","He had been living in Feng Wu’s shadow the whole time and had almost gotten the treasure a few times. However, at the last moment, it would somehow fall into Feng Wu’s hands and be used by her and her friends.","Murong Linhai had witnessed the progress of Feng Wu’s team, and he was still at the same level as when he entered Dynasty Road.","“You didn’t get anything? Murong Linhai, are you that bad?” A taunting voice came from the team next door.","It was a teenage girl.","“Yan Qian, what are you talking about?!” Murong Linhai was infuriated.","Yan Qian was the sister of Princess Yan Ling and the daughter of Lord Yan. She was the one who led the team this time.","“Didn’t you say so yourself? We didn’t find anything along the way, but that girl took everything.” Yan Qian pointed at Feng Wu a few steps away and frowned. “She’s not that impressive.. Why are you praising her?”"]},{"number":4163,"title":"Chapter 4163: 5v5 Battle (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4163: 5v5 Battle (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Murong Linhai smirked inwardly. “You don’t think she’s that good? That’s because she’s been hiding her true capability! You didn’t get defeated all the way here, so of course you don’t know!”","However, Murong Linhai wouldn’t be so kind as to tell Princess Yan Qian how terrifying Feng Wu was.","If Feng Wu wasn’t so capable, Murong Linhai would have snatched the treasures from her already!","“What’s that look on your face? Don’t you agree with me?” Princess Yan Qian glanced at Murong Linhai.","Apart from the Mountain Sea Academy and the Murong family, no one else had seen how capable Feng Wu was, so they didn’t think much of her.","Murong Linhai heaved a sigh and told Princess Yan Qian, “Fine, I’ll tell you the truth. We’ve passed 17 trials, and Feng Wu has obtained a lot of cultivation treasures. If you really have a chance to fight her, be careful. I think she’s already more capable than you.”","Princess Yan Qian smirked. “Liang Jin said the same thing. Are you all flattering Feng Wu just because she’s pretty? Murong Linhai, I didn’t know you were that kind of a person!”","Murong Linhai said in resignation, “You didn’t know that...”","Princess Yan Qian waved her hands. “Even if we were late, we still got the","Heaven Heart Fruit. You didn’t!”","Murong Linhai wanted to say something else, but Princess Yan Qian cut him off. “Forget it. You don’t have to say anything. I know you’re on Feng Wu’s side.","Just go to her!”","She left with her teammates after that.","Murong Linhai was speechless.","“Brother Murong, that’s a bit over the top.” The sacred son of Formless Sword Sect patted Murong Linhai on the shoulder and left with Princess Yan Qian.","Murong Linhai smirked inwardly. “You idiots will soon enjoy the shadow of","Feng Wu’s terrifying capability! Hmph!”","Just then, someone walked up to Murong Linhai and whispered something in his ear.","“What? She’s not qualified?” Murong Linhai frowned. “Why is that?”","It was Murong Linqing, a junior of the Murong family.","Murong Linqing went to see Ji Xingcheng.","Ji Xingcheng nodded. “That’s right. According to Senior Brother, this is a competition among the four forces and six major sects. People of other lands can only watch, so they’re not qualified.”","Murong Linqing felt sorry for Feng Wu. He had been waiting to see Feng Wu defeat Princess Yan Qian, but Feng Wu wasn’t qualified to fight.","If Feng Wu wasn’t qualified, would the Murong family be qualified to become the final team? Murong Linhai looked behind him and shook his head. That wasn’t possible.","The team this time consisted of the Dynasty Team, the Primordial Pagoda, the","Formless Sword Sect, Red Feather Room, the Mountain Sea Academy, the Murong family, and the Luo family. Of the seven families, the Dynasty Team was the most capable one.","The princes of the Dayan Empire were old enough to take the throne, so they all had their own supporters. The fourth prince was leading the team this time, and the Murong family supported the eldest prince because the daughter of the Murong family was going to marry him.","Right now, the girls of Red Feather Room and Princess Yan Qian were all","around the fourth prince.."]},{"number":4164,"title":"Chapter 4164: 5v5 Battle (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4164: 5v5 Battle (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Were these people fawning on the fourth prince? If that was the case, the crown prince would be in a lot of trouble. At that thought, Murong Linhai couldn’t help but look at Feng Wu.","As much as he hated this girl, who had kept him from the treasure, if he could use Feng Wu to defeat the fourth prince’s team...","Murong Linhai rubbed his chin.","There were seven teams in total: the Dynasty Team, the Primordial Pagoda, the","Formless Sword Sect, Red Feather Room, the Mountain Sea Academy, the Murong family, and the Yan family. Right now, the captains of the seven teams were discussing among themselves.","The teams had to pair up, but seven was an odd number.","The Sacred Mu Cliff, the Medicine God Valley, and the Yan family weren’t here.","“So, which team wants to give up now?” The fourth prince looked around at the crowd.","No one would give up.","“Since no one will give up, we have two options. One is to have a bye, and the other is to add another team.” The fourth prince naturally became the leader.","He was about to say that a team would have a bye when Murong Linhai spoke.","“That’s not fair, is it?” Murong Linhai smiled. “After all, whoever has a bye will be deemed lucky. How about we find another team? That way, we’ll have eight teams.”","Liang Jin smiled bitterly to himself. Murong Linhai had been defeated by Feng Wu, and it would only make him feel better if other people were defeated as well.","However, seeing the way the fourth prince was surrounded by the crowd, Liang Jin recalled how Feng Wu had saved the Mountain Sea Academy on their way there. In the end, he stepped out and said, “I think that team from another region is doing well. I think we should let them try.”","Murong Linhai said, “Liang Jin, you mean...”","“Feng Wu’s team has done a great job on their way , and they’ve received more cultivation resources than natives like us. Therefore, it’s a good choice to have her team as a candidate.","Princess Yan Qian smirked. “Murong Linhai? Are you talking about Feng Wu, who’s more capable and luckier than me?”","Murong Linhai smiled bitterly. “Princess Yan Qian, I didn’t say that. I only said that Feng Wu was very talented and very lucky...”","“That’s it, then. Since you didn’t praise me like that, it means that she’s better than me.” Princess Yan Qian smirked and turned to the fourth prince. “I agree to let Feng Wu’s team join us. I’d like to see how amazing Feng Wu is!”","After that, Princess Yan Qian smirked at Murong Linhai. Her family had wanted her to marry Murong Linhai, but Murong Linhai had turned his attention to a foreign girl!","Although she didn’t think much of Murong Linhai either, it didn’t mean that Murong Linhai could care about someone else. Therefore, although she hadn’t confronted Feng Wu yet, the princess was already very hostile toward her.","What she didn’t know was that her sister, Princess Yan Ling, had been killed by Feng wu.","They interrupted the fourth prince’s plan, but on second thought, the prince realized that he wouldn’t choose his own team even if they had a bye. Otherwise, what would other people think of him? This was a battle to establish his authority. After all, that was what the fourth prince had planned from the very beginning, so he had brought some very promising team members with him this time.."]},{"number":4165,"title":"Chapter 4165: 5v5 Battle (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He and his teammates looked at each other, and they all gave him a resolute look.","“Let’s have a show of hands, then. If you agree to let Feng Wu’s team participate, raise your hand,” said the fourth prince with a smile.","There were seven teams in total, and four of the team leaders needed to raise their hands.","The result soon came out. Liang Jin of the Mountain Sea Academy raised his hand, so did Murong Linhai of the Murong family, Princess Yan Qian of the Yan manor, and the fourth prince.","“Alright. I’ll give them a place in the competition, then.” The fourth prince smiled.","He had raised his hand because he wanted to let everyone know that he would obtain the pill with his own capability, not by using the rules to avoid the most capable cultivators.","Feng Wu was surprised when Liang Jin told her the news. “Really?”","Liang Jin said, “It just so happens that we’re missing a team. You’re such a lucky girl.”","Meanwhile, people outside were also watching the upcoming battle.","Because it would cost too many Spirit Stones to watch the process from beginning to end, almost all the family clans would only watch the final battle in the 18th trial.","The mother of the fourth prince, the eldest prince, Luo Zilin, and Yan Yu were all watching.","The Primordial Pagoda, the Formless Sword Sect, Red Feather Room, the Mountain Sea Academy, and the Murong family were watching as well.","They all hoped that their own clansmen could get their hands on the pills.","The battle started with the drawing of lots.","The eight teams would fight four battles in pairs.","The team leaders of each team would make the draw","Needless to say, Feng Wu herself was the team leader.","Jun Linyun couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu when she walked in, for Feng Wu was already 15 years old and had grown up. No one would be able to resist her beauty when she walked in.","Princess Yan Qian snorted. “Your Royal Highness, it’s time to draw.”","“That’s right.” The fourth prince cleared his throat to cover up his embarrassment.","As a prince, he had seen his fair share of women, but Feng Wu was the first girl that had impressed him with her beauty.","However, the most important thing now was to win the battle and get the pill. As for Feng Wu... As a prince, he could get anything he wanted.","Feng Wu not only amazed the fourth prince but the others as well. However, they were all focused on the upcoming battle and forgot about everything else.","Feng Wu was as lucky as ever. She had picked the Murong family.","Murong Linhai was dumbfounded and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu cleared her throat. “Well... I didn’t mean to. I just can’t control my luck..’","Taking a deep breath, Murong Linhai fought back his anger. However, on second thought, he realized that anyone below the first place would be useless in this competition, and only the top student could get the reward. Since the Murong family couldn’t get the first place anyway, he might as well give up and watch the competition from the side.","At that thought, Murong Linhai nodded. “Don’t worry about it. Let’s fight!”","The result soon came out.","Feng Wu’s team versus the Murong family.","The Mountain Sea Academy versus the Dayan Empire.","The Lord Yan’s residence versus the Primordial Pagoda. The Formless Sword Sect would fight Red Feather Room.."]},{"number":4166,"title":"Chapter 4166: Let’s Fight (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s team was in the first round.","When Feng Wu and her team went up the stage, many people began to whisper among themselves.","And there were quite a few of them.","Apart from the four forces and six major sects, there were also some itinerant cultivators. Therefore, there were at least hundreds of people in the audience.","But very few people knew Feng Wu.","Only the members of the Mountain Sea Academy and the Murong family, who had been defeated by Feng Wu’s capability and luck, knew who she was. Only a handful of them had heard of Feng Wu’s name, but most of them hadn’t.","Hence, when Feng Wu went up the stage, many people began to whisper among themselves.","“Who are they? Why are they on the stage? I don’t think they’re from any of the four forces or six sects. Otherwise, why haven’t I seen them before?”","“These people are so elegant. One look and you can tell that they’re from a","prestigious family. Don’t talk about them recklessly, or they’ll punish you later. ”","“Is there a new sect? Have we missed something?”","While they were discussing among themselves, Liang Jin of the Mountain Sea Academy stepped out to introduce Feng Wu’s team.","“What? From the Outer World?!”","“These people all look nice. I thought they were from some decent sect. I didn’t know they were from the other side of the continent. Is that true?”","“That’s not right. If they’re from another land, why are they qualified to participate? If they’re qualified, why aren’t we?”","They became displeased.","Liang Jin frowned. He couldn’t control the crowd anymore. Just then, Feng Wu frowned and said coldly, “Why? Because we can win!” That intimidating voice silenced all the discussion.","For some unknown reason, they felt revered when they saw the girl in red.","But many people still wouldn’t accept it and asked Feng Wu why she dared to say that.","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to answer their questions.","Yu Mingye didn’t like the sound of that at all. Crossing his arms, he smirked","after Feng Wu. “Not only will we defeat the Murong family, but we’ll also win until the end!” In the end?","You?","The others all smirked.","“Feng Wu’s team is so ridiculous! They’re full of bullshit!” “They can’t even the Murong family, let alone the end!” “Do they think they can defeat the fourth prince’s team?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye shrugged. “They’ve underestimated you! I won’t allow it!” Feng Wu was speechless.","Just then, the fourth prince slowly walked out, stopped in front of Feng Wu, and smiled. “Did you just say that your team can defeat us?”","Yu Mingye darted a provoking look at the fourth prince. “What? You don’t believe me?”","The fourth prince smiled. “I see that you’re very confident.”","Feng Xun crossed his arms as well and said proudly, “If we can’t even be confident, we’ll have wasted these three months of cultivation.”","Those three months were the most painful time for Feng Xun.","Every day during this period, he had to endure the excruciating pain of his flesh being torn open, then healed, and then torn again... By now, he had gotten used to the pain. Even if he cut off his arm now, he wouldn’t know what pain was anymore.."]},{"number":4167,"title":"Chapter 4167: Let’s Begin (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hahaha, how interesting.” The fourth prince clapped his hands. “Since you people are so arrogant, why don’t you make a bet with me?”","Well... Feng Xun couldn’t make the decision on his own. Feng Wu had to make the call.","“What? Are you going to back off now that we’re making a bet?” the person behind the fourth prince taunted, and the others all laughed.","Feng Wu walked up to Feng Xun and stared at the fourth prince. “Fine, I’ll take the bet. I’m not afraid of you!”","The fourth prince smiled at Feng Wu. “Fine. Let’s make it bigger.”","Feng Wu said, “Go ahead.”","The fourth prince said, “If you lose, you’ll become my maid. How about that?”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Yu Mingye and Feng Xun grew anxious and wanted to hit the fourth prince.","Feng Wu stopped them. “I know I’m going to win, but I promised someone that I wouldn’t use myself as a stake. I can’t do that. Name a new price.” Jun Linyun glanced at Feng Wu. “Are you going to say no to such a great offer?” Feng Wu couldn’t believe her ears. What kind of offer was that?","“Him, then.” The fourth prince pointed at Yu Mingye. “If your team loses, send him to the fourth prince’s residence.”","Yu Mingye was furious!","‘You!”","Feng Xun chuckled before Yu Mingye could finish. “Deal.”","Yu Mingye glared at Feng Xun. “Feng Xun! You!”","Feng Xun patted Yu Mingye on the shoulder. “Yu Mingye, don’t worry. Boss","Xiao Wu will keep an eye on you. We won’t send you away. Don’t worry.”","Yu Mingye turned his head in frustration. Although he knew that Feng Wu was bound to win, he still felt conflicted.","Feng Wu chuckled and said to Yu Mingye, “Feng Xun is right. I’m not going to lose. Trust me.”","What more could Yu Mingye say?","“What if you lose?” Feng Wu stared at the fourth prince and decided that she would make him pay.","The fourth prince gave it some thought and said, “Pick whatever you want from my residence!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","The fourth prince said, “Of course.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Everyone here heard you, and a lot of people are watching outside. You won’t go back on your word, will you?”","The fourth prince said, “Do you think I’ll go back on my word? Let’s sign an agreement!”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s what I was waiting for!”","They soon signed the agreement, and someone said,","“If Feng Wu’s team can’t pass the first round, she won’t get a chance to fight the fourth prince.”","The fourth prince stared at Feng Wu. “You won’t lose to Murong’s team, will you? No, you’re definitely going to lose!”","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at the fourth prince. “I’m not going to lose! Go get your money ready!”","The fourth prince was speechless.","As a matter of fact, he had never been treated like this before. However, Feng Wu seemed to intimidate him somehow as if it was only natural that he should listen to her. How strange.","Soon, the two teams were the only ones left on the stage.","Feng Wu arranged the order of the players.","Duan Chaoge was the first to go on the stage, followed by Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Yu Mingye, and herself.","After that, Feng Wu turned to Murong Linhai. “Let’s go.”","To Feng Wu’s surprise..."]},{"number":4168,"title":"Chapter 4168: Let’s Fight (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","To Feng Wu’s surprise...","Murong Linhai suddenly waved at Feng Wu. “We give up.”","What?","Feng Wu wasn’t the only one surprised. The crowd and the other teams were all staring at Murong Linhai in astonishment.","Give up?","How could Murong Linhai abstain from such an important competition? What a son had the Murong family raised?!","Yan Qian glared at Murong Linhai. “Don’t tell me you’ve given up because you’ve been conquered by her beauty and want to do her a favor!”","“Help her?” Murong Linhai thought to himself. “I wish I could, but I need to be capable enough to do that.”","Of course, Murong Linhai didn’t say that aloud. Instead of answering the question, he cupped his fists at Feng Wu and said indifferently, “We Imow we’re no match for Miss Feng Wu in this round. I wish you all the best!”","Feng Wu glanced at Murong Linhai and nodded.","The others didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu was so aggrogant!","Feng Wu glanced at Liang Jin when she heard no reply.","Liang Jin was the host of this battle.","Liang Jin smiled bitterly in his head, but he still said, “Feng Wu has won this round. The next round will be the battle between the Yan Prince’s residence and the Primordial Pagoda!”","Feng Wu and the others left the arena.","“I didn’t know that Murong Linhai would forfeit. Heh.” Feng Xun gloated.","Crossing his arms, Yu Mingye said grumpily, “I was looking forward to fighting him. You don’t know how he looks at Xiao Wu.”","“What are you two talking about? Enjoy the game.” Feng Wu had to cut them off.","Yan Qian led her team, and the Primordial Pagoda was led by Chanxin, a monk.","Each side would send one member at first, and the winners would continue to fight on the stage, while the losing team would send a second member.","The battle went on.","They were evenly matched, and soon, both sides had the last player.","Yan Qian was the last in her team.","On the Primordial Pagoda’s side, Chanxin was the last to show up.","Yan Qian was definitely more capable than Princess Yan Ling, but she wasn’t as good as Prince Yan Yu. Come to think of it, she was about the same level as","Feng Xun.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder at Feng Xun, who nodded. “I’m sure I can defeat her!”","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu was perplexed.","People of the Dayan Empire were supposed to be so talented and resourceful that they could make breakthroughs much faster than outsiders. However, after Feng Xun’s training, he had reached Princess Yan Qian’s level.","Feng Wu wasn’t sure how capable the people of the Dayan Empire were, so she asked Ji Xingcheng, “What level is Princess Yan Qian?”","Ji Xingcheng said seriously, “Princess Yan Qian is the second best student of the younger generation in the Yan manor, second only to Prince Yan Yu. That’s already very impressive.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you serious?”","Ji Xingcheng nodded. “Of course. Moreover, their family clan has invested a lot of resources in her. Therefore, among the younger generation, Yan Qian is the most talented girl. She’s amazing!”","Feng Wu had a rough idea.","Meanwhile, the battle was coming to an end.","With her clever moves, Princess Yan Qian finally won the battle against the Primordial Pagoda.","Liang Jin announced the next battle: Formless Sword Sect versus Red Feather Room.","The Formless Sword Sect was good with swords, and Red Feather Room only had female members. The battle was very fast.."]},{"number":4169,"title":"Chapter 4169: Let’s Fight (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4169: Let’s Fight (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Soon, the Formless Sword Sect won.","“Good job.” The second senior brother of the Formless Sword Sect cupped his fists at Fairy Ziyun of Red Feather Room.","The faces of the women of the Red Feather Room darkened, but they still accepted the result in the end.","After a short battle, the four teams who won were Feng Wu, the Dynasty, Yan family, and the Formless Sword Sect.","Liang Jin’s Mountain Sea Academy had been defeated, and he would be lying if he said that he wasn’t sad.","But Ji Xingcheng comforted him. “Senior Brother, do you think you can defeat the Dynasty Team? Do you think you can defeat the fourth prince?” Liang Jin hesitated for a while before shaking his head.","Ji Xingcheng asked, “Senior Brother, are you confident that you can defeat","Feng Wu’s team?”","Liang Jin shook his head. “Of course not!”","Ji Xingcheng said, “That’s it, then. We can’t defeat either Dynasty Team or Feng Wu’s team, so what’s the point of competing? Only the first place will be rewarded this time. The second place is useless.”","Liang Jin nodded. “You’re right. What we need to do now is to learn something from their battles. The Dragon’s Gate banquet in the imperial capital will be our real chance.”","Ji Xingcheng nodded. “The Mountain Sea Academy has that card up our sleeves. I’m sure Senior Brother Zhennan won’t disappoint us.”","Liang Jin asked the four captains to make the draw.","The fourth prince, Feng Wu, Ye Erjian, and Yan Qian from the Yan manor all rolled the dice.","The fourth prince picked Yan Qian.","Feng Wu got the Formless Sword Sect.","It was obvious that the fourth prince was very calm, and Yan Qian looked embarrassed.","The result was the same.","The fourth prince easily defeated Yan Qian’s team.","“Thank you.” The fourth prince cupped his fists and beamed at Yan Qian.","Although she had lost, Yan Qian didn’t look very angry. She cupped her fists and smiled bitterly. “Your Royal Highness, I’m afraid that you’re going to take all the pills. Would you like to sell one to me?”","The fourth prince waved his hand. “Well, it’s not completely out of the question. It’ll depend on what price Sister Yan Qian is willing to pay.” They began to talk about the rewards.","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows a little. Meanwhile, Yu Mingye cupped his fists and said to them with a half-smile, “Do you really think that the pill is yours? Are you going to share the spoils now? Aren’t you afraid of losing?” The fourth prince’s face darkened.","Yan Qian threw a dirty look at Yu Mingye. “Hey, watch your language!”","Many people were talking about Yu Mingye as well, for they believed that the fourth prince’s team was bound to win. How could they not? That was impossible.","Yu Mingye gave her a half-smile. “What do you mean by ‘hey’? Am I wrong? Tell me, what did I say wrong?”","Yan Qian stared at Yu Mingye coldly. Instead of answering his question, she snorted. “You should count yourself lucky that you didn’t have the chance to fight me. Otherwise...”","Before Yu Mingye could say anything, Feng Xun smirked. “You’re the lucky one. Otherwise, you wouldn’t be standing here talking to us.”","Princess Yan Qian was suffocated.."]},{"number":4170,"title":"Chapter 4170: Let’s Fight (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4170: Let’s Fight (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Qian felt suffocated.","She couldn’t for the life of her figure out how a commoner from the wilderness could challenge her.","She then turned to the Formless Sword Sect.","“Brother Ye, please teach these people a lesson for me.”","The Formless Sword Sect had always been close to Prince Yan’s residence, and Ye Erjian knew Princess Yan Qian well. The two families had even considered getting married. Therefore, Ye Erjian nodded. “Of course.”","And they weren’t the only ones watching.","Normally, all four forces and six sects could watch it, but because it was a battle between youngsters, the elders might not have time to watch it.","They didn’t have time to watch the first 17 trials on Dynasty Road. As for the final battle, they had anticipated that the fourth prince would win, so they didn’t want to watch it either.","Therefore, only a handful of families were watching the battle.","Prince Yan was watching.","So was the Luo family.","The head of the Mountain Sea Academy was also watching, and next to him was Qiu Zhennan, the genius of the college.","On one side of the arena was the Formless Sword Sect, and Feng Wu’s team was on the other.","Yu Mingye glanced at Feng Wu . “You don’t have to fight this battle. You’re the last to go.”","Feng wu said, ‘Well.. ”","For once, Feng Xun had the same opinion as Yu Mingye. He nodded at Feng Wu and said, “That’s right. This is a rare opportunity. Don’t try to take it away from us. Just wait behind us. You’ll never get to fight. We’ll make it very clear for you.”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, the members of the Formless Sword Sect flared up.","Yu Mingye and Feng Xun didn’t try to keep their voices down when they said those words.","Ye Erjian smirked. “How arrogant of you! Since you’re so arrogant, we’ll show you what we’ve got!”","The bosses watching the battle outside didn’t like Feng Wu’s team either.","“Which team is this?” Lord Yan frowned at Feng Wu’s team.","Standing next to him, Yan Yu recognized Feng Wu right away, and his face darkened.","Yan Yu had told him about what happened in the Junwu Empire, so he said,","“Father, the girl in the red dress is Feng Wu, and the other four are her friends.”","“Feng Wu?” Lord Yan found the name familiar as if he had heard it somewhere before.","Yan Yu reminded him, “The Junwu Kingdom.”","“Is she the girl that Huyan Yanbo is protecting?","Huyan Yanbo was Mu Jiuzhou’s pupil, and he was one of the most capable cultivators on this continent. That was why Lord Yan gave Feng Wu a second look.","Crossing his hands behind his back, the lord said indifferently, “But the girl isn’t all that capable.”","Yan Yu opened his mouth but didn’t say anything.","Lord Yan was only watching the last round, but Prince Yan Yu had been watching Feng Wu since she entered Dynasty Road!","Yan Yu had spent a lot of spiritual crystals in the past few months to see what Feng Wu had gone through on her way to the imperial capital. He had almost used up his own vault.","Just then, the two teams started fighting.","Feng Wu’s team started with Duan Chaoge.."]},{"number":4171,"title":"Chapter 4171: Let’s Fight (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4171: Let’s Fight (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chaoge had indeed made some great progress, but she was still a little weaker than the other geniuses. Hence, she didn’t last long enough to pass the first round.","“Xiao Wu, I...” Chaoge looked at Feng Wu gingerly, feeling utterly guilty.","That was expected, and Feng Wu didn’t think much of it. She only encouraged Chaoge. “You’re doing well enough. Just think about it. Three months ago, you couldn’t even withstand a single strike from him, could you?”","Hearing that, Duan Chaoge tilted her head, gave it some thought, and nodded.","“That’s right. I’m making progress already, but I need to work harder!” After that, Feng Wu didn’t need to remind her. She sat down cross-legged in the noisy place and started cultivating right away.","However, many people sneered at Duan Chaoge’s defeat and said that Feng Wu’s team wasn’t good enough.","Their tone was full of sarcasm.","Members of the fourth prince’s team all snorted.","The members of the Formless Sword Sect didn’t think much of Feng Xun and the others either.","However...","It was like what Feng Xun and Yu Mingye said. Feng Wu wouldn’t be needed in this battle.","If Feng Wu hadn’t told them to keep some cards up their sleeves at first, Yu Mingye wouldn’t have been given the chance.","Thump!","In the end, Yu Mingye kicked Ye Erjian, the leader of the team, off the stage. Resting his hands on his waist, he looked around and asked, “Who else is there? Bring it on!”","Feng Wu smacked her forehead. Why was he so silly?","Meanwhile, the members of the Formless Sword Sect were furious with Yu Mingye.","Liang Jin announced, “Team Feng Wu has won the battle.","“The Dynasty Team and Feng Wu’s team will fight the last battle, and the winner will get the pill! ”","The audience no longer looked down on Feng Wu’s team as before.","Because Feng Wu’s team had indeed made it this far with their own capability. No matter how loudly the Formless Sword Sect shouted, they still lost.","The eyes of the onlookers lit up as well.","“Well, that’s interesting.” Lord Yan smiled. “Feng Wu’s team is quite something.”","Yan Yu’s face darkened, and there was an indescribable look in his eyes.","Back in the Junwu Empire a few months ago, both Yu Mingye and Feng Xun were only Spiritual Overlords. They hadn’t even reached the Spiritual Saint stage yet. However, in the past few months, because of their talent and the cultivation resources Feng Wu found...","Right now, they were almost as capable as Yan Yu was.","Damn it!","At that thought, he clenched his fists.","He had to kill them all as soon as possible. Otherwise, they would become a burden to him in the future! In a few more months, he might not even be their match!","Meanwhile, in the Luo family, Luo Zilin said to his brother, “Brother, look! That’s our little Feng Wu!”","Luo Zihen, the eldest brother of the Luo family and the first in line to inherit the family was looking at Feng Wu with a gentle look in his eyes.","“She’s been through a lot...” Luo Zihen said gently, sounding sympathetic for Feng Wu.","Luo Zilin nodded. “That’s right. She’s been through a lot out there, but I didn’t know she could be so capable. She has taken most of the treasures.. If I had known.."]},{"number":4172,"title":"Chapter 4172: Let’s Fight (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4172: Let’s Fight (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin said, “If I had known, I wouldn’t have gone to Dynasty Road with Yan Yu back then. I would have followed Xiao Wu and become her patron. That would have been wonderful.”","Luo Zihen said grumpily, “Didn’t you see how dangerous her journey was?”","When Luo Zilin came back, he took Luo Zihen with him to watch Feng Wu’s performance on Dynasty Road. At first, the two brothers thought that Feng Wu would be lucky if she could get out alive, but the girl’s reaction shocked them.","She had narrowly escaped death several times, but she was so lucky and had received so many cultivation resources.","“Is it the final battle? Is it?”","The Luo brothers rushed in.","Luo Zilin was the fourth son of the Luo family, and his other two older brothers were also here to watch the final battle.","If their father hadn’t been busy with some important business, he would be here as well.","The four brothers of the Luo family had been watching Feng Wu for months. Although they hadn’t met her yet, they were already very familiar with her and liked her from the bottom of their hearts.","The head of the Mountain Sea Academy was very calm because his team wasn’t fighting his battle.","“Liang Jin isn’t up to the task after all.” he looked over his shoulder at Qiu","Zhennan. “In the end, you’re still going to be the head of the college.”","Qiu Zhennan nodded. “We still have a few senior brothers and sisters. Master, please don’t worry.”","His senior brothers and sisters... The principal smiled bitterly and didn’t say anything else.","Meanwhile, the final battle finally started.","At first, only Lord Yan’s residence, the Mountain Sea Academy, and the Luo family were watching, but now, the heads of the other sects were watching as well.","Dynasty Road only opened once every three years, and geniuses would be born among these people.","Would the fourth prince become famous this time?","If he could defeat all his opponents in one go, he would probably be as important to His Majesty as the crown prince. After all, the crown prince used to be first as well.","The fourth prince stared at Feng Wu.","To Feng Wu, the battle might only be a competition for the pill, but to the fourth prince, it could decide if he could become one of the candidates for the throne.","Chaoge was the first to fight.","She had just made a breakthrough and become a Spiritual Saint, which amazed many people.","Everyone looked at Duan Chaoge in amazement.","After the battle, Duan Chaoge was covered in blood. While she flew off the stage, she also took a member of the Dynasty Team with her!","The first round was a draw, and each side lost a player.","“Wait!” Master Chilian, the head of the Red Feather Room, looked pleasantly surprised. “Her quality, talent, and heartless cultivation technique are perfect for our sect!”","Master Chilian’s disciples looked at one another in bewilderment.","The eldest disciple couldn’t help but say, “Master, Junior Sister Ziyun is a little more talented than her, isn’t she?”","Master Chilian didn’t answer the question, for even she couldn’t tell who was more talented, Ziyun or Miss Chaoge.."]},{"number":4173,"title":"Chapter 4173: Competition (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4173: Competition (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s go!” Master Chilian, headed for the door. The other disciples looked at one another in bewilderment. Were they in a hurry to wait at the gate of Dynasty Road?","well...","Meanwhile, the second round started.","It was Feng Xun’s turn, while Zhu Mingming was the one sent by the Dynasty Team. The Zhu family was where the fourth prince’s mother came from.","“Cousin!” The fourth prince stared at Zhu Mingming, hinting that he had to kick Feng Xun out.","A relaxed smile appeared on Zhu Mingming’s face. He said indifferently, “It’s not a big deal. Just wait and see!”","Then...","In the end, Feng Xun kicked Zhu Mingming off the stage, but Feng Xun remained on the stage, although he looked badly injured as well.","It just so happened that at that critical moment, Feng Xun had the impulse to make a breakthrough!","Feng Wu took Feng Xun off the stage right away. “Just sit there and make your breakthrough. Don’t worry about the battle.”","The others were speechless when they saw this.","Not only had Duan Chaoge made a breakthrough, but Feng Xun was also going to make a breakthrough. What was wrong with Feng Wu’s team?","Zhu Mingming was dumbfounded as well. He looked from himself to Feng Xun and couldn’t believe his eyes.","The two of them were evenly matched just then, but Feng Xun was making a breakthrough now, and when that happened, Feng Xun would be so much better than him!","At that thought, Zhu Mingming looked at the fourth prince involuntarily.","Meanwhile, the fourth prince didn’t look too happy. He had a solemn look on his face, and his eyes darkened a little.","The crown prince was watching the battle. Seeing this, he smiled and told the eunuch next to him, “Go fetch His Majesty. This is getting more and more interesting.”","Seeing this, the Luo brothers couldn’t help but laugh. “Interesting. Maybe Xiao Wu really will win this battle!”","The head of the Mountain Sea Academy’s eyes lit up, and Qiu Zhennan couldn’t hide his excitement. ‘Master, this Feng Xun is...”","The head of the Mountain Sea Academy nodded. “You’re right. His constitution is especially suitable for that cultivation technique. Let’s go! ”","The head of the Mountain Sea Academy, who had been disinterested, was also heading for the destination of Dynasty Road.","Before long, Lord Yan, the Mountain Sea Academy, the Luo family, and the Red Feather Room all gathered at the end of Dynasty Road.","The heads of the clans exchanged looks and each had a plan.","Because Feng Wu’s team came from outside the empire, they had no masters in the Dayan Empire. If they didn’t recruit such a genius, when would they?","Meanwhile, the battle was still going on.","Xuan Yi was the third player, and Chen Yi, the fourth prince’s most valued study companion, was going up against him.","“If you lose, do as you see fit!”","Before Chen Jing went on the stage, the fourth prince was by his side and was threatening him in a low voice.","Chen Yi cupped his fists at ????????? prince. “Your Royal Highness, don’t worry. I’m going to win!”","Although Chen Yiran was the fourth prince’s study companion, the Chen family wasn’t just any family. They were one of the most influential families in the Dayan Empire, and Chen Jing was the most promising member of the younger generation. He enjoyed the best cultivation resources of the clan.","“Bring it on!”","The two of them were evenly matched.","It was the longest battle and the most thrilling one.","Xuan Yi was covered with cuts and bruises, and Chen Yi wasn’t any better.","“What’s his name?” Lord Yan asked Yan Yu.."]},{"number":4174,"title":"Chapter 4174: Competition (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4174: Competition (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was obvious that Lord Yan was interested in Xuan Yi.","Yan Yu frowned a little, but still said, “Xuan Yi. His name is Xuan Yi.”","Lord Yan frowned a little. “You didn’t mention him when you came back from the Junwu Empire.”","Yan Yu said, “He wasn’t a Spiritual Saint when we were in the Junwu Empire, so","I didn’t mention him.”","Lord Yan nodded. “He’s qualified now. Do you know what to do?”","Yan Yu said, “Yes...","“Lord Yan, what’s that supposed to mean? Are you going to take him away from the Formless Sword Sect? Hahaha!” Someone laughed and came toward Prince","Yan.","Lord Yan recognized the voice right away.","“Ye Buqi, what are you doing here?”","Ye Buqi, the head of the Formless Sword Sect, was known as the “Fierce Sword of the World”. He was known for his unruly behavior and mysterious whereabouts. Lord Yan didn’t expect to meet him here today.","Ye Buqi crossed his arms and looked at the battlefield. He then said to Lord","Yan, “This Xuan Yi is impressive. He’ll suit the Formless Sword Sect.” Prince Yan asked, “Is the Formless Sword Sect trying to compete for him with","Ye Buqi laughed. “So, Lord Yan, are you trying to take him away from me?” Lord Yan snorted.","Ye Buqi said, “If there’s a genius in the outer region, all four forces and six sects will have a chance to recruit them. It’s not like they belong to you. If you really want them, I’d advise you to show some sincerity. There’s no reason for him to follow you just because you want him.”","Lord Yan smirked. “I’m recruiting him. Of course, he’s coming! What a joke!”","Ye Buqi guffawed. “Fine, fine. Feel free to do whatever you want. We’ll see if he’ll go to Lord Yan’s residence or the Formless Sword Sect!”","Xuan Yi had no idea that two families were already competing over him before the battle was over.","Yan Yu glanced at Lord Yan but didn’t say anything.","He didn’t dare to admit what he had done to offend Feng Wu and her people in the Junwu Empire, and it would be very difficult to recruit them now.","By then, the battle had finally ended.","After thirty-six strikes, Xuan Yi finally pushed Chen Yi off the stage.","“Xuan Yi of Feng Wu’s team has won this battle!” Liang Jin announced.","The crowd watched Feng Wu fight with different looks in their eyes.","Many people had been talking about how lucky the team was to make it to the finals, but no one said that anymore.","If they had relied on their luck, did it mean that the fourth prince’s team had lost the battles on purpose?","“The fourth Prince’s team only has two players left, while Feng Wu’s team has three. It’s going to be a little... confusing.”","“Not necessarily. The fourth prince hasn’t joined the battle yet. Once he does,","Xuan Yi and Yu Mingye won’t be his match.” “But don’t they still have Feng Wu?”","“I bet Feng Wu isn’t that capable.”","“That can’t be. She’s their last card up their sleeves.”","“She could be a trump card or a cripple. I think it’s very likely that Feng Wu is useless because she hasn’t made a move yet. I think she’s scared.”","Was that it?","Many people actually believed it.."]},{"number":4175,"title":"Chapter 4175: Competition (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s team still had three people left, and they were Feng Wu, Yu Mingye, and Xuan Yi.","However, there were only two people left on the fourth prince’s side: the fourth prince and Yang Shu, the genius teenager.","The fourth prince stared at Yang Shu. “You’ve been doing a great job so far, and I’ve given you the resources you need this time. Yang Shu, don’t disappoint me!”","Yang Shu nodded solemnly.","The fourth prince took a deep breath and warned him again. “My brother has to be watching this battle. If I lose, many people on my side will have other plans. This battle is very important to our future.”","Yang Shu nodded again.","As expected, after Yang Shu entered the arena, Xuan Yi was severely injured and lost after only half of the battle.","The fourth prince smiled. Yang Shu didn’t disappoint him.","However, Yu Mingye soon showed up, and Yang Shu was defeated.","The fourth prince was speechless.","Meanwhile, everyone in and out of the arena was staring at Yu Mingye in astonishment. Many people were even asking who he was.","So did the crowd outside.","Ye Buqi of the Formless Sword Sect nodded. “He’s a nice teenager. In terms of cultivation talent, he’s probably slightly better than Xuan Yi.”","He added, “But Xuan Yi is better at the sword.” “Yu Mingye is a good choice for the Murong family.”","“He’ll suit the Luo family as well.”","“I also find him very suitable.”","The heads of the clan treated each other with great respect, but this was a rare opportunity for them to compete for genius, and none of them would give in.","After all, almost all the geniuses who were on the Dynasty Road before had come from the four forces and six major sects. Who could possibly recruit them? They were the treasures of their families and clans, and no one would be able to recruit them.","But things were different now.","It just so happened that these kids were all from other regions and had no sect or foundation in the Dayan Empire. Moreover, they were all geniuses with great talents. Every sect would want them.","Having them would be such a great deal!","Hence, none of the masters gave in. Even the head of the Luo family had to fly over here to wait, fearing that someone would take Feng Wu away.","While the heads had high hopes for the young genius they wanted to win over, the battle was still going on inside.","Right now, Yu Mingye and the fourth prince were fighting.","Feng Wu’s team still had Feng Wu left, but the fourth prince was on his own.","If the fourth prince lost, the battle would be over.","If the fourth prince won, the final battle would be between Feng Wu and him.","Feng Wu saw that Yu Mingye, who had always been unperturbed, had finally become serious. Every move he made was very precise and methodical.","“I didn’t expect Yu Mingye to make such rapid progress...” Seeing that the battle was still going on, Feng Wu couldnt help but sigh at Feng Xun. “Before I came to Dynasty Road, Yu Mingye was nowhere near as capable as the fourth prince. But now, it’s hard to tell who’s going to win. It won’t be long before he exceeds the fourth prince.”","Feng Wu didn’t try to keep her voice down, so everyone close to her heard it, including the fourth prince.","He gave Feng Wu a dirty look.","Feng Wu shrugged. “Why are you staring at me? You’re just not that good..”"]},{"number":4176,"title":"Chapter 4176: Competition (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’m not weaker than him. Just wait and see!” The fourth prince threw a dirty look at Feng Wu before turning back to Yu Mingye.","Unfortunately, Yu Mingye wasn’t easy to handle.","If the fourth prince had ignored Feng Wu and focused on fighting Yu Mingye, he might have had a chance to win. However, he couldn’t stand it and wanted to say something harsh to Feng Wu.","One couldn’t afford to be distracted in a battle between two capable cultivators.","Yu Mingye wouldn’t give him that kind of a chance.","Therefore...","Thump!","Yu Mingye kicked the fourth prince’s sword out of the arena.","“Ah!”","The audience cried out in surprise.","The fourth prince was dazed for a brief moment before he was kicked away by Yu Mingye. He made an arch in the air before falling to the ground with a thump!","Rubbing the tip of his nose with his right thumb, Yu Mingye gloated at the fourth prince, who had fallen to the ground, and asked loudly, “Anyone else?!”","The fourth prince was speechless.","The audience was astonished.","Everyone stared at Yu Mingye as if he was a monster. That was... incredible!","Was he really from another continent?","Ji Xingcheng took his senior brother’s hand and said, “Senior Brother, please announce the result!”","Liang Jin was equally shocked and only realized what had happened when Ji","Xingcheng reminded him. He stood on the stage and announced loudly, “Yu","Mingye is the winner!”","Before the fourth prince could react, Liang Jin heaved a sigh of relief and announced loudly, “Feng Wu’s team won this battle!”","Gosh...","Everyone fell silent for a moment before there was a round of applause.","However, no one dared to make another sound after the fourth prince cast a stern look at them.","However, everyone was looking around.","Ye Erjian of the Formless Sword Sect, Fairy Ziyun of the Red Feather Room, and many others gave the fourth prince indescribable looks, but the look they gave Yu Mingye was even more so.","Especially Fairy Ziyun, whose eyes twinkled when she looked at Yu Mingye.","Feng Wu was a little disappointed, for she didn’t even have a chance to fight in the competition.","However, Feng Wu wasn’t all that into fighting herself, so she didn’t mind if she didn’t have a chance. She went up to the stage and asked Ji Xingcheng, “Shall we take the prizes now?”","She wasn’t trying to urge him, but the fourth prince’s glare frightened everyone. Liang Jin even forgot to announce the prize.","Hearing Feng Wu’s reminder, Liang Jin smiled bitterly. “That’s right. It’s time for the reward. His Royal Highness...”","The fourth prince had the pills.","Because the fourth prince had never expected to lose, he didn’t hand them over.","Immediately, all eyes were on the fourth prince.","The fourth prince’s face was livid.","Meanwhile, Zhu Mingming and the others were already trying to help the fourth prince to his feet.","However, the fourth prince threw off his hand and turned to leave.","Just then, Feng Wu and Liang Jin changed the subject to the fourth prince, and all eyes were on him. The fourth prince felt a chill run down his spine.","Feng Wu asked hesitantly, “Your Royal Highness, where are you going? Don’t you have the pills? Are you going to take what’s not yours?”","The fourth prince was astonished.","turned around and smirked at Feng Wu. “So what if it’s true? You’re just a commoner!”","Everyone was intimidated by the fourth prince’s ruthless tone and didn’t dare to speak.."]},{"number":4177,"title":"Chapter 4177: Competition (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4177: Competition (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated at all. Crossing her arms, she smiled at the fourth prince. “Well, I see that you’ve lost. Are you trying to intimidate me like a prince now?”","Feng Wu turned to Liang Jin. “Didn’t you say that all the major clans were watching this battle? So, they’ll see keep his word.”","The fourth prince was speechless.","Could Feng Wu be any more annoying?","prince as someone who wouldn’t","On any other day, the fourth prince would have taken the pills, but with all the big shots watching, he couldn’t be so willful.","It just so happened that the fourth prince was used to enjoying privileges, so he hated Feng Wu to the bone.","“There you go!” The fourth prince threw a bottle of pills at Feng Wu.","If Feng Wu wasn’t capable enough, her head would be smashed to pieces by the bottle.","“Watch out!” Ji Xingcheng and Liang Jin cried out, but they were too far away from Feng Wu to stop the bottle.","Yu Mingye caught the bottle with one hand and raised an eyebrow at the fourth prince. “I’ve defeated you. Who are you trying to scare?”","The fourth prince was so angry that he didn’t know what to say.","“There you go.” Yu Mingye handed the bottle to Feng Wu.","Some people looked at Feng Wu suspiciously.","Feng Wu hadn’t made a move this whole time. What was her level? Or was she a hidden cripple as everyone had speculated?","Just then, they heard a voice.","“Your Royal Highness is here—” “Lord Yan is here —”","“Master Luo is here —”","“The head of Red Feather Room is here —”","“The head of the Formless Sword Sect is here “Master Murong is here —”","“The head of the Mountain Sea Academy is here —”","Apart from the Sacred Mu Cliff and the Primordial Pagoda, all the heads of the other seven forces were here.","The Dayan Empire was represented by the eldest prince, who was the most popular among the princes. Therefore, he represented the empire more than the fourth prince did.","“Would you like to come to the Red Feather Room?” Master Chilian quickly walked up to Chaoge and smiled at her.","Duan Chaoge hesitated. She turned around and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Before Master Chilian could say anything, her eldest pupil said, “We’re from the Red Feather Room, which is where women of Dayan cultivate. Your Flower Valley’s cultivation technique that you’re using comes from our sect.”","Duan Chaoge had learned the cultivation technique from Hua Wuqing, but the manual was incomplete, and she had been stuck there.","Therefore, when Master Chilian mentioned the cultivation technique, Duan Chaoge was tempted, but...","She went up to Feng Wu and shook her head at Master Chilian. She wasn’t going to leave Feng Wu.","Seeing Luo Zilin winking at her, Feng Wu waved at him.","Luo Zilin whispered in Feng Wu’s ear, “Master Chilian has similar cultivation techniques to Chaoge. They’re of the same heritage. Haven’t you been trying to improve her cultivation? Let her go to the Red Feather Room. I promise you that she’ll make great progress.”","Feng Wu hesitated. “But the Red Feather Room is...”","Luo Zilin said, “The Red Feather Room is an aloof place and has never been involved in any internal strife. It’s a great cultivation sect. Look at Master Chilian. She looks like she has found a treasure. I’m sure she’ll put a lot of effort into Chaoge. I think she’s going to become the next head of the sect..”"]},{"number":4178,"title":"Chapter 4178: Competition (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4178: Competition (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You found the fragment of the cultivation technique on Dynasty Road, didn’t you? There’s a complete one in the Red Feather Room.” Master Chilian knew how much Feng Wu’s words would affect Chaoge, so she spoke to Feng Wu in a serious tone.","Feng Wu frowned. ‘What if the Red Feather Room forces Chaoge to do things she doesn’t want to do in the future...","Master Chilian cut to the chase. “If she doesn’t want to do something, no one will force her. If that really happens, she can leave the Red Feather Room at any time. Moreover, after she comes to the Red Feather Room, she’ll be my final disciple and the revered junior sister of the entire sect. If anyone dares to pick on her, I’ll be the first to intervene!”","Everyone gave Feng Wu and Master Chilian strange looks.","They were surprised that Feng Wu didn’t want Duan Chaoge to join the Red Feather Room. Did she know what a great opportunity that was?","They were even more surprised when they saw that Master Chilian would agree to anything in order to get Duan Chaoge. That was beyond their expectations.","“Is Duan Chaoge that talented? Did Master Chilian have to do this?” Someone murmured in Fairy Ziyun’s ear.","Fairy Ziyun’s face darkened.","Someone next to her said, “Duan Chaoge is indeed very talented and capable. What’s more, she has risen to her current level in another world, which means that she still has more potential to explore. Moreover, her cultivation technique comes from the Red Feather Room. If I were Master Chilian, I wouldn’t have given up on her either. It’s just that Master Chilian has always been so proud. The fact that she can bring herself to do such a thing shows how important Duan Chaoge is to the sect.”","Fairy Ziyun’s face darkened.","In the end, Chaoge agreed to go to the Red Feather Room, but she had made it clear that if the Red Feather Room made her uncomfortable, she could leave at any moment.","Feng Wu and the others didn’t want to part with you, but they all knew that going to the Red Feather Room would help Chaoge’s future. Hence, they said they would visit Chaoge later.","To Feng Xun’s surprise, it was his turn next.","“Feng Xun, would you like to join us? I’ll welcome you on behalf of the Luo family.” Luo Zilin turned around and grinned at Feng Xun. Feng Xun pointed at himself. “Me? Are you sure you’re inviting me?” However, someone cut Luo Zilin off before he could say anything.","“The Murong family is a nice place, too.” Murong Linhai stepped out and smiled at Feng Xun. “I forfeited the first round voluntarily. For that, you should at least consider the Murong family.”","Feng Xun mumbled, “Even if you fought us, do you think you would have won?” Murong Linhai didn’t know what to say.","Just then, the head of the Mountain Sea Academy came out to invite Feng Xun.","“The Mountain Sea Academy?” Feng Xun hesitated and turned to look at Feng wu.","Qiu Zhennan said to Feng Xun in a serious tone, “Your Ultimate Yang Body and the cultivation technique you’re using are of the same lineage as ours. They’ll be very beneficial to your cultivation.”","The head of the Luo family nodded at Feng Wu.","For some unknown reason, Feng Wu felt very close to the head of the Luo family as if she had met him before.","“The Mountain Sea Academy might be a good choice,” Feng Wu suggested to Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said, “But I want to stay with you..”"]},{"number":4179,"title":"Chapter 4179: I’m Your Brother (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “The Dragon’s Gate banquet is in six months. It’ll be so easy for you to see Feng Wu then.”","Feng Xun turned to Feng Wu. “Are you going to the Mountain Sea Academy, then?”","Feng Wu? Of course, the Mountain Sea Academy would welcome her, but Feng","Wu shook her head. “I don’t think I’ll go, but it seems that it’ll really suit you.”","Feng Wu had wanted to take Feng Xun to the Luo family, but if the Mountain Sea Academy was more suitable for him, she would prefer it.","“Alright...” Feng Xun agreed in the end.","When it was Xuan Yi and Yu Mingye’s turn, many other sects tried to invite them. However, in the end, Xuan Yi went to the Formless Sword Sect, while Yu Mingye went to the eldest prince’s royal family.","Feng Wu looked concerned when Yu Mingye winked at her. “Don’t worry. I’ll come to you as soon as I’m done. However, if you really miss me, why don’t you come to the Dynasty Team with me?”","Feng Wu punched him.","When it was Feng Wu’s turn, she went to the Luo family.","“Exactly how capable is Feng Wu? I’ve never seen her fight. Is she really that weak? Maybe the Luo family has made the wrong choice.”","That was what many people thought.","However, Ji Xingcheng and Liang Jin couldn’t help but smile bitterly when they saw that Feng Wu had gone to the Luo family. Feng Wu was one of the most talented cultivators with great potential. If she joined the Luo family, the Luo family would rise even higher.","“I don’t think Feng Wu is good enough,” Ye Erjian said with a smirk.","Murong Linhai glanced at him but didn’t say anything. “Feng Wu isn’t good enough? Soon, you’ll see how good she is.”","After that, the bosses bid farewell with cupped fists and left with the geniuses they had recruited.","Duan Chaoge went to the Red Feather Room.","Feng Xun went to the Mountain Sea Academy.","Xuan Yi went to the Formless Sword Sect.","Yu Mingye went with the royal family.","Feng Wu followed Luo Zilin and the head of the Luo family back home.","The Luo family.","The Luo family greeted Feng Wu with the highest standards when she arrived.","Feng Wu tugged at Luo Zilin. “Isn’t that a little too grand?”","Luo Zilin grinned. “It’s not grand at all. I think it’s just right.”","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t you say that you were going to tell me about my relationship with the Luo family? Can you tell me now?”","Luo Zilin grinned again. “Father and the others are ready to tell you. Come with me. Let’s go.”","When she got to the study, Feng Wu saw that the head of the Luo family was sitting in the middle of the room, and four teenagers stood behind him. The first one was a little older and seemed to be married, but the other three didn’t seem to be. They were all smiling at Feng Wu in a friendly manner.","“Your mother is my sister, so you have to call me uncle.” The head of the Luo family nodded at Feng Wu. He was usually a serious and reserved man, but because of his joy, he was smiling as well.","“That’s right. I’m your fourth brother. I didn’t take advantage of you, did I?” Luo Zilin had worked very hard to keep the secret. Now that his father had made it clear, he began to yell at Feng Wu. “I’m your eldest brother.” “I’m your second brother.”","“I’m your third brother.”","The other three teenagers nodded at Feng Wu in a friendly manner as well, and they couldn’t hide the joy on their faces.."]},{"number":4180,"title":"Chapter 4180: I’m Your Brother (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Back in the Junwu Empire, Feng Wu had already guessed something from Luo Zilin’s behavior. She had thought that they were related, but she didn’t expect them to be so close.","“My uncle and brothers?”","Feng Wu didn’t get to finish her sentence before someone answered with a nod.","Feng Wu said, “That is to say, my mother’s surname is Luo. Are you sure you’re not mistaken?”","It would be such a joke if they had mistaken her for someone else...","Master Luo nodded. “Your mother’s surname is Luo, and she was born and raised in Dayan. Something happened to her, and we thought she was killed, but we’ve been looking into the matter.","“There was an abnormal activity in Lord Yan’s residence this time, and Zilin followed them. I didn’t expect to find your mother by accident. Unfortunately, she had lost her memory by then, and she was as naive as a child. That was why he couldn’t get much information out of her.”","Feng Wu said anxiously, “My mother is missing!”","The head of the Luo family looked at Feng Wu and said, “Your mother went missing, and we’ve found out who took her. That’s why we brought you here and told you about it.”","Feng Wu asked solemnly, “Who was it?”","After some thought, Master Luo said, “Your father.”","WHAT?!","Feng Wu stared at him in disbelief.","Her father?","Feng Wu had always thought that her father was dead. Wait, she received news a short while ago that her father was supposed to be in the Dayan Empire...","“So, he’s still alive? Is he really in the Dayan Empire? How is he now? Why didn’t he see me when he took my mother and Xiaoqi away?","Feng Wu had a lot of questions, but Master Luo only shook his head. “Because he’s too ashamed to see you.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","The head of the Luo family glanced at Luo Zilin. As a senior member of the family, he couldn’t bring himself to say such things.","Hence, Luo Zilin told Feng Wu the truth.","Feng Wu was astonished. She stared at Luo Zilin. “What?!”","Luo Zilin nodded at Feng Wu. “It’s true.”","“That’s impossible!” Feng Wu couldn’t believe it!","She couldn’t believe that a supposed dead man had shown up in the Dayan Empire and become the Princess Royal’s husband!","“What’s going on, then?","“If he is the Princess Royal’s husband, why did he take my mother and Xiaoqi away? What does he want?!","“And that Princess Royal..","Feng Wu didn’t know anything about the Dayan Empire at first, but she had learned a little from Yan Yu and Luo Zilin, and Princess Royal didn’t sound like a nice person to Feng Wu.","Because she had colluded with Lord Yan’s manor to destroy the Junwu Empire.","Luo Zilin said, “We haven’t figured out exactly what he wants to do, but your mother and Xiaoqi are indeed in the Princess Royal’s residence now.” Feng Wu asked, “Did they give my mother and Xiaoqi a hard time?”","Luo Zilin said, “She would have, but with the Luo family around, the Princess Royal won’t dare to do anything. However, that won’t be the case for long. Now that you’re here, you can make the decision yourself.”","Feng Wu took a deep breath to digest the news.","Her father was the Princess Royal’s husband... Feng Wu smiled bitterly inwardly. She would rather not have such a father. “I’m going to the Princess Royal’s residence!”"]},{"number":4181,"title":"Chapter 4181: Princess Royal’s Husband (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4181: Princess Royal’s Husband (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the Princess Royal’s residence.","This was the first time that Feng Wu had ever met her own father.","The middle-aged man wore a purple robe and looked rather serious. Feng Wu realized right away that he was a capable cultivator, at least more capable than she was.","Feng Wu was already a Spiritual Sovereign, which was one of the rare cases in the Dayan Empire. However, Feng Yanbing was even more powerful than she was and had completely suppressed Feng Wu.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and looked at him with hostility.","“Gosh, you’re such a pair of father and daughter. Why are you staring at each other like two cross-eyed birds?” A pleasant voice came from a short distance away.","Feng Wu didn’t look back, but the woman casually walked up to Feng Wu, looked her in the eye, and suddenly smiled. “This is Xiao Wu, isn’t it? It’s been years since we last met, but she’s already so pretty.”","Feng Wu stared at the Princess Royal of the Dayan Empire. “Have you met me before?”","The Princess Royal smiled brightly. “Of course. I held you in my arms when you were little, and you don’t remember it at all. Well, you were only a baby then. How can you remember?”","That was interesting.","The Princess Royal had met Feng Wu when she was a baby.","“So, the question is, where did you meet me, and in what capacity?”","Instead of feeling embarrassed, Princess Royal chuckled. She then turned to","Feng Yanbing. “Honey, Xiao Wu is quite serious. She looks at me as if I’ve stolen her father.”","Feng Wu glanced at the Princess Royal.","This Princess Royal was harder to handle than she had expected.","If she was easily provoked by Feng Wu’s words, she wouldn’t be easy to handle. However, her indifference made it impossible to read her mind. But Feng Wu had never been afraid of anyone.","She smirked. “Don’t try to change the subject. Let’s face it. What? Is that question difficult to answer, or are you afraid?”","“How dare you!” Feng Yanbing scolded Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated. She smirked and said, “So, when were you and Princess Royal together? Was it before or after you married my mother? Or was it when my mother was pregnant with me? Is it that hard to answer? Do you think I won’t be able to find out if you don’t answer? Do you take me for an idiot?”","Feng Yanbing was furious. He had always considered himself a decent man, but he had never expected such a sharp-tongued defiant daughter!","“Shut up!” Feng Yanbing bellowed and charged at Feng Wu.","A figure blocked his way. It was Luo Zibo, the eldest brother of the Luo family. He stood in front of Feng Wu and stared at Feng Yanbing coldly.","“That’s very impressive.” Luo Zibo gave him a half-smile. ‘You may not consider Xiao Wu your daughter, but the Luo family treats her like our own child. You can’t hurt her.”","Feng Yanbing threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. He didn’t invite her here to hurt her!","The Princess Royal gave Feng Yanbing a meaningful look, and he nodded.","He forced a smile. “Xiao Wu, that’s not what I meant. It’s been years since we last met, and it’s inevitable that we’re not familiar with each other. There were some misunderstandings between us, but I’m your father, and that’s a fact that can’t be changed...’","Feng Yanbing wanted to build a relationship, but Feng Wu only waved him off.."]},{"number":4182,"title":"Chapter 4182: Princess Royal’s Husband (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4182: Princess Royal’s Husband (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I don’t have time for this. You know why I’m here today. Hand over my mother and Xiaoqi.”","“Kiddo, why do you say that? They’re your mother and brother, but they’re my...”","Feng Wu asked indifferently, “Your what?”","Feng Yanbing almost choked.","He had expected Feng Wu to be difficult to talk to, but he didn’t expect her to be so sarcastic.","He waved her off. “Let’s talk about that later. The princess has prepared a courtyard for you and decorated it according to your preferences. From now on, you’ll be living in the princess’s residence. That way, we can make up for some of the loss...","“Wait. What did you say? The princess’s residence?” Feng Wu gave Feng Yanbing a strange look. “What’s wrong with you? I’m living comfortably with the Luo family. Why should I stay here? And please don’t change the subject.","Where are my mother and Xiaoqi?”","“Xiao Wu, your father is right. You two...”","Thump!","Feng Wu flared uD!","What was wrong with these people? Why wouldn’t they listen to her? Why did they have to make her angry?","Feng Wu had a short temper, and she was a terrifying Spiritual Sovereign. As soon as she made a move, mud began to fall down from the roof of the Princess Royal’s residence.","“I see that you’re not going to bring my mother and Xiaoqi out to see me today. In that case, I’ll have to go find them myself.” After that, Feng Wu headed for the rooms in the back.","Feng Wu had Little Phoenix sneak into the backyard to look for her mother when Feng Yanbing was still bickering. With Little Phoenix’s stealth ability, even someone as powerful as Feng Yanbing didn’t notice it.","“Here!”","Little Phoenix’s voice rang out in Feng Wu’s head. It had found her mother and Xiaoqi.","Hence, Feng Wu ran in that direction.","Feng Yanbing and the Princess Royal exchanged looks and both saw astonishment in each other’s eyes!","How did she know where the mother and son lived?","“Xiao Wu!”","Feng Yanbing wanted to stop her, but the Luo brothers weren’t just for show!","The four Luo brothers had all come with Feng Wu. Right now, they all stepped out to stop Feng Yanbing.","Feng Yanbing had no choice but to stop, but his face was livid.","Feng Wu kicked the door open.","Feng Wu heard the Princess Royal’s angry and flustered voice behind her.","The moment Feng Wu rushed in, someone charged at her.","He was a capable cultivator!","A Spiritual Sovereign!","Feng Wu wouldn’t have been able to withstand that strike if she had been on Dynasty Road before. However, after the journey, she had changed completely. Therefore, she kicked the man away.","“Get lost! ”","The Spiritual Sovereign was one of the top cultivators in the Princess Royal, but Feng Wu had kicked him over the wall and sent him flying. No one knew how he was doing.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu finally saw the beautiful lady and Xiaoqi.","The beautiful lady was ghastly pale and haggard. All that was left of her was skin and bones, and now, she looked like an old woman!","Xiaoqi was tied to the bed with a cut on his chest.","If Feng Wu hadn’t arrived in time, his heart would have been cut out!","The four Luo brothers were astonished.","They only received the news yesterday that Feng Wu was in the princess’s residence, and they had brought her here today. However, they had never expected that the daughter of the Luo family would end up like this!","Damn it!"]},{"number":4183,"title":"Chapter 4183: Save Their Daughter (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu went up to her mother and steadied her. The beautiful lady was still unconscious.","“Mother?!","“Mother?!”","The beautiful lady woke up and burst into tears as soon as she saw Feng Wu.","“Xiao WII...”","“Mother!”","Feng Wu felt so sorry for her!","How could her mother be mistreated like this?!","And there was Xiaoqi.","Feng Wu examined Xiaoqi and let out a breath of relief when she saw that he was still breathing.","While Feng Wu carried the beautiful lady, Luo Zilin went up to Xiaoqi.","Luo Zilin knew that Feng Wu was furious, but he still tried to calm her down. “They’re badly injured. Let’s go back to the Luo family and wait for them to recover. Deal?”","Luo Zilin knew what Feng Wu was like. If she lost her temper, the entire Princess Royal’s residence would be destroyed.","It just so happened that the Princess Royal wasn’t someone they could afford to offend either. If they started fighting, a war would break out!","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu told herself that her mother and Xiaoqi’s injuries were of utmost importance. She needed to calm down.","Just then, the Princess Royal said coldly, “You’re not leaving!”","Feng Wu opened her eyes and stared at the Princess Royal.","Somehow, the capable Princess Royal felt threatened at that moment, and she panicked a little.","Panic? The Princess Royal thought that she was hallucinating.","“You’re not leaving.” After that, the Princess Royal turned to Feng Yanbing.","Feng Yanbing took the hint and cleared his throat. “Xiao Wu, let’s talk. Actually, we...”","However, before Feng Yanbing could finish, Feng Wu cut him off. “You should count yourselves lucky. I’m busy saving my mother and Xiaoqi, so I don’t have time to take care of you yet! We’re leaving!” Feng Wu kept walking after that.","“Stop!” The Princess Royal struck out with her sword.","Thump!","To the Princess Royal’s surprise, Feng Wu threw the sword back at her.","The blade brushed past the Princess Royal’s cheek and almost left a bloody mark.","What...","“You’re a Spiritual Sovereign!”","Feng Yanbing was as surprised as the Princess Royal was. That was so...","Feng Wu ignored them.","“You’re still not leaving!” The Princess Royal nudged Feng Yanbing and gave him a warning look.","If they left now, what would happen to their Ning Er? Would she die?","Feng Yanbing blocked Feng Wu’s way again and forced himself to say, “Xiao","Wu, you’ve misunderstood us. Your mother and Xiaoqi... They’re here to help. What will happen to Ning Er if you take them away like this? She’s waiting for them to save her.”","The look on Feng Wu’s face was very stern. She had vaguely seen a girl lying on the bed in the middle of the room.","As expected, when Feng Wu looked over her shoulder, she saw a girl about thirteen lying on the bed. Her eyes were closed, and her face was pale. It was obvious that she had passed out.","Seeing that Feng Wu had turned to look, Feng Yanbing said in a hurry, “That’s your sister we’re talking about here! Are you going to let her die just like that?","You’re sisters!”","Feng Wu finally figured out everything.","She stared at Feng Yanbing. “Did you have a baby with that woman?”","Feng Yanbing said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu wanted to laugh.","She used to imagine what her father, whom she had never met, would be like.."]},{"number":4184,"title":"Chapter 4184: Save Their Daughter (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Would he be as powerful and wise as her Master? Would he dote on her and protect her like her senior brothers?","However, she lost all hope as soon as she saw Feng Yanbing.","She would rather not see him at all!","Feng Wu gritted her teeth and stressed each word. “So, you took my mother and Xiaoqi here to treat that girl?”","Feng Wu spoke in a low voice, but anyone who knew her well could tell that she was furious.","But Feng Yanbing didn’t know Feng Wu well, so he nodded and said, “Ning Er needs your mother’s blood and Xiaoqi’s...”","“Xiaoqi’s what?” Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanbing.","Feng Wu smirked. “If you don’t tell me, do you think Mum and Xiaoqi won’t tell me when they wake up?”","The beautiful lady only woke up for a brief moment, but she was too weak. Feng Wu was worried sick when her mother passed out again. “I need... Xiaoqi’s... heart...” Feng Yanbing blurted out in the end.","“You’re shameless!”","Feng Wu tried to slap him.","Unfortunately, she missed because Feng Yanbing stumbled back and dodged Feng Wu’s strike.","“I know it’ll damage Xiaoqi’s health, but don’t worry. Even without his heart, he’ll still be alive. I can keep him alive.”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanbing.","She used to think that what Feng Yanfeng did was shameless enough, but what Feng Yanbing did now was abominable!","“Xiaoqi is my child, so of course I won’t kill him. Even if he has to stay in bed forever, I’ll make sure that...’","Feng Wu couldn’t stand it anymore. She wanted to kill someone.","“Feng Yanbing, you... you’re a piece of work!” Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “From now on, I’ll never forgive you!”","“Why can’t you understand? Xiaoqi won’t die, but he can save Ning Er. As your father...","Feng Wu was furious!","She was furious because she couldn’t kill him now.","“Let’s go.”","It was already very rare for Feng Wu to be able to fight back her anger and not kill him right now.","“Don’t let them go! Take Feng Wu down!” The Princess Royal gave the order.","Feng Wu and her team might not be their match, for the Princess Royal’s residence was filled with capable cultivators.","However, at that critical moment, they heard a cold voice.","“Who dares to stop my family?!”","It was the head of the Luo family!","Seeing that things were getting out of hand, one of the Luo brothers rushed back home to get help.","Seeing the person in Feng Wu’s arms, Master Luo felt sorry for her.","Princess Royal’s face turned livid. She gritted her teeth and stared at Master Luo.","“Luo Nantian, are you really going to fight me for a sister who has been banished from the Luo family?!”","Banished from the Luo family...","Master Luo said coldly, “If Your Royal Highness wants to fight, I’ll accept the challenge!”","The Princess Royal asked, “Are you sure about that?”","There was a cold look in Master Luo’s eyes. “My sister has been mistreated. Do you think this is over?!”","“Fine. Luo Nantian, I didn’t believe it when people said that you were rebelling, but it seems that you’ve disrespected me, the Princess Royal, and have no respect for the royal family at all! If you take her back today, I’ll go to His","Majesty now!”","“Be my guest!”","Master Luo flipped his sleeve and gestured at Feng Wu.","Everyone watched as Master Luo took Feng Wu and the others back home.."]},{"number":4185,"title":"Chapter 4185: You’re such a Father (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4185: You’re such a Father (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Luo family.","Looking over his shoulder, Luo Nantian saw that Feng Wu had lowered her head. She was stiff, and there was a cold look in her eyes. He sighed and patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Kiddo, everything...”","Feng Wu didn’t reply. Right now, she was focused on treating the beautiful lady and Xiaoqi.","With her taut face, she gave off such a chilly air that no one dared to go near her.","It pained him to see her like this.","Luo Nantian was waiting in the main hall when Feng Wu came out.","“How’s your mother?” Luo Nantian asked.","Feng Wu was still furious. She hated herself for not being capable enough. Otherwise, she could have destroyed the entire Princess Royal’s manor! But now, she had to put up with it for a while!","Feng Wu took a deep breath and asked Luo Nantian, “Uncle, what happened back then? What’s the relationship between my mother and Feng Yanbing?","What role does Princess Royal play?”","Seeing the serious look on Feng Wu’s face, Luo Nantian couldn’t help but beckoned her over.","“Your mother would be more suitable to tell you that.”","“Mum has been crying nonstop.” Feng Wu shook her head. “Her head has been injured, and she only has the intelligence of a five-year-old. She has forgotten everything and knows nothing except for the pain...”","Tears welled up in Feng Wu’s eyes. “Feng Yanbing and the Princess Royal have crossed the line!”","“A five-year-old?!” Luo Nantian jumped to his feet.","Feng Wu’s mother was Lady Xuanji, formerly known as Luo Xuanji. She used to be the favorite daughter of the Luo family, but now...","Luo Nantian turned to Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin nodded. “Yes, that’s true...","It took Luo Nantian a while to digest the information. In the end, he told Feng Wu about what happened between Luo Xuanji and Feng Yanbing.","It turned out that Feng Yanbing had come to the Dayan Empire because of a special opportunity. Because he was still young and wasn’t as capable as the people of the Dayan Empire, he had a hard time and almost became a beggar.","Then, by sheer luck...","“I don’t know if it was a coincidence or a trap!” Luo Nantian snorted. “Your mother met your father, and she took him back home and made him her guard.","“Nominally, he’s a guard, but in fact, he’s not a guard at all. Feng Yanbing is a sweet talker and all about cajoling your mother. He’s devoted to her. He may look like an indomitable man, but in fact, he puts your mother first in everything. Back then, your mother was crazy in love, and all she wanted to do was to do her best for him.","“Your mother gave him all the resources she needed for her own cultivation, then stole more from us. In the end, she gave them all to him.","“That Feng Yanbing is indeed a talented cultivator, but he was able to make breakthroughs in the past few years mostly because your mother fed him with cultivation resources at all costs.","“Then, Feng Yanbing reached a bottleneck, and your mother was bold enough to steal the Dark Frost Immortal Pistil, the family clan’s ultimate treasure, for him. Our father needed it for his breakthrough! At the last moment of his cultivation, he almost lost his mind because of the lack of the Dark Frost Immortal Pistil! Although he was able to suppress it in the end, he was still injured.","“Our father has made many enemies over the years, and when they learned that he had failed his breakthrough, they joined hands and invaded the Luo family. Many members of the Luo family died because of it, and Father was severely","injured in the end..”"]},{"number":4186,"title":"Chapter 4186: You’re such a Father (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4186: You’re such a Father (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“He had no choice but to give his family an explanation. In the end, he kicked your mother out of the clan. “And even banished her from the Dayan Empire.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","How could her mother have been so foolish back then? How could she have been tricked by Feng Yanbing?","However, when she recalled Feng Yanbing’s face and his righteous reasoning, she realized that it would be a disaster for an innocent girl to run into such a person.","“You’re the ones who have taught my mother to be too kind and too naive.” Feng Wu shook her head.","Luo Zilin rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “You sound as if you didn’t protect your mother too much.”","Feng Wu said, “I...’","She couldn’t argue with that.","Who wouldn’t want to look after the beautiful lady? Feng Yanbing was the only scumbag that could fool her like this.","“Then what’s with the Princess Royal? Feng Yanbing came back to the Dayan Empire and became her husband. You should know that. Didn’t any of you react?”","“As for the Princess Royal... She has always been proud of her good looks, but ever since your mother came along, she became the prettiest girl, and no one praised the Princess Royal anymore. Therefore, the Princess Royal has always been jealous of your mother and resentful toward her.","“She was already married to the Murong family, and Feng Yanbing had been working as a cultivator in the princess’s residence. Somehow, the princess divorced the Murong family and married Feng Yanbing.”","Luo Zilin said, “Feng Yanbing also said that your mother died in childbirth.”","Feng Wu was furious. “Damn it!”","Luo Zilin nodded. “Father didn’t want to forgive your mother, nor did he allow us to ask around about her. Hence, the incident was put aside for so many years, which only made Feng Yanbing’s life easier.”","“But Feng Yanbing should never have taken your mother and brother away and used them to save Ning Er!”","Luo Nantian smacked the table angrily.","Feng Wu nodded and said, “Feng Yanbing is so unbelievable. My mother’s and Xiaoqi’s lives are nothing compared to his and Princess Royal’s Ning Er’s.","That’s just preposterous! I won’t let them off the hook for what they did!”","Heavenly Dao said, “You don’t know what you’re up against. Princess Royal is His Majesty’s sister and the only sister he has left. His Majesty is a very protective person. If she says she’s going to the palace to ask for help, she really will. ”","Feng Wu smirked. “I’d like to see them turn black into white!”","Feng Wu turned to leave after that.","“Where are you going?” Luo Zilin stopped Feng Wu.","“I need to cultivate,” Feng Wu said calmly. “If I were a peak Spiritual Sovereign today, I wouldn’t have to worry so much. I could have just killed Feng Yanbing. That way, I wouldn’t have to suffer like this!”","Feng Wu marched off after that.","Luo Zilin looked from Feng Wu to Luo Nantian in disbelief.","“Is she really going to kill...” Luo Zilin was surprised.","Luo Nantian’s face was livid as well. “Do they think they can hurt my family just like that? Luo Zilin!”","‘Yes!”","“Find Feng Yanbing’s travel route!”","“Yes!”","Although Luo Zilin had no idea what his father was up to, it was obvious that he wanted to avenge Feng Wu and her family.."]},{"number":4187,"title":"Chapter 4187: Conflicted Powers (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Her mother was the first to wake up. She was still muddle-headed and wouldn’t be able to explain herself. However, the more she tried, the more Feng Wu felt sorry for her.","Xiaoqi woke up a few days later as well.","He burst into tears as soon as he saw Feng Wu.","“Sister! ”","Feng Wu patted Xiaoqi on the back. “Don’t cry. I’m here. Tell me what happened.”","Xiaoqi finally calmed down and told Feng Wu what had happened.","Feng Wu was mostly right.","“He told me to call him Father!","“But if he told me to call him father, why did he cut my heart open? He even lied to me, saying that I could live without my heart!","“And there’s that Princess Royal. She’s been hurting, starving, and whipping Mother. Sister, I have to work on my cultivation and kill that woman!”","Xiaoqi went on and on. In the end, when he was exhausted, Feng Wu let him take the calming soup and go to bed.","Sitting on a stone bench in the courtyard, Feng Wu frowned and looked furious.","“Are you still mad?” Luo Zilin threw a robe over Feng Wu’s shoulders and sat down next to her. There was a sympathetic look in his eyes.","Feng Wu closed her eyes and clenched her fists. It took her a while to let go.","“I’ve never hated anyone so much,” Feng Wu said calmly. “Back in the Junwu","Empire, Zuo Qingluan destroyed my cultivation ability and stole my True Phoenix Blood, but I didn’t hate her like this. Feng Yanbing and his wife dared to hurt my mother and Xiaoqi like this. I won’t forgive them!”","Luo Zilin put a stack of paper in front of Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that?”","Luo Zilin said, “Feng Yanbing hurt your mother and Xiaoqi, but they also hurt my family. Do you think the Luo family will take it lying down? The Luo family is one of the four major clans and is as famous as the royal family. We helped them rise to the top back then, but now, they’re using the royal family to oppress us. That’s preposterous!","“Here’s the forces that the Princess Royal owns, and there are detailed records of everyone’s cultivation level. Remember this.","“I’d like to see if the royal family is going to protect the Princess Royal or abandon the Luo family!”","Feng Wu said, “Does my uncle know what you’re doing?”","After all, the Luo family was a well-connected family with many members. If they really went against the Dayan Empire, Feng Wu would be the culprit.","Luo Zilin patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Do you think we wouldn’t have gone against the royal family if this incident hadn’t happened? Kiddo, the princess is so arrogant because the royal family has fundamentally changed their approach to us.","“When the founding father took over the empire, he did promise that the Luo family would prosper for generations to come, but he killed all his lackeys. Over the years, as the Luo family declined and other forces rose, the Luo family tried to take back our power.","“But we can’t take it back just like that. No one wants to share what they’ve gained, and my family doesn’t want that either. That’s why we’ve been having conflicts with the royal family for a while.”","Feng Wu clenched her fists. According to what Luo Zilin said, as long as she could use the information well, she didn’t need to use force to kill the princess.","After all, she had annihilated the Zuo family and the Hua family when she wasn’t capable enough.."]},{"number":4188,"title":"Chapter 4188: Dragon Gate Banquet","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At that thought, Feng Wu was over the moon. Taking Luo Zilin’s hand, she asked, “So, what’s the situation now? Tell me.’","Luo Zilin nodded. “That’s what I want to talk to you about.”","“Although the royal family has declined, they’re still quite capable.","“Princess Royal and Lord Yan’s residence are on the same side, supporting the royal family.","“Apart from that, the Primordial Pagoda, the Formless Sword Sect, the Red","Feather Room, the Mountain Sea Academy, the Murong family, the Medicine God Valley, the Luo family, and the Sacred Mu Cliff all remain neutral and don’t want to get involved.","“Of course, that was before. Right now, the Princess Royal is trying to win people over. As far as we know, the Primordial Pagoda is the first to be won over.","“The latest news shows that the Murong family and the royal family have been very close recently. It seems that they’re going to form a marriage alliance.","“If the Murong family agrees to a marriage alliance, it’ll be disadvantageous to the rest of the forces and sects.”","Feng Wu asked, “Isn’t the marriage alliance between the royal family and the Murong family supposed to have dissolved after the marriage agreement between the Princess Royal and the Murong family was over? After what the Murong family has gone through, they still dare to form a marriage alliance with the royal family?”","Luo Zilin said, “Murong Changan died of an illness, so it wasn’t really a divorce. Her Royal Highness remarried after that, so it makes sense.”","Feng Wu asked, “Did Murong Changan die a normal death?”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “You’ve asked the same question as everyone else.”","Feng Wu said, “So?”","Luo Zilin said, “Murong Changan was the genius cultivator of the Murong family, and the genius died just like that. The Murong family would have sent someone to investigate it, but it passed without a trace. That was to say, they didn’t find any evidence against the princess.”","Resting her chin on her hands, Feng Wu sighed in regret.","“So, who’s getting married this time?”","Luo Zilin said, “His Majesty’s eldest daughter, Princess Xuezhen, and Murong","Linan of the Murong family.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Murong Linan? What’s his relationship with that","Murong Linhai I met on my way to the imperial capital?”","Luo Zilin said, “Murong Linan is in the same batch as me and Yan Yu. He’s Murong Linhai’s brother. He’s not to be underestimated. Even I may not be his match.”","Luo Zilin said seriously, “If the Murong family and the royal family really have a marriage alliance, it means that the royal family has found another powerful force. That way, the neutral group will become more and more passive.”","Feng Wu could only imagine what would happen to the Luo family if the royal family regained its power. She was a member of the Luo family now.","Feng Wu said, “What about the other forces? Are they going to let that marriage happen?”","Luo Zilin said, “No one from the main opposers is willing to step out. The","Sacred Mu Cliff used to be as powerful as the royal family, but Master Mu","Jiuzhou has been missing for years, and the sect has been without a leader. That’s why the royal family has been expanding.”","Mu Jiuzhou? Her beautiful master?","Feng Wu already had the first broken star piece, and the second one was stuck in the last trial. As for the third one... It was said that her third senior brother had it, but Feng Wu didn’t know where the fourth one was.","“Do you know what a broken star piece is?” Luo Zilin suddenly asked Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him in surprise.","Could this man read minds?","As soon as she thought about the broken star piece, Luo Zilin asked her. Feng Wu asked, “Do you know the broken star piece?”","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “Everyone in Dayan knows the broken star piece, and we just can’t get it. But there’s a chance.”","Feng Wu asked, “What chance?”","Luo Zilin said, “The Dragon Gate Banquet will be held in three months. On that day, the royal family will reward the winner of the banquet with the broken star piece.","“The engagement party between the princess and Murong Linan is right afterward.","“This broken star piece is a great treasure. It’s said to be made from Mu Jiuzhou’s soul. With it, one can comprehend Mu Jiuzhou’s soul. If they’re lucky enough, they’ll be able to inherit Master Mu Jiuzhou’s teachings...”","Feng Wu was more excited than Luo Zilin.","She didn’t know where the fourth broken star piece was at first, but she was relieved to know that it would show up three months later.","As long as she knew where it was, she didn’t have to run around like a headless chicken.","“I want this broken star piece,” Feng Wu said solemnly.","Luo Zilin was sipping his tea and choked on his own spit. He looked up and stared at Feng Wu. “What did you say?”","Feng Wu said, “I want this broken star piece. I have to have it.”","“Hey, kiddo, are you having hysteria or something? Do you know what this","Dragon Gate Banquet is? It’s the venue for the cultivators of my year such as","Murong Linan and Yan Yu. You’re still a kid, and you’re going to the next one.”","Feng Wu said, “No, I’m not! I’m going to the Dragon Gate Banquet this year, and I’m going to get that broken star piece!”","Luo Zilin rubbed his temples. He was only telling the girl a story, but he didn’t expect her to be so excited.","Luo Zilin said, “Do you know what the Dragon Gate Banquet is? Are you sure you can win?","Feng Wu said, “I’d like to hear about it..”"]},{"number":4189,"title":"Chapter 4189: Life in the Luo Family (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“The Dragon Gate Banquet is held once every three years. The winner will be rewarded by the emperor, as well as a cultivation manual.","“Apart from the broken star piece, do you know what else will be rewarded?”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What reward?” Luo Zilin said, “A princess.”","Feng Wu asked, “A princess? Which princess?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “Princess Xuezhen.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s not right. Didn’t you say that Princess Xuezhen was going to be engaged to Murong Linan?”","Luo Zilin gave Feng Wu a meaningful smile.","Feng Wu took the hint right away. “So, it’s been decided beforehand? Murong","Linan is going to be first this time?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “It’s very confidential. No more than five people know about it.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s so impressive. That’s the type of information that only those very close to the emperor...”","Luo Zilin said, “Shhh..","Feng Wu lowered her voice. “Yes, I understand.”","Luo Zilin said, “If the marriage alliance between the Murong family and the royal family succeeds, the Murong family will become the advance team of the royal family. Should we sabotage it?”","Feng Wu asked, “So, are you going to marry that princess instead?”","Luo Zilin said, “Don’t be ridiculous. Why would I want to marry a princess?”","Feng Wu asked, “What should we do, then?”","Luo Zilin said, “I thought you didn’t like the Princess Royal.”","Feng Wu smirked. “I don’t like her? I can’t wait to see her dead!”","Luo Zilin nodded. “The princess is in charge of contacting all forces, and she’s hosting the banquet herself. Don’t you think it’ll be interesting if something goes wrong?”","Feng Wu asked, “Brother, what do you have in mind?”","Luo Zilin whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear and looked very pleased. “Brother, what do you think? Isn’t it brilliant?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “It’s not enough. Far from it.”","Luo Zilin asked, “What do you suggest?”","Feng Wu’s eyes flickered, and she whispered something in Luo Zilin’s ear.","Luo Zilin’s eyes lit up, and he patted Feng Wu on the head. “You’re indeed a little genius. Princess Royal has always been invincible. She’s unlucky to run into you. But are you sure you won’t regret what you’re doing to Feng Yanbing?”","Feng Wu snorted. “My mother was the one who married Feng Yanbing first, but that Ning Er is only a year younger than me. What do you think of Feng Yanbing’s character? He’s beyond saving in my eyes. And there’s that Princess Royal. I wonder what she did to her previous husband... When I find out what happened, I’d like to see how she’s going to face the Murong family!”","Yes, in Feng Wu’s opinion, it was inevitable that the royal family would form an alliance with the Murong family through marriage, but what if they really could find out about the dead son-in-law of the Murong family? Feng Wu would like to see what the royal family would do.","Apart from cultivating, Feng Wu’s top priority after that was to find out how that previous husband died.","Feng Wu used up all the cultivation resources that she obtained on the Dynasty Road and finally made a breakthrough to the intermediate Spiritual Sovereign stage.","She was more capable than Luo Zilin now.","“Kiddo, kiddo!”","Just then, Luo Zilin rushed in with a smile on his face.","When he saw the spiritual essence around Feng Wu, he almost fell to the ground.. “You, you’ve made another breakthrough!”"]},{"number":4190,"title":"Chapter 4190: Life in the Luo Family (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded matter-of-factly.","“What do you mean by that nod’? Do you have any idea how terrifying you are now? You’ve made so many breakthroughs on the Dynasty Road. No, you’ve made so many breakthroughs before you even got on the Dynasty Road... No, there has to be something wrong with you!” Feng Wu said, “You’re just jealous.”","Luo Zilin asked, ‘What level are you now?”","Feng Wu said casually, “I’m an intermediate Spiritual Sovereign.”","Luo Zilin almost burst into tears. “Seriously? You’ve only been here for over a month. How can you make breakthroughs so fast? You’re already an intermediate Spiritual Sovereign? No, I don’t believe you! Just wait and see!” Feng Wu waited for him to come back.","Luo Zilin soon came back with Luo Zizhong, the second son of the Luo family.","Luo Zizhong followed him in.","“Zizhong, aren’t you an intermediate Spiritual Sovereign? Come and see Xiao Wu. She said she was an intermediate Spiritual Sovereign as well, but I don’t think so!” Luo Zilin looked excited.","He actually believed it, but he wasn’t sure.","He couldn’t sense Feng Wu’s true capability anymore. There was only one possibility, and that was that Feng Wu was already more capable than him.","Feng Wu greeted Luo Zizhong with a smile.","Luo Zizhong nodded at her with a smile, but the next second, his smile froze because he could sense the spiritual essence lingering around Feng Wu..","“You’re a Level-4 Spiritual Sovereign?” Luo Zizhong couldn’t believe his eyes.","He remembered clearly that the girl was only a Level-3 one when she arrived.","Feng Wu nodded with a smile. “That’s right. I made a breakthrough.”","Luo Zizhong looked back at Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin was at the peak of Level 3 and hadn’t reached Level 4 yet, so he was slightly inferior to Feng Wu.","“You’re right...” Luo Zilin drew in his breath. “Are you Mu Jiuzhou’s reincarnation? How can you make breakthroughs so fast? You’re killing me.”","Feng Wu hadn’t reached the Spiritual Sovereign stage when Luo Zilin first met her in the Junwu Empire. She was still a Spiritual Saint, but in less than six months...","“That’s outrageous...” Luo Zilin couldn’t believe that he had been overtaken.","The news of Feng Wu’s breakthrough soon spread out.","As one of the four major clans, the Luo family had many talented cultivators, but they had never met anyone like Feng Wu.","According to Luo Zilin, she had made five breakthroughs in six months.","“That’s impossible!”","“I don’t believe you.”","“I don’t believe it. More than five breakthroughs... That’s a bit over the top, isn’t","“However, she has indeed made two breakthroughs in less than two months since she came to the Luo family...”","Many people in the Luo family had been discussing it in secret, but they all agreed that Miss Feng Wu was as capable as the third young master of the Luo family.","If she kept making breakthroughs, they wondered if she would surpass the second young master.","Meanwhile, Luo Zilin was saying the same thing to Feng Wu.","He had accepted the fact that Feng Wu had surpassed him, so he urged Feng Wu. “Since you’re as capable as my third brother now, when are you going to surpass my second brother?” Feng Wu asked, “What level is he?”","“Level"]},{"number":4191,"title":"Chapter 4191: The Blood Pool (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4191: The Blood Pool (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Her third brother was a Level-4 one, and her second brother was a Level- 5 one.","“What about the eldest brother?”","“Level 6,” Luo Zilin replied.","“What about Feng Yanbing?” Feng Wu’s eyes were on the Princess Royal’s manor, and she wouldn’t let her mother and Xiaoqi suffer for nothing.","“He’s at either Level 6 or Level 7, isn’t he?” Luo Zilin paused and said, “You’re still at Level 4 now, and you’re still much weaker than him. Don’t be stubborn. You can’t take your revenge now.”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “If he’s a Level-7 one, I’m not that far behind him. But don’t worry. I won’t touch him before reaching Level 6.”","She was going to take revenge, not kill herself. If she really couldn’t win, why should she force herself to do it?","“Level 6...” Luo Zilin let out a breath of relief. It would take her at least a year.","Feng Wu asked, “Doesn’t the Luo family have any secret cultivation techniques?”","Luo Zilin stared at Feng Wu. “You’ve only just made a breakthrough. Can’t you take a break?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I can’t.”","The Princess Royal was relentless, and Feng Yanbing was annoying. Unfortunately, she wasn’t capable enough yet, and both her mother and Xiaoqi needed her protection.","“I have to reach Level 6, preferably Level 7, and surpass Feng Yanbing. Otherwise, I won’t be able to take it!” Feng Wu rose to her feet. “If you don’t tell me, I’ll go to my uncle.”","Luo Zilin grabbed Feng Wu’s hand in a hurry. “Hey, if you really want to make a breakthrough, the Luo family has mystic techniques. It’s just that... it depends on luck.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Tell me!”","Luo Zilin said, “The Luo family has a Dr?on Pool. It opens every three years, and only the most important members of the clan have a chance to enter it to absorb the spiritual crystals.","“But the Dragon Spiritual Crystal has a mind of its own, and not everyone can absorb it. Many people went inside for nothing because they would pass out after absorbing a little.","“But if you’re lucky enough... My eldest brother is the luckiest person of my generation. He has absorbed the Dragon Spiritual Crystal as big as a steamed bun, which has set a record for our generation.","Feng Wu said excitedly, “I’ll go! I may not be good at anything else, but I’m good at trying my luck.”","Luo Zilin asked, “Can you do it?”","Resting her hands on her waist, Feng Wu said, ‘My dear brother, have you forgotten about my glorious achievements on the Dynasty Road? I’m the daughter of destiny and the blessed child of God! No one can be luckier than I am!”","Luo Zilin asked, “Are you serious?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course!”","Luo Zilin said awkwardly, “However, the Dragon Spiritual Crystal depends on the purity of the Luo family’s bloodline. Since you’re not the child of a son, your bloodline won’t be as pure. The amount of Dragon Spiritual Crystal you can absorb is limited as well.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Luo Zilin said, “Of course. Otherwise, I would have told you already. I only didn’t mention it because your bloodline is too impure.”","“She might as well give it a go,” said a voice from a short distance away.","Turning around, Feng Wu saw that it was her eldest brother, Luo Zibo.","Feng Wu had always liked her big brother. Earlier in the princess’s residence, Luo Zibo had stood up for her and shielded her.","Luo Zibo walked up to Feng Wu with a smile and patted her on the head. “I heard that you’ve made another breakthrough. I’m afraid it won’t be long before you’re even better than me..”"]},{"number":4192,"title":"Chapter 4192: The Blood Pool (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4192: The Blood Pool (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “Brother, she’s been making breakthroughs so fast that I don’t think she’ll be able to make any progress for a while. After all, we still have to follow the rules of the world. Otherwise, she’ll be unbelievable.”","“Brother, Brother.” Feng Wu tugged at Luo Zibo’s sleeve. “Let me try the blood pool. I don’t care how pure my bloodline is. I’ll absorb as much as I can and make as much progress as I can. It doesn’t matter how small it is.”","No one could withstand Feng Wu’s wheedling.","“Alright, alright. I’ll take you to the registration office.” Luo Zibo patted Feng Wu on the head.","Luo Zibo had been there already, so he wasn’t going to participate this time. Apart from his three younger brothers, there were also some elite members of the younger generation.","A total of 15 people went in.","Luo Zibo walked them to the blood pool and said to the elder in charge, “We can start now.”","15 people stood in front of the blood pool.","The elder raised his eyebrows when he saw Feng Wu. “She’s not a member of the Luo family.”","Luo Zibo said, “My aunt’s child also has the bloodline of the Luo family, so it’s not against the rules.”","It wasn’t completely against the rules, but it wasn’t all by the book either.","There were two elders in charge, and they were named after “loyalty” and “righteousness”.","“Uncle Zhongren, my father has agreed,” said Luo Zilin. “Please let Xiao Wu in.”","Elder Zhongren frowned. “Even if she has the bloodline of the Luo family, it’s still very rare. She won’t be able to absorb much.”","Luo Zilin said, “I’ve said the same thing, but the girl said that it would be nice to absorb a little, so let her make up the numbers. She won’t be able to absorb much anyway. What do you think?”","Elder Zhongren and Elder Xinyi exchanged looks and both saw wry smiles on each other’s faces.","The Dragon Spiritual Crystals were extremely rare. They had been passed down from generation to generation, and there wasn’t much left. Therefore, they used them sparingly each time, fearing that they would waste a little. Back in the day, the Luo family didn’t open the pool every three years but every year.","However, Luo Zilin was right. The girl didn’t have the same surname, so she wouldn’t be able to absorb much. Since the head of the clan and the next head of the clan had spoken, they decided to do the girl a favor.","At that thought, the two elders nodded, and Elder Zhongren said, “Fine. Miss Feng Wu, please come over here. This is the furthest corner, and you won’t disturb anyone.”","Elder Zhongren was sure that Feng Wu would soon pass out.","The others didn’t say anything when they saw this. After all, the blood pool didn’t care about one’s cultivation talent or capability, but the purity of the Luo family’s bloodline. Therefore, although Feng Wu made faster breakthroughs than other people, she would be the first to be carried out of the blood pool.","“I wouldn’t be here if I were her,” said a low voice.","She was from a minor branch of the Luo family, but because of her talent, she had always been very popular in the family.","“She’ll absorb as much as she can. I’d like to see how much she can absorb. The size of a fingernail? Teehee —”","“Stop telling the truth. The Young Masters are displeased..”"]},{"number":4193,"title":"Chapter 4193: The Blood Pool (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4193: The Blood Pool (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Don’t tell the truth. The Young Masters are displeased,” a voice reminded them.","It was a young man known as the genius of the Luo family, a cousin of Luo Zilin’s branch.","Luo Zilin’s face darkened, and he threw a dirty look at the man. “Luo Ziheng, you talk too much!”","Although Luo Ziheng wasn’t as talented in cultivation as Luo Zilin and his brothers, he was already much better than the others, so he couldn’t help but feel proud.","He glanced at Luo Zilin, cupped his hands, and didn’t say another word. However, he didn’t try to hide the indignant look on his face.","Her surname wasn’t Luo, so how could she have the bloodline? Luo Ziheng didn’t like the sound of that at all.","Luo Zilin paid no attention to him. His gaze was already on Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu, don’t take it to heart.” Although Luo Zilin didn’t think that Feng Wu would have too pure a bloodline, he still tried to comfort her.","Feng Wu waved him off. “Don’t worry about it.”","Just then, Elder Zhongren said, “Silence!”","Feng Wu looked up.","Luo Zibo stood in the middle with Elder Zhongren on his left and Elder Xinyi on his right. Right now, Elder Zhongren was throwing the Dragon Spiritual Crystal into the blood pool.","Because almost everyone thought that Feng Wu was only there to make up the numbers, she was given the furthest spot away from the center of the blood pool.","The spiritual crystal was right at the center of the whirlpool.","Thump, thump, thump —","Elder Zhongren tossed three egg-sized Dragon Spiritual Crystals into the center of the whirlpool before saying loudly, “All of you will only have one chance to absorb the crystals in your lifetime, so do your best. Don’t worry. If you don’t have enough, we have more to put in.”","Everyone looked excited. After all, no matter how much spiritual essence they absorbed, they would become much more powerful.","Everyone activated their spiritual essence and tried their best to absorb the crystals.","At the same moment, Feng Wu —","Because the spiritual crystal was too far away from her, she couldn’t absorb much at first.","In the first hour, Luo Zilin and his brothers, who were the closest to the spiritual crystal, absorbed a lot of it.","One could observe how much everyone absorbed.","Where?","On the wall by the pool.","On the wall were fifteen bars that represented the 15 people who had participated in the absorption of the Dragon Spiritual Crystal.","A cylindrical projection represented a family member who had absorbed the Dragon Spiritual Crystal.","Through this cylindrical projection, one could clearly see the talent, willpower, tenacity, and so on of everyone in the family.","Luo Zizhong’s cylindrical form was the first of the 15 people.","Luo Ziji was the second.","Luo Zilin was the third.","“The three Young Masters are indeed very talented.” The two elders stroked their beards and smiled in satisfaction.","Luo Zibo nodded as well. It was only natural that his three younger brothers were ranked first. It would be a surprise if they weren’t among the top three.","“Wait.” Seeing the rising column, Luo Zibo smiled. “Luo Ziheng is indeed quite talented.”","Luo Ziheng was the teenager who had been scolded by Luo Zilin.","Stroking his beard, Elder Zhongren said unhurriedly, “He’s indeed very talented, but he needs to work on his temper before something goes wrong in the future..”"]},{"number":4194,"title":"Chapter 4194: The Blood Pool (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4194: The Blood Pool (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“And this is...","Elder Xinyi pointed at the lowest pillar and smiled bitterly. “Isn’t that Feng","Wu’s bar?”","After that, they all looked in Feng Wu’s direction.","In the furthest corner, Feng Wu was sitting cross-legged in the blood pool and absorbing the spiritual crystal with a serious look on her face.","Elder Zhongren couldn’t help but chuckle. “The cylindrical column is blank, which means that she hasn’t absorbed any of it yet. That stance is quite intimidating.”","This time, Luo Zibo didn’t know what to say.","Other people might not be as good, but they could at least absorb a little. Even Luo Guyu, who was next to Feng Wu, had a good score. She was already at the 15th mark.","As for Luo Zizhong, he was almost 30.","Feng Wu’s value was zero.","Luo Zibo rubbed his nose with a wry smile. He had thought that his cousin would get to 10 at least, but as it turned out, she had been stuck at zero.","No one knew how frustrated Feng Wu was.","She could absorb the Dragon Spiritual Crystal, but before she could transform them into her own spiritual essence, Little Phoenix took the opportunity. Feng Wu stared at it in resignation. “Hey, don’t try to take it from me.”","Little Phoenix pleaded with her, saying that it could only absorb the Dragon Spiritual Crystal she had transformed.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Little Phoenix didn’t reply. Instead, it made a breakthrough in front of Feng Wu after absorbing the Dragon Spiritual Crystal.","Feng Wu said, “Is this spiritual crystal so effective?!”","Little Phoenix nodded in excitement. “It’s so useful! Help me!”","What more did Feng Wu have to say? Little Phoenix was her assistant, and the stronger it was, the stronger she would be. Hence, Feng Wu focused on transforming the spiritual crystal into a spiritual essence for Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix absorbed the fast and efficiently. In a matter of minutes, the three crystals were all used up.","Luo Zilin was the first to open his eyes and frowned. “Elder Zhongren, the","Dragon Spiritual Crystal is used up.”","Elder Zhongren was surprised. “That’s impossible. Three years ago, you didn’t even use up all three Dragon Spiritual Crystals, and there were still some left. You’ve used them all in less than an hour.”","Luo Zilin smiled bitterly, but before he could say anything, Luo Zizhong said anxiously, “Brother, we need more Dragon Spiritual Crystals!”","Luo Zibo looked around and sensed the spiritual crystal. He was elated when he said, “Elder, there really isn’t any left. They’ve absorbed it all.”","The two elders looked at each other. Although it pained them to put in more, they were over the moon, for it meant that the younger generation of the Luo family was very talented.","Elder Zhongyi put in two Dragon Spiritual Crystals to suppress his excitement before saying, “Cultivate as much as you want. I’m sure you’ll have enough.","There’s more if you need.”","Hence, they closed their eyes and resumed their cultivation.","In less than five minutes...","“Elder, we’re out of spiritual crystals again.” Luo Zilin had no choice but to break free from his cultivation and said in dissatisfaction, “Interruptions from time to time like this will affect our cultivation. Elder Zhongyi, can’t you do it more often?”","Gone again? How? The two elders exchanged looks before looking at Luo Zibo in unison.","Luo Zibo also realized that something wasn’t right.."]},{"number":4195,"title":"Chapter 4195: Not a Family Member (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zibo also realized that something wasn’t right. He glanced at Luo Zilin and the others in bewilderment and saw that they were still cultivating. Hence, he said to the two elders, “The more they absorb, the more talented they will become. That’s a good thing.”","The two elders were very reluctant at first, but after hearing what Luo Zibo said, they realized that he was right.","Hence, Elder Zhongren said, “Then...”","“Bring a box.” Luo Zibo looked expectant. “We may have a big surprise this time.”","“Good!”","Elder Zhongren left and came back in a hurry.","He really came back with a box of spiritual crystals.","Luo Zibo put three crystals in, but they were soon absorbed.","Luo Zibo was elated and put another three in.","The Luo family had planned to use the box of spiritual crystals for a hundred years, but they had used up most of them in such a short time.","“Young Master...” Elder Zhongren was almost in tears. “Are we still going to put more in?”","Luo Zibo also had a bad feeling, but at that moment, Luo Zilin opened his eyes and shouted, “Brother, you’re so stingy! Just give us more!”","Luo Zibo was speechless.","Thump, thump, thump —","The remaining half of the box was poured into the vortex. Meanwhile, Feng Wu was talking to Little Phoenix.","“Rookie, can you do it or not?”","Right now, Little Phoenix looked like it had been drinking. It swayed back and forth in Feng Wu’s ring space and could barely stand still.","“Hic","Little Phoenix burped, then said to Feng Wu, “That’s enough... I... I’m drunk...” Thump!","Little Phoenix lay on its back and let out a long breath. It seemed to have fallen asleep.","Feng Wu was already used to Little Phoenix’s cultivation method. It could make breakthroughs in its sleep, and after it went to bed, it would probably make another breakthrough. Sometimes, Feng Wu really envied Little Phoenix for its way of cultivation.","Now that the little problem was solved, she could resume her cultivation.","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that Luo Zibo was frowning as he watched the bar that represented Feng Wu’s absorption of the Dragon Spiritual Crystal.","During this period, people kept passing out in the blood pool, which meant that they had finished absorbing the energy and couldn’t go back in. Therefore, the elders began to dig them out and put them on a stone tablet by the bank.","Luo Guyu, the girl next to Feng Wu, finally passed out.","In the end, Luo Ziheng was carried ashore.","Feng Wu and the three brothers were the only ones left.","“Wait, why is that girl still zero?” Elder Zhongyi frowned. “Can’t she absorb any of it? Is she still a member of the Luo family? Is she...”","Luo Zibo shouted angrily.","The elders were of a senior generation, and Luo Zibo couldn’t scold them. However, he was the next head of the Luo family, and Elder Zhongyi frowned even more.","Elder Zhongyi didn’t say anything else, but the news somehow got around.","“What?”","Luo Nantian heard the news and immediately headed for the blood pool.","The girl couldn’t even absorb a tiny bit of the Dragon Spiritual Crystal? That was impossible.."]},{"number":4196,"title":"Chapter 4196: Not a Family Member (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Feng Wu looked so much like her mother that it was only natural that she was the daughter of the Luo family.","What they didn’t know was that such secret information was usually the fastest to get around.","The entire Luo family heard about it when Luo Nantian heard about it.","In the blood pool.","“Father? Why are you here?”","Seeing his father, Luo Zibo immediately went up to him.","“I’m here to have a look.”","Crossing his hands behind his back, Luo Nantian looked up at the wall and saw that the round column that represented Feng Wu was indeed zero. It had remained where it was.","By then, Luo Zizhong had reached 80.","Luo Ziji’s score was 70.","Luo Zilin’s score was 60.","“Why is she...” Luo Nantian frowned.","Luo Zibo said in resignation, “I’ve been keeping an eye on her. Her value hasn’t changed at all. It’s as if she hasn’t absorbed anything.”","Elder Zhongren wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he gritted his teeth and said, “Master, is she not a member of the Luo family?” Luo Zibo said, “Bullshit! Xiao Wu looks so much like my aunt!”","Elder Zhongren said, “Is it possible that Lady Xuanji...’","“Shut up! You’re making things up!” Luo Nantian was furious as well. At first, the elder only suspected that Xiao Wu wasn’t a member of the Luo family, but now, he even suspected her mother.","However, the fact was right in front of them, and many people still preferred to see what they saw.","Just then, someone cried out in surprise.","“It’s moving! It’s moving!”","What was moving? Everyone was confused.","“The wall! Miss Wu’s bar is moving! It’s moving upward!”","Luo Nantian was the first to turn around. It was true, although she only managed to make a “1” with much difficulty.","Xiao Wu might not have much bloodline, but she was still a member of the Luo family!","At that thought, Luo Nantian threw a dirty look at Elder Zhongren.","Elder Zhongren let out a breath of relief as well. As long as it was the bloodline of the Luo family, he was glad to hear that. However, he had to admit that the Luo family bloodline was indeed too thin. That was a first.","Elder Zhongren didn’t expect him to blurt out those words.","Both Luo Zibo and Luo Nantian stared at him.","Elder Zhongren said, “I didn’t say anything wrong.”","Just then, someone cried out. “It’s moving! It’s moving again! It’s moving so","Why were they so excited?","Everyone looked back at the wall.","They were dumbfounded.","The column representing Feng Wu was moving upward at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Ten.","Twenty.","Thirty.","Forty.","Fifty.","“W- What’s going on? Why is her score suddenly soaring? That’s impossible!” Elder Zhongren was the first to cry out.","It was only one a moment ago, but she had made fifty in the blink of an eye! Even Luo Zilin, the supposed cultivation genius, had only made it to sixty.","“It’s still rising!”","“It’s 60! That’s more than Luo Zilin!”","Meanwhile, Luo Zilin had also risen to 70.","Elder Zhongren let out a breath of relief, but the next second!","“Miss Wu’s score has gone up again. She’s 70 now!”","That wasn’t all.."]},{"number":4197,"title":"Chapter 4197: Increase (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4197: Increase (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“No, it’s not 70! It’s 80 now!” “80? Young Master Ziji is 80 as well. They’re the same now!”","Everyone was astonished.","Only then did Luo Nantian let out a breath of relief. Rubbing his chin, he chuckled. “I knew it. She’s so talented. How can she have zero points? What a pleasant surprise.”","Luo Zibo was happy for Feng Wu as well, for he knew how much Feng Wu hated him, and he also knew that she had to protect her mother and brother.","By then, Luo Zilin and Luo Zizhong had left the pool, and Luo Ziji and Feng Wu were the only ones left inside.","They were both doing their best to absorb the spiritual crystal.","When Luo Zilin opened his eyes, he was surprised to see the two people in the blood pool. “Is the girl still not out?”","Luo Zibo nodded.","Luo Zilin said, “She’s more persistent than I am. What a strange girl.”","He checked the numbers on the wall as he spoke and mumbled, “What can she do? Her bloodline of the Luo family...”","Luo Zilin stopped abruptly when he saw Feng Wu’s number.","Luo Zibo patted him on the shoulder and comforted his younger brother.","“No, no way. How can she be like this?” Luo Zilin looked at Luo Zibo in bewilderment. “Brother, has something gone wrong?”","The others looked at him and shook their heads.","Luo Zilin didn’t know what to say. So, the girl had a purer bloodline than him, a core member of the Luo family, and she had absorbed more Dragon Spiritual Crystals?","Just then, Feng Wu frowned, for she couldn’t sense the spiritual essence of the Dragon Spiritual Crystal anymore.","“Is the girl coming out?” Luo Zilin asked involuntarily.","However, Luo Nantian told Luo Zibo, “Go fetch a box of the spiritual crystals.”","Take... a box?!","Everyone drew in their breaths.","“Master!”","As soon as Elder Zhongren spoke, Luo Nantian silenced him.","“The Luo family will provide as many spiritual crystals as we can. They still have some potential. Just put the Dragon Spiritual Crystals in.”","But it was a box of Dragon Spiritual Crystals, which could last the members of the Luo family for a hundred years. The two elders were having a headache.","“85! Ziji is 85!” Luo Zilin was pleasantly surprised.","“Feng Wu is 85, too! That girl is incredible.”","Just then, Luo Ziji couldn’t hold on anymore and fainted in the blood pool.","Luo Zilin went in to fetch him and put him on the bank.","“We don’t need to put in more spiritual crystals, do we?” Elder Zhongren asked Luo Nantian.","However, Luo Nantian shook his head and turned to look at Feng Wu.","Elder Zhongren said involuntarily, “That girl is about as talented as the second young master. Since he has passed out, I’m afraid she’ll pass out in the next second.”","However, Luo Nantian shook his head again. “No, she’s still a long way from","that. ”","What did that mean?","Luo Nantian gestured at Luo Zibo to continue putting the spiritual crystal and the Dragon Spiritual Crystal into the blood pool.","Under the two elders’ intimidating gazes, Luo Zibo put one in tentatively.","However, the spiritual crystal was instantly absorbed.","Before she knew it, Feng Wu had floated to the center of the pool, which was the closest to the spiritual crystal.","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Luo Zibo tentatively threw in two more.."]},{"number":4198,"title":"Chapter 4198: Increase (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4198: Increase (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Right now, Feng Wu looked like she was starving. In a matter of seconds, she had devoured two of the spiritual crystals.","Luo Zibo’s eyes widened in surprise, and so did the others.","“Again!”","Before they knew it, Luo Nantian had crouched down and was staring at Feng","Wu with his bright eyes as if he was fighting back his excitement.","“Alright.” Luo Nantian stopped talking and kept putting more Dragon Spiritual Crystals into the vortex.","The others all held their breaths, fearing that they might disturb Feng Wu.","Luo Zilin lowered his voice in excitement.","They looked at the numbers on the wall and saw that it was indeed...","Luo Ziji stopped at 85, but Feng Wu was already 90.","“More! Now!” Luo Nantian reminded the others.","Elder Zhongren and Elder Xinyi exchanged looks. In the end, Elder Zhongren spoke first. “Our master used to have a score of 100, didn’t he?” “That’s right. 100 is our family’s best record in the past 100 years.”","“Old Master’s value was 150 back then.”","“You said so yourself, but the purity of the Luo family’s bloodline has dropped as time goes by...’","Just then, someone cried out, “100!”","The two elders looked at each other and both saw disbelief in each other’s eyes. 100? How was that possible? Even the sons of the Luo family couldn’t reach 100, let alone a cousin...","“110!” “115!”","Gosh!","The two elders were thrilled. 115?","They weren’t alone. Luo Zilin’s eyes popped as he murmured, “No way! What’s she doing? Is she insane?”","His two brothers looked at Feng Wu in amazement as well. “She’s 115 now. A little more and she’ll be 120! Dad, our Luo family’s Luo Dragon Cultivation Technique...”","According to Luo Nantian, the purer the blood of the Luo family, the more successful the cultivation technique would be.","Luo Nantian was shaking with excitement as he shouted, “Keep going! Keep going! ”","“120!”","The crowd was so excited that they were almost in tears.","“125!”","Luo Nantian clenched his fists and took a deep breath. This kid was going to be the pride of his family!","“130!","Oh god... Luo Zilin and his brothers looked at each other and were shocked.","It was said that the bloodline of the Luo family was getting thinner with each generation. Had the girl drunk the first generation of the Luo family’s blood? How else could she...","“140!”","“I think I’m going to pass out.” Luo Zilin took a deep breath. “I thought the girl could only get a 10, but she’s already so much better than me, and she’s still rising!”","“150!”","Luo Zilin wanted to vomit blood.","“160!”","Everyone in the Luo family was speechless.","“Father, is that number correct? Is it accurate?” Luo Zilin couldn’t believe his eyes.","Luo Nantian stared at Feng Wu. “She still has potential!”","In the end, Feng Wu’s score stopped at 165.","Feng Wu swayed. Just when everyone thought that she was going to pass out, she began to make a breakthrough.","A Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign!","A Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign!","She made two breakthroughs in a row.","“No way!!!”"]},{"number":4199,"title":"Chapter 4199: 165, Level 6","paragraphs":["Chapter 4199: 165, Level 6","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Her number was 165, and she had reached Level 6?!","Everyone was astonished when they saw the data, and even Luo Nantian was dazed for a while...","“This girl is so...”","Luo Zibo helped Luo Nantian to his feet, and the latter waved at the others.","“You guys can leave now. Don’t disturb her cultivation.”","Everyone left, leaving only Luo Nantian behind.","Luo Nantian studied Feng Wu for a long while before he smiled. “People say that although the Luo family has a lot of male heirs, we’re still lacking a talented heir. But...","Shortly after Luo Nantian came out, Luo Zilin ran up to him. “Father!”","Luo Nantian stopped and looked back at him.","Luo Zilin said, “Father, is Xiao Wu really a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign now?”","Luo Nantian nodded.","Luo Zilin looked confused.","He had talked to Feng Wu before he entered the pool. What did he say?","“Kiddo, you’re a Level-4 Spiritual Sovereign now, and you’re as capable as Brother Zizhong. I wonder when you’ll be as capable as Brother Ziji.”","His second brother was a Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign.","But now, the girl had reached Level 6, which meant that she was as capable as Luo Zibo.","Luo Zilin wanted to cry. “Why is she so efficient? She wasn’t even in the","Spiritual Sovereign stage when we were in the Junwu Empire. She was so much weaker than me...”","Back then, he used to look at the girl as if she was his junior. He loved to tease her.","“You’ve made some progress in the blood pool. You’re a Level-4 Spiritual Sovereign now. Keep up the good work.” Luo Nantian patted Luo Zilin on the shoulder and left with a smile.","With a genius like Feng Wu, of course, he was happy.","“Father, where are you going?” Luo Zilin suddenly asked.","“I’m so glad to hear the news, and it’s worth having a drink.” Putting his hands behind his back, Luo Nantian left happily.","“Father, where did you go?” Luo Zizhong arrived in a hurry.","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “I’m sure he’s going to have a drink with the principal of the Mountain Sea Academy. He’s showing off.”","Luo Zizhong smiled. “The principal has been showing off his eldest pupil in front of our father. Now that we have a genius like Xiao Wu, of course, Father has to return the favor.”","“By the way, why are you here?” Luo Zilin asked.","Luo Zizhong suddenly remembered. “Hey, the Princess Royal has sent someone.”","The Princess Royal?","The mention of that name almost made Luo Zilin jump.","“How dare they? Who’s coming? I’ll go get them!” Rolling up his sleeves, Luo Zilin rushed into the front yard.","The Luo family had been holding grudges against the Princess Royal for what happened earlier.","“They’re here before we can get to them! That’s ridiculous!” Luo Zilin was getting angrier.","Luo Zizhong said, “The princess’s husband is here.”","Luo Zilin said, “What husband? It’s Feng Yanbing, isn’t it? The Princess Royal isn’t here?”","Luo Zizhong nodded. “He’s the only one here. He’s sitting in the main hall and wants to see Xiao Wu.”","Luo Zilin asked, “Where’s Brother Zibo?”","Luo Zizhong said, “He seemed to have gained some enlightenment when Xiao","Wu made the breakthrough. He’s comprehending the Cliff of Thought now.”","Luo Zilin immediately said, “We can’t disturb him with that. He’s been stuck at Level 6 for a long time, and this is a rare opportunity. Maybe he’ll make a breakthrough. Xiao Wu is so lucky, and she can bring good luck to other people..”"]},{"number":4200,"title":"Chapter 4200: Father","paragraphs":["Chapter 4200: Father","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s go have a look.” Luo Zilin quickly walked into the main hall.","In the main hall, Luo Er glared at Feng Yanbing and said coldly, “Xiao Wu is busy. I don’t think she’ll be able to come out today. Please leave.”","However, Feng Yanbing remained seated and showed no sign of leaving. He only said indifferently, “I’m not going back until I see Xiao Wu today.”","They were at a stalemate when Luo Zilin came out. He smirked when he saw Feng Yanbing. “Feng Yanbing, what are you doing here today? Are you here to see Xiao Wu?”","Feng Yanbing asked coldly, “Where is she?”","Luo Zilin shook his head. “Before you ask her where I am, you have to answer something for me.”","Feng Yanbing asked, “What question?”","Luo Zilin sat down on a chair and sneered at Feng Yanbing. “Why do you want to see Xiao Wu today?”","Feng Yanbing pursed his lips and didn’t say a word.","Luo Zilin said, “If you don’t tell me, Xiao Wu won’t be here.”","It was obvious that Feng Wu wouldn’t show up if Feng Yanbing didn’t tell the truth.","“My surname is Feng, and I’m her father. Why should I tell you why I want to see her?!” Feng Yanbing jumped to his feet, but Luo Zilin and his brothers stood in front of him, showing no sign of backing down.","After the Dragon Blood Pool, Luo Ziji wasn’t much weaker than Feng Yanbing anymore. Hence, the pressure Feng Yanbing exerted wasn’t able to hurt him at all.","“You...” Feng Yanbing frowned a little. The three brothers had made significant progress in the past few days, which was unbelievable.","But this was the Luo family, after all, and Feng Yanbing didn’t dare to act recklessly. He said coldly, “Nothing. I want to see my daughter, that’s all.” Before Luo Zilin could say anything, he heard a voice behind him.","“Who wants to see me?”","It was Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu?” Luo Zilin asked involuntarily. “Why are you here?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Someone insists on seeing me. He wouldn’t leave if I didn’t come here.”","Feng Yanbing didn’t like their tones at all.","Feng Yanbing looked displeased, but when he recalled what he was here for today, he took a deep breath and fought back his anger. He then turned to Feng Wu with a smile on his face. “Xiao Wu, I see that you’re here. Let’s find a quiet place, and I’ll tell you everything.”","“Don’t. Let’s talk here.” Feng Wu picked up a chair and sat down. She then glanced at Feng Yanbing. “Speak.”","Feng Yanbing looked from the three brothers to the indifferent Feng Wu and frowned. “Is that your attitude when I speak to you?”","Feng Wu darted an indifferent glance at Feng Yanbing. “After everything you’ve done, I’m only giving you the chance to meet me because I’m pretty and kind, okay?”","Feng Yanbing said, ‘You!”","Feng Wu waved her hands impatiently. “If you don’t want to tell me, don’t. I didn’t ask you to come here. If you want to leave, go ahead. I’m busy with my cultivation.”","Feng Wu’s attitude infuriated Feng Yanbing.","“What did the Luo family do to you? How did they slander me? They’re... unbelievable!” Feng Yanbing grabbed Feng Wu’s arm. “Come with me to the princess’s residence.. I’ll teach you a lesson!”"]}]);
